{"type":"assistant/message","seq":27,"time":1793889868175,"data":{"turn":1,"step":1,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"用户要求设计项目前端界面，先用 HTML 方式给初版样例，然后再调整。\n\n首先我需要了解项目背景。当前工作目录是 /home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web。我应该先看看这个项目里有什么，了解需求。\n\n按照技能系统提醒，这是创意工作（设计前端界面），应该先用 brainstorming 技能。同时，using-superpowers 说在开始任何对话前要调用技能。让我先加载 brainstorming 和 frontend-design 技能。\n\n同时先探索项目目录了解背景。\n\n让我并行调用：skill(brainstorming)、skill(frontend-design)、bash 查看目录。\n\n不过 skill 工具一次只能调一个名字。但可以在同一个消息里发多个 tool call。是的，可以并行调用多个 skill。\n\n先看项目结构。"},{"type":"text","text":"我先了解项目背景，并加载相关设计规范。"},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_97pdhcL3mPvy8D5SQQyM0390","name":"bash","arguments":"{\"description\": \"List project root contents\", \"command\": \"ls -la && echo \\\"---\\\" && cat package.json 2>/dev/null | head -60\"}"},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_01_nU3HZreeF3JXa5ALnwOn6998","name":"skill","arguments":"{\"name\": \"brainstorming\"}"},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_02_1p2hEK78zLB9HrWc6faA2665","name":"skill","arguments":"{\"name\": \"frontend-design\"}"}],"source":{"kind":"model","provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-flash","replayState":{"response":{"kind":"deepseek-messages","version":1,"model":"deepseek-flash"},"blocks":[{"type":"reasoning","signature":"2ce0feab-7594-4637-8c95-218ac728e984"},{"type":"text"},{"type":"tool-call"},{"type":"tool-call"},{"type":"tool-call"}]}},"id":"3a9653d4-6810-4ec9-b28f-13b7fce53124"},"usage":{"inputTokens":3233,"outputTokens":311,"cacheReadTokens":11008,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":14552},"stream":[{"type":"chunk","time":1793889866353,"chunk":{"type":"block-start","index":0,"blockType":"reasoning"}},{"type":"reasoning-chunks","time0":1793889866759,"index":0,"dt":[62,14,0,21,0,0,0,12,0,0,15,0,0,0,0,15,0,19,0,13,0,16,0,15,0,18,0,0,0,15,0,15,0,0,0,16,1,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,13,0,1,16,0,18,0,0,27,0,0,22,1,0,12,0,16,1,23,0,0,29,1,0,0,8,1,15,16,19,1,0,0,18,14,0,0,0,0,14,16,0,0,0,17,14,0,25,0,7,0,20,0,8,0,0,0,0,14