"| `ChatComposer` | 输入、附件、发送/停止、快捷键 |"},{"number":69,"text":""},{"number":70,"text":"### 状态"},{"number":71,"text":""},{"number":72,"text":"| 状态 | 表现 |"},{"number":73,"text":"|---|---|"},{"number":74,"text":"| 空会话 | 欢迎语 + 能力标签（知识库/远程 Agent/审批） |"},{"number":75,"text":"| 流式中 | 助手气泡显示光标；发送按钮变为「停止」 |"},{"number":76,"text":"| 工具执行 | 时间线插入工具卡片，状态 running → ok/error |"},{"number":77,"text":"| A2A 任务 | 卡片显示状态机与进度；失败可展开错误 |"},{"number":78,"text":"| 审批 | 输入区上方弹出审批卡片，阻止继续发送 |"},{"number":79,"text":"| 断线 | 顶部提示 + 自动重连；重连后同步 run 状态 |"},{"number":80,"text":"| 错误 | 气泡内错误卡片 + 重试按钮 |"},{"number":81,"text":""},{"number":82,"text":"### 交互细节"},{"number":83,"text":""},{"number":84,"text":"- 发送后立即插入用户消息（乐观更新），服务端返回 `message.created` 后替换临时 ID；"},{"number":85,"text":"- `message.delta` 合并渲染（每帧最多一次）；"},{"number":86,"text":"- 滚动：用户上滑时暂停自动滚动，显示「回到底部」按钮；"},{"number":87,"text":"- 停止：调用 `POST /runs/{run_id}/cancel`，已生成内容保留；"},{"number":88,"text":"- 重新生成：对最后一条助手消息提供「重新生成」（M4）；"},{"number":89,"text":"- Markdown：代码块高亮、表格、复制按钮；禁止原始 HTML。"},{"number":90,"text":""},{"number":91,"text":"### 接口"},{"number":92,"text":""},{"number":93,"text":"`POST /chat/stream`（SSE）、`GET /conversations`、`GET /conversations/{id}/messages`、`POST /runs/{run_id}/cancel`、`POST /approvals/{id}/decision`。"},{"number":94,"text":""},{"number":95,"text":"## 4. 会话页 `/conversations`"},{"number":96,"text":""},{"number":97,"text":"| 项 | 说明 |"},{"number":98,"text":"|---|---|"},{"number":99,"text":"| 列表 | 标题、最近消息时间、消息数、状态 |"},{"number":100,"text":"| 筛选 | 全部/活跃/归档；按标题搜索（M4） |"},{"number":101,"text":"| 操作 | 打开（跳 `/chat?conversation=...`）、重命名、归档、删除 |"},{"number":102,"text":"| 详情 | 点击展开运行记录（耗时、token、失败原因） |"},{"number":103,"text":"| 接口 | `GET/PATCH/DELETE /conversations[...]` |"},{"number":104,"text":""},{"number":105,"text":"## 5. 智能体页 `/agents`"},{"number":106,"text":""},{"number":107,"text":"| 项 | 说明 |"},{"number":108,"text":"|---|---|"},{"number":109,"text":"| 列表 | 名称、URL、协议版本、技能数、健康状态、启用开关 |"},{"number":110,"text":"| 注册 | URL → 拉取 Agent Card → 预览（名称/描述/技能/鉴权）→ 确认 |"},{"number":111,"text":"| 详情抽屉 | 原始 Agent Card、技能列表、最近调用、鉴权配置（密钥只填引用） |"},{"number":112,"text":"| 操作 | 刷新 Card、健康检查、启用/禁用、删除 |"},{"number":113,"text":"| 状态 | 注册中/失败（展示校验错误）、unhealthy 标记 |"},{"number":114,"text":"| 接口 | `GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE /agents`、`/refresh`、`/health` |"},{"number":115,"text":""},{"number":116,"text":"## 6. 任务页 `/tasks`"},{"number":117,"text":""},{"number":118,"text":"| 项 | 说明 |"},{"number":119,"text":"|---|---|"},{"number":120,"text":"| 列表 | 任务 ID（短）、远程 Agent、状态、耗时、所属会话 |"},{"number":121,"text":"| 筛选 | 状态、Agent、时间范围 |"},{"number":122,"text":"| 详情 | 请求摘要、Artifact、错误、状态时间线 |"},{"number":123,"text":"| 实时 | 对话进行中通过 SSE 更新；列表页可轮询（M6 评估 SSE） |"},{"number":124,"text":"| 操作 | 取消（仅 working/submitted）、跳转所属会话 |"},{"number":125,"text":"| 接口 | `GET /tasks`、`GET /tasks/{id}`、`POST /tasks/{id}/cancel` |"},{"number":126,"text":""},{"number":127,"text":"## 7. 知识库页 `/knowledge`"},{"number":128,"text":""},{"number":129,"text":"| 项 | 说明 |"},{"number":130,"text":"|---|---|"},{"number":131,"text":"| 文档列表 | 标题、分类、状态、块数、更新时间 |"},{"number":132,"text":"| 上传 | 拖拽文件或粘贴文本；异步入库，轮询/SSE 展示进度 |"},{"number":133,"text":"| 检索调试 | 输入问题 → 命中片段、分数、来源；可复制 |"},{"number":134,"text":"| 操作 | 重建单个文档/全量、删除 |"},{"number":135,"text":"| 状态 | pending/indexing/ready/failed，失败可重试 |"},{"number":136,"text":"| 接口 | `POST/GET/DELETE /knowledge/documents`、`POST /knowledge/search`、`POST /knowledge/rebuild` |"},{"number":137,"text":""},{"number":138,"text":"## 8. 设置页 `/settings`"},{"number":139,"text":""},{"number":140,"text":"| 区块 | 内容 |"},{"number":141,"text":"|---|---|"},{"number":142,"text":"| 账号 | 展示名、邮箱、修改密码、退出登录 |"},{"number":143,"text":"| 模型 | 当前模型、温度、超时（只读，来自 `/system/info`） |"},{"number":144,"text":"| A2A | 本服务 Agent Card 地址、复制、入站鉴权状态 |"},{"number":145,"text":"| 界面 | 主题（浅色/深色，M6）、语言、消息密度 |"},{"number":146,"text":"| 关于 | 版本、构建时间、文档链接 |"},{"number":147,"text":""},{"number":148,"text":"## 9. 响应式与可访问性"},{"number":149,"text":""},{"number":150,"text":"- 桌面优先，≥1280px 三栏（导航 + 会话 + 聊天），900–1280px 两栏，<900px 抽屉；"},{"number":151,"text":"- 键盘可达：所有操作有 focus 样式；发送 `Enter`、换行 `Shift+Enter`、关闭弹层 `Esc`；"},{"number":152,"text":"- 颜色对比度 ≥ WCAG AA；状态不只靠颜色表达（配文字/图标）；"},{"number":153,"text":"- 流式内容使用 `aria-live=\"polite\"`，避免打断读屏。"},{"number":154,"text":""},{"number":155,"text":"## 10. 通用状态组件"},{"number":156,"text":""},{"number":157,"text":"| 组件 | 用途 |"},{"number":158,"text":"|---|---|"},{"number":159,"text":"| `PagePlaceholder` | 骨架阶段占位（规划，当前未实现） |"},{"number":160,"text":"| `EmptyState` | 空列表/空会话 |"},{"number":161,"text":"| `ErrorState` | 页面级错误 + 重试 |"},{"number":162,"text":"| `LoadingSkeleton` | 列表/详情加载 |"},{"number":163,"text":"| `ConfirmDialog` | 删除/取消等危险操作二次确认 |"}],"totalLines":163,"lang":"md"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[46],"surfaceOp":"append"}
{"type":"tool/result","seq":49,"time":1793889871820,"data":{"turn":1,"step":3,"message":{"role":"tool","source":{"kind":"tool","callId":"call_01_ee4YQuGfgqehtfZ3OnLX2848"},"toolCallId":"call_01_ee4YQuGfgqehtfZ3OnLX2848","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<path>/home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/architecture.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # 前端架构\n2: \n3: - 项目：Agent Hub Web（`agent-hub-web`）\n4: - 状态：设计稿；当前仅有 create-vue 脚手架配置，页面与请求层未实现\n5: - 更新时间：2026-11-04\n6: \n7: ## 1. 目标\n8: \n9: 1. 提供流畅的多轮对话工作台，SSE 流式渲染回答与任务进度；\n10: 2. 让用户管理远程 A2A 智能体、知识库与审批；\n11: 3. 与后端契约解耦：类型集中在 `src/types/`，页面不直接拼 URL；\n12: 4. 保持工程化基线：TypeScript 严格模式、ESLint/Prettier、可构建、可测试（后续补 Vitest）。\n13: \n14: ## 2. 技术架构\n15: \n16: ```mermaid\n17: flowchart TB\n18:     subgraph Browser[\"浏览器\"]\n19:         V[\"views 页面\"]\n20:         C[\"components 展示组件\"]\n21:         S[\"stores (Pinia)\"]\n22:         A[\"api 模块\"]\n23:         X[\"api/client.ts<br/>axios 实例\"]\n24:         E[\"composables/useSSE<br/>fetch-event-source\"]\n25:         T[\"types 契约类型\"]\n26:     end\n27: \n28:     V --> C\n29:     V --> S\n30:     V --> A\n31:     A --> X\n32:     V --> E\n33:     S --> A\n34:     C --> T\n35:     A --> T\n36:     S --> T\n37:     X -->|REST /api/v1| BE[\"agent-hub 后端\"]\n38:     E -->|SSE /chat/stream| BE\n39: ```\n40: \n41: ## 3. 分层职责\n42: \n43: > 下表是规划目标；当前仓库只有 `src/main.ts`、`src/App.vue`、`src/router/index.ts`，\n44: > 其余目录为空占位（`.gitkeep`），尚未创建对应实现。\n45: \n46: | 层 | 目录 | 职责 | 禁止 |\n47: |---|---|---|---|\n48: | 页面 | `views/` | 路由级页面、编排组件与 store | 直接写 axios/fetch |\n49: | 展示组件 | `components/` | 纯展示与局部交互，props/emits | 直接请求接口、依赖路由 |\n50: | 状态 | `stores/` | 跨页面共享状态与异步动作 | 直接操作 DOM |\n51: | API | `api/` | 接口函数、参数/响应类型、SSE 封装 | 处理 UI 提示 |\n52: | 类型 | `types/` | 与后端契约对应的类型 | 引入运行时依赖 |\n53: | 组合式 | `composables/` | 可复用逻辑（SSE、Markdown、滚动） | 依赖具体页面 |\n54: | 布局 | `layouts/` | 应用外壳、导航、全局出口 | 业务状态 |\n55: \n56: 约定：\n57: \n58: - 页面只通过 store 或 `api/` 模块访问数据；\n59: - 展示组件不 import store（除全局主题/用户外），通过 props 传入；\n60: - 所有接口错误统一为 `ApiRequestError`，页面决定展示方式。\n61: \n62: ## 4. 关键数据流\n63: \n64: ### 4.1 对话（规划，M1）\n65: \n66: ```mermaid\n67: sequenceDiagram\n68:     autonumber\n69:     participant U as 用户\n70:     participant V as ChatView\n71:     participant S as chat store\n72:     participant API as api/chat\n73:     participant SSE as useSSE\n74:     participant BE as 后端\n75: \n76:     U->>V: 输入并发送\n77:     V->>S: sendMessage(text)\n78:     S->>API: openChatStream(payload)\n79:     API->>SSE: fetchEventSource('/chat/stream')\n80:     SSE->>BE: POST（Bearer token）\n81:     BE-->>SSE: SSE 事件流\n82:     SSE-->>S: onEvent(name, data)\n83:     S->>S: 更新消息/工具/A2A 任务状态\n84:     S-->>V: 响应式更新\n85:     V-->>U: 流式渲染\n86: ```\n87: \n88: 事件处理原则：\n89: \n90: - `message.delta` 追加到当前 assistant 消息，按帧合并（`requestAnimationFrame`）避免高频重渲染；\n91: - `tool.*` / `a2a.*` 作为消息时间线中的「过程卡片」，不混入正文；\n92: - `approval.required` 弹出确认卡片，用户决定后调用审批接口并继续接收同一流；\n93: - `message.done` 结束本轮，刷新会话列表的 `last_message_at`；\n94: - 未知事件忽略并记录 debug 日志，不中断流。\n95: \n96: ### 4.2 认证（M1）\n97: \n98: - 登录成功：access/refresh 存 localStorage（生产可改 httpOnly cookie，需要后端配合）；\n99: - axios 请求自动带 `Authorization: Bearer`；\n100: - 401：清理会话并跳转登录；刷新令牌在 M1 实现（单飞锁，避免并发刷新）。\n101: \n102: ### 4.3 列表页（会话/任务/智能体）\n103: \n104: - 进入页面拉取第一页；滚动到底部加载下一页（cursor）；\n105: - 写操作后局部更新列表，不全量刷新；\n106: - 空态、加载态、错误态三态必须实现。\n107: \n108: ## 5. 状态管理\n109: \n110: | Store | 状态 | 说明 |\n111: |---|---|---|\n112: | `auth` | accessToken、refreshToken、user、isAuthenticated | 规划（当前未创建） |\n113: | `chat` | 当前会话、消息时间线、流式状态、工具/任务卡片 | M1 |\n114: | `conversations` | 列表、分页游标、筛选条件 | M1 |\n115: | `agents` | 远程 Agent 列表、健康状态、注册表单 | M2 |\n116: | `tasks` | A2A 任务列表、筛选、实时更新 | M2 |\n117: | `knowledge` | 文档列表、上传队列、检索结果 | M4 |\n118: \n119: 约定：\n120: \n121: - 使用 Setup Store（`defineStore('x', () => {...})`）；\n122: - store 不持有组件引用与 DOM；\n123: - 异步动作返回 Promise，错误向上抛，由页面统一提示；\n124: - 派生数据用 `computed`，不重复存 state。\n125: \n126: ## 6. 路由与布局\n127: \n128: | 路径 | 页面 | 布局 |\n129: |---|---|---|\n130: | `/chat` | `ChatView` | AppLayout |\n131: | `/conversations` | `ConversationsView` | AppLayout |\n132: | `/agents` | `AgentsView` | AppLayout |\n133: | `/tasks` | `TasksView` | AppLayout |\n134: | `/knowledge` | `KnowledgeView` | AppLayout |\n135: | `/settings` | `SettingsView` | AppLayout |\n136: | `/login` | `LoginView`（M1） | 独立布局 |\n137: \n138: - 路由级懒加载（`() => import(...)`），首屏只加载布局与当前页；\n139: - `meta.title` 驱动顶栏与 `document.title`；\n140: - 路由守卫在 M1 加：未认证访问业务页 → `/login?redirect=...`；\n141: - 404 重定向到 `/chat`（后续可改为 NotFound 页）。\n142: \n143: ## 7. SSE 设计\n144: \n145: 原生 `EventSource` 只支持 GET、不能带自定义 header，因此用 `@microsoft/fetch-event-source`：\n146: \n147: ```ts\n148: await fetchEventSource('/api/v1/chat/stream', {\n149:   method: 'POST',\n150:   headers: {\n151:     'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n152:     Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`,\n153:   },\n154:   body: JSON.stringify(payload),\n155:   signal: controller.signal,\n156:   openWhenHidden: true,\n157:   async onopen(response) {\n158:     if (response.ok && response.headers.get('content-type')?.includes('text/event-stream')) return\n159:     throw new Error(`SSE 连接失败: ${response.status}`)\n160:   },\n161:   onmessage(ev) {\n162:     if (!ev.event || ev.event === 'ping') return\n163:     handleEvent(ev.event, JSON.parse(ev.data))\n164:   },\n165:   onerror(err) {\n166:     // 返回数字表示重试间隔；抛错则终止。业务错误应抛错，网络错误有限重试。\n167:     throw err\n168:   },\n169: })\n170: ```\n171: \n172: 要点：\n173: \n174: - `AbortController` 在组件卸载/用户停止时调用；\n175: - 后端默认「断开不取消」；前端重连后按 `run_id` 拉最终状态；\n176: - 断线重试最多 3 次，指数退避；`message.done` 后不重连；\n177: - SSE 事件 `id` 可用于后续 `Last-Event-ID` 断点续传（后端 M6 支持）。\n178: \n179: ## 8. 样式方案\n180: \n181: - 全局 CSS 变量（`src/styles/main.css`）定义色板、圆角、字体；\n182: - Element Plus 通过 `--el-color-primary` 等变量覆盖主题；\n183: - 页面样式用 `<style scoped>`，避免全局污染；\n184: - 布局：左侧固定侧边栏 + 右侧自适应内容区；窄屏侧边栏收窄为图标；\n185: - 后续视觉升级时，优先改 CSS 变量与布局组件，不散落改页面。\n186: \n187: ## 9. 错误、加载与空态\n188: \n189: | 状态 | 表现 |\n190: |---|---|\n191: | 加载 | 骨架屏/`el-skeleton`，避免布局跳动 |\n192: | 空态 | 图标 + 一句说明 + 主操作按钮 |\n193: | 错误 | 行内错误条 + 重试按钮；全局 toast 只用于一次性失败 |\n194: | 流式错误 | 消息气泡内显示错误卡片，保留已生成内容 |\n195: | 断线 | 顶部提示「连接断开，正在重试」 |\n196: \n197: ## 10. 性能\n198: \n199: - 路由懒加载；重型依赖（Markdown、代码高亮）按需 import；\n200: - 长会话消息列表用虚拟滚动（`el-virtual-list` 或自研，M4 评估）；\n201: - SSE 增量按帧合并，避免每个 token 触发一次完整重渲染；\n202: - Markdown 渲染做缓存（按 message_id + content hash）；\n203: - 图片/附件走缩略图与懒加载。\n204: \n205: ## 11. 安全\n206: \n207: | 风险 | 措施 |\n208: |---|---|\n209: | XSS | Markdown 渲染必须经过 DOMPurify；禁止 `v-html` 直接渲染未清洗内容 |\n210: | Token 泄露 | 不在日志/URL 中输出 token；生产评估 httpOnly cookie |\n211: | CSRF | Bearer token 方案天然免疫；若改 cookie 需加 CSRF token |\n212: | 恶意链接 | 外链 `rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"`，域名白名单提示 |\n213: | 远程内容 | A2A/工具返回内容按不可信渲染，禁止自动执行 |\n214: \n215: ## 12. 构建与部署\n216: \n217: ```bash\n218: pnpm build       # 产出 dist/\n219: pnpm preview     # 本地预览生产构建\n220: ```\n221: \n222: - 静态资源部署到 Nginx/CDN；\n223: - Nginx 需配置 `/api` 与 `/a2a` 反向代理，SSE 关闭缓冲：\n224: \n225: ```nginx\n226: location /api/ {\n227:     proxy_pass http://agent-hub:8000;\n228:     proxy_http_version 1.1;\n229:     proxy_set_header Connection '';\n230:     proxy_buffering off;\n231:     proxy_read_timeout 3600s;\n232: }\n233: ```\n234: \n235: - 环境变量只有 `VITE_` 前缀会打进客户端，禁止放密钥。\n\n(End of file - total 235 lines)\n</content>"}],"isError":false,"id":"fada7c99-49ad-4cd6-9bed-93fed1eb81b5"},"meta":{"path":"/home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/architecture.md","offset":1,"lines":[{"number":1,"text":"# 前端架构"},{"number":2,"text":""},{"number":3,"text":"- 项目：Agent Hub Web（`agent-hub-web`）"},{"number":4,"text":"- 状态：设计稿；当前仅有 create-vue 脚手架配置，页面与请求层未实现"},{"number":5,"text":"- 更新时间：2026-11-04"},{"number":6,"text":""},{"number":7,"text":"## 1. 目标"},{"number":8,"text":""},{"number":9,"text":"1. 提供流畅的多轮对话工作台，SSE 流式渲染回答与任务进度；"},{"number":10,"text":"2. 让用户管理远程 A2A 智能体、知识库与审批；"},{"number":11,"text":"3. 与后端契约解耦：类型集中在 `src/types/`，页面不直接拼 URL；"},{"number":12,"text":"4. 保持工程化基线：TypeScript 严格模式、ESLint/Prettier、可构建、可测试（后续补 Vitest）。"},{"number":13,"text":""},{"number":14,"text":"## 2. 技术架构"},{"number":15,"text":""},{"number":16,"text":"```mermaid"},{"number":17,"text":"flowchart TB"},{"number":18,"text":"    subgraph Browser[\"浏览器\"]"},{"number":19,"text":"        V[\"views 页面\"]"},{"number":20,"text":"        C[\"components 展示组件\"]"},{"number":21,"text":"        S[\"stores (Pinia)\"]"},{"number":22,"text":"        A[\"api 模块\"]"},{"number":23,"text":"        X[\"api/client.ts<br/>axios 实例\"]"},{"number":24,"text":"        E[\"composables/useSSE<br/>fetch-event-source\"]"},{"number":25,"text":"        T[\"types 契约类型\"]"},{"number":26,"text":"    end"},{"number":27,"text":""},{"number":28,"text":"    V --> C"},{"number":29,"text":"    V --> S"},{"number":30,"text":"    V --> A"},{"number":31,"text":"    A --> X"},{"number":32,"text":"    V --> E"},{"number":33,"text":"    S --> A"},{"number":34,"text":"    C --> T"},{"number":35,"text":"    A --> T"},{"number":36,"text":"    S --> T"},{"number":37,"text":"    X -->|REST /api/v1| BE[\"agent-hub 后端\"]"},{"number":38,"text":"    E -->|SSE /chat/stream| BE"},{"number":39,"text":"```"},{"number":40,"text":""},{"number":41,"text":"## 3. 分层职责"},{"number":42,"text":""},{"number":43,"text":"> 下表是规划目标；当前仓库只有 `src/main.ts`、`src/App.vue`、`src/router/index.ts`，"},{"number":44,"text":"> 其余目录为空占位（`.gitkeep`），尚未创建对应实现。"},{"number":45,"text":""},{"number":46,"text":"| 层 | 目录 | 职责 | 禁止 |"},{"number":47,"text":"|---|---|---|---|"},{"number":48,"text":"| 页面 | `views/` | 路由级页面、编排组件与 store | 直接写 axios/fetch |"},{"number":49,"text":"| 展示组件 | `components/` | 纯展示与局部交互，props/emits | 直接请求接口、依赖路由 |"},{"number":50,"text":"| 状态 | `stores/` | 跨页面共享状态与异步动作 | 直接操作 DOM |"},{"number":51,"text":"| API | `api/` | 接口函数、参数/响应类型、SSE 封装 | 处理 UI 提示 |"},{"number":52,"text":"| 类型 | `types/` | 与后端契约对应的类型 | 引入运行时依赖 |"},{"number":53,"text":"| 组合式 | `composables/` | 可复用逻辑（SSE、Markdown、滚动） | 依赖具体页面 |"},{"number":54,"text":"| 布局 | `layouts/` | 应用外壳、导航、全局出口 | 业务状态 |"},{"number":55,"text":""},{"number":56,"text":"约定："},{"number":57,"text":""},{"number":58,"text":"- 页面只通过 store 或 `api/` 模块访问数据；"},{"number":59,"text":"- 展示组件不 import store（除全局主题/用户外），通过 props 传入；"},{"number":60,"text":"- 所有接口错误统一为 `ApiRequestError`，页面决定展示方式。"},{"number":61,"text":""},{"number":62,"text":"## 4. 关键数据流"},{"number":63,"text":""},{"number":64,"text":"### 4.1 对话（规划，M1）"},{"number":65,"text":""},{"number":66,"text":"```mermaid"},{"number":67,"text":"sequenceDiagram"},{"number":68,"text":"    autonumber"},{"number":69,"text":"    participant U as 用户"},{"number":70,"text":"    participant V as ChatView"},{"number":71,"text":"    participant S as chat store"},{"number":72,"text":"    participant API as api/chat"},{"number":73,"text":"    participant SSE as useSSE"},{"number":74,"text":"    participant BE as 后端"},{"number":75,"text":""},{"number":76,"text":"    U->>V: 输入并发送"},{"number":77,"text":"    V->>S: sendMessage(text)"},{"number":78,"text":"    S->>API: openChatStream(payload)"},{"number":79,"text":"    API->>SSE: fetchEventSource('/chat/stream')"},{"number":80,"text":"    SSE->>BE: POST（Bearer token）"},{"number":81,"text":"    BE-->>SSE: SSE 事件流"},{"number":82,"text":"    SSE-->>S: onEvent(name, data)"},{"number":83,"text":"    S->>S: 更新消息/工具/A2A 任务状态"},{"number":84,"text":"    S-->>V: 响应式更新"},{"number":85,"text":"    V-->>U: 流式渲染"},{"number":86,"text":"```"},{"number":87,"text":""},{"number":88,"text":"事件处理原则："},{"number":89,"text":""},{"number":90,"text":"- `message.delta` 追加到当前 assistant 消息，按帧合并（`requestAnimationFrame`）避免高频重渲染；"},{"number":91,"text":"- `tool.*` / `a2a.*` 作为消息时间线中的「过程卡片」，不混入正文；"},{"number":92,"text":"- `approval.required` 弹出确认卡片，用户决定后调用审批接口并继续接收同一流；"},{"number":93,"text":"- `message.done` 结束本轮，刷新会话列表的 `last_message_at`；"},{"number":94,"text":"- 未知事件忽略并记录 debug 日志，不中断流。"},{"number":95,"text":""},{"number":96,"text":"### 4.2 认证（M1）"},{"number":97,"text":""},{"number":98,"text":"- 登录成功：access/refresh 存 localStorage（生产可改 httpOnly cookie，需要后端配合）；"},{"number":99,"text":"- axios 请求自动带 `Authorization: Bearer`；"},{"number":100,"text":"- 401：清理会话并跳转登录；刷新令牌在 M1 实现（单飞锁，避免并发刷新）。"},{"number":101,"text":""},{"number":102,"text":"### 4.3 列表页（会话/任务/智能体）"},{"number":103,"text":""},{"number":104,"text":"- 进入页面拉取第一页；滚动到底部加载下一页（cursor）；"},{"number":105,"text":"- 写操作后局部更新列表，不全量刷新；"},{"number":106,"text":"- 空态、加载态、错误态三态必须实现。"},{"number":107,"text":""},{"number":108,"text":"## 5. 状态管理"},{"number":109,"text":""},{"number":110,"text":"| Store | 状态 | 说明 |"},{"number":111,"text":"|---|---|---|"},{"number":112,"text":"| `auth` | accessToken、refreshToken、user、isAuthenticated | 规划（当前未创建） |"},{"number":113,"text":"| `chat` | 当前会话、消息时间线、流式状态、工具/任务卡片 | M1 |"},{"number":114,"text":"| `conversations` | 列表、分页游标、筛选条件 | M1 |"},{"number":115,"text":"| `agents` | 远程 Agent 列表、健康状态、注册表单 | M2 |"},{"number":116,"text":"| `tasks` | A2A 任务列表、筛选、实时更新 | M2 |"},{"number":117,"text":"| `knowledge` | 文档列表、上传队列、检索结果 | M4 |"},{"number":118,"text":""},{"number":119,"text":"约定："},{"number":120,"text":""},{"number":121,"text":"- 使用 Setup Store（`defineStore('x', () => {...})`）；"},{"number":122,"text":"- store 不持有组件引用与 DOM；"},{"number":123,"text":"- 异步动作返回 Promise，错误向上抛，由页面统一提示；"},{"number":124,"text":"- 派生数据用 `computed`，不重复存 state。"},{"number":125,"text":""},{"number":126,"text":"## 6. 路由与布局"},{"number":127,"text":""},{"number":128,"text":"| 路径 | 页面 | 布局 |"},{"number":129,"text":"|---|---|---|"},{"number":130,"text":"| `/chat` | `ChatView` | AppLayout |"},{"number":131,"text":"| `/conversations` | `ConversationsView` | AppLayout |"},{"number":132,"text":"| `/agents` | `AgentsView` | AppLayout |"},{"number":133,"text":"| `/tasks` | `TasksView` | AppLayout |"},{"number":134,"text":"| `/knowledge` | `KnowledgeView` | AppLayout |"},{"number":135,"text":"| `/settings` | `SettingsView` | AppLayout |"},{"number":136,"text":"| `/login` | `LoginView`（M1） | 独立布局 |"},{"number":137,"text":""},{"number":138,"text":"- 路由级懒加载（`() => import(...)`），首屏只加载布局与当前页；"},{"number":139,"text":"- `meta.title` 驱动顶栏与 `document.title`；"},{"number":140,"text":"- 路由守卫在 M1 加：未认证访问业务页 → `/login?redirect=...`；"},{"number":141,"text":"- 404 重定向到 `/chat`（后续可改为 NotFound 页）。"},{"number":142,"text":""},{"number":143,"text":"## 7. SSE 设计"},{"number":144,"text":""},{"number":145,"text":"原生 `EventSource` 只支持 GET、不能带自定义 header，因此用 `@microsoft/fetch-event-source`："},{"number":146,"text":""},{"number":147,"text":"```ts"},{"number":148,"text":"await fetchEventSource('/api/v1/chat/stream', {"},{"number":149,"text":"  method: 'POST',"},{"number":150,"text":"  headers: {"},{"number":151,"text":"    'Content-Type': 'application/json',"},{"number":152,"text":"    Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`,"},{"number":153,"text":"  },"},{"number":154,"text":"  body: JSON.stringify(payload),"},{"number":155,"text":"  signal: controller.signal,"},{"number":156,"text":"  openWhenHidden: true,"},{"number":157,"text":"  async onopen(response) {"},{"number":158,"text":"    if (response.ok && response.headers.get('content-type')?.includes('text/event-stream')) return"},{"number":159,"text":"    throw new Error(`SSE 连接失败: ${response.status}`)"},{"number":160,"text":"  },"},{"number":161,"text":"  onmessage(ev) {"},{"number":162,"text":"    if (!ev.event || ev.event === 'ping') return"},{"number":163,"text":"    handleEvent(ev.event, JSON.parse(ev.data))"},{"number":164,"text":"  },"},{"number":165,"text":"  onerror(err) {"},{"number":166,"text":"    // 返回数字表示重试间隔；抛错则终止。业务错误应抛错，网络错误有限重试。"},{"number":167,"text":"    throw err"},{"number":168,"text":"  },"},{"number":169,"text":"})"},{"number":170,"text":"```"},{"number":171,"text":""},{"number":172,"text":"要点："},{"number":173,"text":""},{"number":174,"text":"- `AbortController` 在组件卸载/用户停止时调用；"},{"number":175,"text":"- 后端默认「断开不取消」；前端重连后按 `run_id` 拉最终状态；"},{"number":176,"text":"- 断线重试最多 3 次，指数退避；`message.done` 后不重连；"},{"number":177,"text":"- SSE 事件 `id` 可用于后续 `Last-Event-ID` 断点续传（后端 M6 支持）。"},{"number":178,"text":""},{"number":179,"text":"## 8. 样式方案"},{"number":180,"text":""},{"number":181,"text":"- 全局 CSS 变量（`src/styles/main.css`）定义色板、圆角、字体；"},{"number":182,"text":"- Element Plus 通过 `--el-color-primary` 等变量覆盖主题；"},{"number":183,"text":"- 页面样式用 `<style scoped>`，避免全局污染；"},{"number":184,"text":"- 布局：左侧固定侧边栏 + 右侧自适应内容区；窄屏侧边栏收窄为图标；"},{"number":185,"text":"- 后续视觉升级时，优先改 CSS 变量与布局组件，不散落改页面。"},{"number":186,"text":""},{"number":187,"text":"## 9. 错误、加载与空态"},{"number":188,"text":""},{"number":189,"text":"| 状态 | 表现 |"},{"number":190,"text":"|---|---|"},{"number":191,"text":"| 加载 | 骨架屏/`el-skeleton`，避免布局跳动 |"},{"number":192,"text":"| 空态 | 图标 + 一句说明 + 主操作按钮 |"},{"number":193,"text":"| 错误 | 行内错误条 + 重试按钮；全局 toast 只用于一次性失败 |"},{"number":194,"text":"| 流式错误 | 消息气泡内显示错误卡片，保留已生成内容 |"},{"number":195,"text":"| 断线 | 顶部提示「连接断开，正在重试」 |"},{"number":196,"text":""},{"number":197,"text":"## 10. 性能"},{"number":198,"text":""},{"number":199,"text":"- 路由懒加载；重型依赖（Markdown、代码高亮）按需 import；"},{"number":200,"text":"- 长会话消息列表用虚拟滚动（`el-virtual-list` 或自研，M4 评估）；"},{"number":201,"text":"- SSE 增量按帧合并，避免每个 token 触发一次完整重渲染；"},{"number":202,"text":"- Markdown 渲染做缓存（按 message_id + content hash）；"},{"number":203,"text":"- 图片/附件走缩略图与懒加载。"},{"number":204,"text":""},{"number":205,"text":"## 11. 安全"},{"number":206,"text":""},{"number":207,"text":"| 风险 | 措施 |"},{"number":208,"text":"|---|---|"},{"number":209,"text":"| XSS | Markdown 渲染必须经过 DOMPurify；禁止 `v-html` 直接渲染未清洗内容 |"},{"number":210,"text":"| Token 泄露 | 不在日志/URL 中输出 token；生产评估 httpOnly cookie |"},{"number":211,"text":"| CSRF | Bearer token 方案天然免疫；若改 cookie 需加 CSRF token |"},{"number":212,"text":"| 恶意链接 | 外链 `rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"`，域名白名单提示 |"},{"number":213,"text":"| 远程内容 | A2A/工具返回内容按不可信渲染，禁止自动执行 |"},{"number":214,"text":""},{"number":215,"text":"## 12. 构建与部署"},{"number":216,"text":""},{"number":217,"text":"```bash"},{"number":218,"text":"pnpm build       # 产出 dist/"},{"number":219,"text":"pnpm preview     # 本地预览生产构建"},{"number":220,"text":"```"},{"number":221,"text":""},{"number":222,"text":"- 静态资源部署到 Nginx/CDN；"},{"number":223,"text":"- Nginx 需配置 `/api` 与 `/a2a` 反向代理，SSE 关闭缓冲："},{"number":224,"text":""},{"number":225,"text":"```nginx"},{"number":226,"text":"location /api/ {"},{"number":227,"text":"    proxy_pass http://agent-hub:8000;"},{"number":228,"text":"    proxy_http_version 1.1;"},{"number":229,"text":"    proxy_set_header Connection '';"},{"number":230,"text":"    proxy_buffering off;"},{"number":231,"text":"    proxy_read_timeout 3600s;"},{"number":232,"text":"}"},{"number":233,"text":"```"},{"number":234,"text":""},{"number":235,"text":"- 环境变量只有 `VITE_` 前缀会打进客户端，禁止放密钥。"}],"totalLines":235,"lang":"md"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[47],"surfaceOp":"append"}
