 chip\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"  .status-chip{display:none}\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"  .chat-actions .status-chip{display:none}\\\"\\\"\\\")\\n\\n# 7. heading hierarchy\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"<h1 class=\\\"sessions-title\\\">会话</h1>\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"<h2 class=\\\"sessions-title\\\">会话</h2>\\\"\\\"\\\")\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"<h2 class=\\\"chat-title\\\">Q3 客服工单周报</h2>\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"<h1 class=\\\"chat-title\\\">Q3 客服工单周报</h1>\\\"\\\"\\\")\\n\\n# 8. citation count must match trace list\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"<span>知识库 12 段引用</span>\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"<span>知识库 3 段引用</span>\\\"\\\"\\\")\\n\\n# 9. consistent progress 3/5\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"<span style=\\\"width:62%\\\"></span>\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"<span style=\\\"width:60%\\\"></span>\\\"\\\"\\\")\\n\\n# 10. thread footer wording\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"<span>本轮由 main-agent 调度</span>\\n          <span>·</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"mono\\\">2 remote agents</span>\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"<span>本轮由 main-agent 调度</span>\\n          <span>·</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"mono\\\">2 A2A endpoints</span>\\\"\\\"\\\")\\n\\n# 11. approval copy: pre-approval reads correctly while the review runs\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"<p class=\\\"approval-action\\\">将周报发布到 <b>#support-weekly</b>，并 @ 值班同事。</p>\\n                  <dl class=\\\"risk-list\\\">\\n                    <dt>可见范围</dt><dd>频道内 12 名成员</dd>\\n                    <dt>可撤回</dt><dd>发布后 24 小时内</dd>\\n                    <dt>发起方</dt><dd>main-agent · run_8f3a2c</dd>\\n                  </dl>\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"<p class=\\\"approval-action\\\">批准后，周报将在 <b>editorial-reviewer</b> 审阅通过后自动发布到 <b>#support-weekly</b>，并 @ 值班同事。</p>\\n                  <dl class=\\\"risk-list\\\">\\n                    <dt>可见范围</dt><dd>频道内 12 名成员</dd>\\n                    <dt>可撤回</dt><dd>发布后 24 小时内</dd>\\n                    <dt>触发条件</dt><dd>审阅通过且无阻断问题</dd>\\n                    <dt>发起方</dt><dd>main-agent · run_8f3a2c</dd>\\n                  </dl>\\\"\\\"\\\")\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"