{"type":"tool/result","seq":121,"time":1793890165949,"data":{"turn":1,"step":13,"message":{"role":"tool","source":{"kind":"tool","callId":"call_00_sEmJPfhPYd9t1JKncSqk6068"},"toolCallId":"call_00_sEmJPfhPYd9t1JKncSqk6068","content":[{"type":"text","text":"525-\n526-/* data table */\n527:.table-wrap{\n528-  margin-top:16px;\n529-  overflow-x:auto;\n530-  overscroll-behavior-x:contain;\n--\n1363-              <p>本季度共收到 <strong>128 条</strong>工单，比上季度减少 6%。退款与退货仍是最集中的问题类型，但平均处理时长从 31 小时降到 24 小时。<span class=\"cite\">1</span></p>\n1364-\n1365:              <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n1366-              <table class=\"data-table\">\n1367-                <caption>按主标签归类，环比相对 Q2</caption>\n1368-                <thead>\n--- approval copy ---\n1455:                  <p class=\"approval-action\">批准后，周报将在 <b>editorial-reviewer</b> 审阅通过后自动发布到 <b>#support-weekly</b>，并 @ 值班同事。</p>\n1456-                  <dl class=\"risk-list\">\n1457-                    <dt>可见范围</dt><dd>频道内 12 名成员</dd>\n1458-                    <dt>可撤回</dt><dd>发布后 24 小时内</dd>\n1459-                    <dt>触发条件</dt><dd>审阅通过且无阻断问题</dd>\n1460-                    <dt>发起方</dt><dd>main-agent · run_8f3a2c</dd>\n1461-                  </dl>\n1462-                </div>\n1463-                <div class=\"approval-actions\">\n"}],"isError":false,"id":"eb8bc019-ec1d-4527-88b3-7d50d04cac6f"},"meta":{"cwd":"/home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[118],"surfaceOp":"append"}
