{"type":"assistant/message","seq":162,"time":1793890901022,"data":{"turn":2,"step":2,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"好。现在做第一步：title、token 变量、prompt-bubble 样式、新增 CSS。\n\n先看 v1 的 CSS 段落，确认 token 块和 prompt 块内容。用 read 看关键行。"},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_SnOGW1dYz0p00qhVyMVa1482","name":"read","arguments":"{\"file_path\": \"/home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/prototypes/ui-v2.html\", \"offset\": 1, \"limit\": 80}"},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_01_OIFLCHxItoqGsmnjYcMH2325","name":"read","arguments":"{\"file_path\": \"/home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/prototypes/ui-v2.html\", \"offset\": 430, \"limit\": 60}"}],"source":{"kind":"model","provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-flash","replayState":{"response":{"kind":"deepseek-messages","version":1,"model":"deepseek-flash"},"blocks":[{"type":"reasoning","signature":"a9706326-30be-4850-afea-37809dac7374"},{"type":"tool-call"},{"type":"tool-call"}]}},"id":"53ed00e2-bd59-4e63-90fe-3644d9088069"},"usage":{"inputTokens":13881,"outputTokens":225,"cacheReadTokens":109312,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":123418},"stream":[{"type":"chunk","time":1793890899563,"chunk":{"type":"block-start","index":0,"blockType":"reasoning"}},{"type":"reasoning-chunks","time0":1793890900170,"index":0,"dt":[108,0,0,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,18,1,0,0,16,1,0,0,0,16,0,0,0,27,0,0,19,0,0,0,14,0,0,17,0,14,0,0],"texts":["好","。","现在","做","第一步","：","title","、","token"," ","变量","、","prom","pt","-b","ubble"," ","样式","、","新增"," CSS","。\n\n","先","看"," v","1"," ","的"," CSS"," ","段落","，","确认"," token"," ","块","和"," prompt"," ","块","内容","。","用"," read"," ","看","关键","行","。"]},{"type":"chunk","time":1793890900560,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"好。现在做第一步：title、token 变量、prompt-bubble 样式、新增 CSS。\n\n先看 v1 的 CSS 段落，确认 token 块和 prompt 块内容。用 read 看关键行。"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1793890900560,"chunk":{"type":"block-start","index":1,"bloc