{"type":"tool/call","seq":177,"time":1793890941883,"data":{"turn":2,"step":4,"callId":"call_00_3eowjMltFniaHaRBMME35589","name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/prototypes && python3 - <<'PY'\\npath='ui-v2.html'\\ns=open(path,encoding='utf-8').read()\\n\\nstart=s.index('    <div class=\\\"stream\\\" id=\\\"stream\\\">')\\nend=s.index('  </main>')+len('  </main>')\\n\\nnew = r'''    <div class=\\\"stream\\\" id=\\\"stream\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"stream-inner\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"conversation\\\" id=\\\"conversation\\\">\\n\\n          <section class=\\\"turn\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"user-turn\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"user-meta\\\">\\n                <span>你</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"meta-sep\\\">·</span>\\n                <time>22:41</time>\\n                <span class=\\\"meta-sep\\\">·</span>\\n                <span>Web 工作台</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"prompt-bubble\\\">\\n                <p>把本季度 128 条客服工单按问题类型归类，写一份给团队看的周报。数字要能追溯来源，写完让编辑智能体过一遍措辞，先别发出去。</p>\\n                <div class=\\\"attachments\\\">\\n                  <span class=\\\"attach\\\">\\n                    <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-clip\\\"/></svg>\\n                    q3-support-tickets.csv\\n                    <span class=\\\"mono\\\">128 行 · 24 KB</span>\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <ol class=\\\"thread\\\" id=\\\"thread\\\">\\n\\n              <!-- assistant intro -->\\n              <li class=\\\"entry entry-assistant\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"node\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-head\\\">\\n                  <span class=\\\"who\\\">main-agent</span>\\n                  <span class=\\\"who-sub\\\">调度员 · 计划</span>\\n                  <span class=\\\"spacer\\\"></span>\\n                  <button class=\\\"copy-btn\\\" data-copy=\\\"我先把「周报生成」技能挂上，检索分类口径，聚合工单；草稿完成后并行交给 editorial-reviewer 和 fact-checker，发布前用 Slack MCP 校验频道。\\\">\\n                    <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-copy\\\"/></svg>复制\\n                  </button>\\n                  <time>22:41</time>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-body prose\\\">\\n                  <p>我先把「周报生成」技能挂上，检索分类口径，聚合工单；草稿完成后并行交给 editorial-reviewer 和 fact-checker，发布前用 Slack MCP 校验频道。</p>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n\\n              <!-- skill -->\\n              <li class=\\\"entry entry-proc kind-skill\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"node\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-body\\\">\\n                  <details class=\\\"tool-card\\\" open>\\n                    <summary>\\n                      <span class=\\\"kind\\\">技能</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-name\\\">weekly-report</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-args\\\">v1.2 · 周报生成</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-result\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg>已加载</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-time\\\">0.1s</span>\\n                      <svg class=\\\"ic chev\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-chevron\\\"/></svg>\\n                    </summary>\\n                    <div class=\\\"tool-body\\\">\\n                      <p class=\\\"proc-desc\\\">技能提供固定章节、口径引用规则与团队语气，模板来自知识库 templates 目录。</p>\\n                      <div class=\\\"chips\\\">\\n                        <span class=\\\"chip\\\">templates/weekly-report.md</span>\\n                        <span class=\\\"chip\\\">cite-required</span>\\n                        <span class=\\\"chip\\\">zh-CN</span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div class=\\\"tool-note\\\">trigger: 周报 · scope: run_8f3a2c · source: b