{"type":"assistant/message","seq":195,"time":1793890958372,"data":{"turn":2,"step":7,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"替换 metrics、count、track、data-analyst。\n\n新 track 7 步：\n01 加载技能 weekly-report (0.1s) sub: skill · builtin\n02 向量检索 (0.8s) sub: vector.search · 3 hits\n03 数据聚合 (1.4s) sub: tickets.aggregate · 128 rows\n04 生成周报 (2.1s) sub: weekly-report · 5 sections\n05 并行委派 (00:18) sub: 2 agents · 1 done / 1 running\n06 MCP 校验 (0.4s) sub: slack · conversations.info\n07 发送审批 (—) sub: 等待你的决定\n\n状态：\n- 01-04 done\n- 05 is-now\n- 06 done（但 06 在 05 之后，为什么 done 而 05 运行中？并行：MCP 校验可以在 editorial 审阅期间完成。执行轨道是时间顺序，05 运行中、06 已完成有点违背线性。可以调整顺序：05 MCP 校验 done，06 并行委派 running，07 审批 wait。但对话里 MCP 卡在委派组之后。可以接受：轨道按事件发生顺序，MCP 在委派之后完成，但委派本身还在运行（未结束）。所以 05 委派（开始，运行中），06 MCP（完成），07 审批等待。运行中的步骤后面出现已完成步骤，视觉上有点奇怪，但真实并行执行就是这样。可以用\"并行\"标签说明。\n  \n  或者把 05 设为\"并行委派\" is-now，06 设为 is-done，并在 06 sub 标注 \"与审阅并行完成\"。可以。\n  \n  右栏轨道是线性列表，运行中的 05 后面跟完成的 06，会让人疑惑。调整：\n  - 05 并行委派（is-now，子项：editorial 运行中 · fact-checker 完成）\n  - 06 MCP 校验（is-done，子项：slack · 0.4s · 与审阅并行）\n  这样可读。\n  \n  或者把 MCP 放在并行委派之前（对话卡顺序也可调整：MCP 卡在委派之前）。MCP 校验频道不需要草稿，可以提前。这样轨道线性：skill、vector、aggregate、生成周报、MCP 校验、并行委派、审批。审批在委派后。对话卡顺序：skill、vector、tool、report、MCP、delegation、approval？但审批的触发条件依赖 editorial 审阅，MCP 在委派前校验频道是合理的（准备发布通道）。\n  \n  这样更顺：MCP 在周报后、委派前。但视觉上 MCP 卡和 A2A 组的位置调换需要改 HTML。目前 MCP 在委派后。可以改为：MCP 卡放在委派前（即周报后）。但用户看对话顺序，MCP 校验频道放在委派前也自然。\n  \n  不过 \"发布前用 Slack MCP 校验频道\" 的顺序更像发布准备，放在委派后、审批前更符合叙事。轨道里出现运行中后接完成，可以解释为并行。保持现有 HTML 顺序。\n  \n  轨道可以标注 06 的 sub \"slack · 与审阅并行完成\"。可以接受。\n  \n  或者把 05 的 marker 设为 completed？不，editorial 还在运行。\n  \n  另一个方案：轨道不严格按开始顺序，把 MCP 放在并行委派之前：05 MCP 校验（done），06 并行委派（is-now）。虽然对话里 MCP 卡在组卡后，但右栏是执行轨道，顺序不必与聊天展示完全一致。但用户可能对照。嗯。\n  \n  我保持时间顺序：05 委派 now，06 MCP done。加 sub 说明并行。OK。\n\n- 07 wait。\n\nmetrics：\n- 耗时 00:42\n- 模型 deepseek-chat\n- 工具调用 4 次\n- 远程智能体 2 个\n\n字体：工具调用 dd `4 <small>次</small>`，small 样式已有。\n\n智能体：data-analyst → fact-checker，badge FC，agent-kind `verify-numbers · 刚完成`，状态 `空闲` 绿点。这样 3 个智能体。editorial 忙碌。\n\nheader chat-sub：`main-agent / 7 步 / 2 个远程智能体 / run_8f3a2c`。把原来 `知识库 3 段引用` 和后面的 run id 都改。查看 header 行 1415-1425。\n\n执行替换。"},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_At5nxE0dUQry3RqQ9PAa5870","name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/prototypes && python3 - <<'PY'\\npath='ui-v2.html'\\ns=open(path,encoding='utf-8').read()\\n\\ndef rep(old,new,count=1):\\n    global s\\n    assert old in s, 'MISSING: '+old[:90]\\n    s=s.replace(old,new,count)\\n\\n# header metadata\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"          <span>main-agent</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"sep\\\">/</span>\\n          <span>知识库 3 段引用</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"sep\\\">/</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"mono\\\">run_8f3a2c</span>\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"          <span>main-agent</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"sep\\\">/</span>\\n          <span>7 个步骤</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"sep\\\">/</span>\\n          <span>2 个远程智能体</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"sep\\\">/</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"mono\\\">run_8f3a2c</span>\\\"\\\"\\\")\\n\\n# metrics: tokens move out of the rail\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"      <dl class=\\\"metrics\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"metric\\\"><dt>输入 tokens</dt><dd>12.4k</dd></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"metric\\\"><dt>输出 tokens</dt><dd>1.8k</dd></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"metric\\\"><dt>模型</dt><dd style=\\\"font-size:11.5px\\\">deepseek-chat</dd></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"metric\\\"><dt>温度</dt><dd>0.3</dd></div>\\n      </dl>\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"      <dl class=\\\"metrics\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"metric\\\"><dt>耗时</dt><dd>00:42</dd></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"metric\\\"><dt>模型</dt><dd style=\\\"font-size:11.5px\\\">deepseek-chat</dd></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"metric\\\"><dt>工具调用</dt><dd>4 <small>次</small></dd></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"metric\\\"><dt>远程智能体</dt><dd>2 <small>个</small></dd></div>\\n      </dl>\\\"\\\"\\\")\\n\\nrep('<span class=\\\"count\\\">5</span>','<span class=\\\"count\\\">7</span>')\\n\\n# seven-step execution track\\nold_track = '''        <ol class=\\\"track\\\">\\n          <li class=\\\"is-done\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"marker\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg></span>\\n            <div class=\\\"label\\\">理解任务<span class=\\\"mono\\\">0.2s</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"sub\\\">main-agent</div>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"is-done\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"marker\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg></span>\\n            <div class=\\\"label\\\">knowledge.search<span class=\\\"mono\\\">0.8s</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"sub\\\">3 hits · support-kb</div>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"is-done\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"marker\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg></span>\\n            <div class=\\\"label\\\">tickets.aggregate<span class=\\\"mono\\\">1.4s</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"sub\\\">128 rows → 5 groups</div>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"is-now\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"marker\\\"></span>\\n            <div class=\\\"label\\\">editorial-reviewer<span class=\\\"mono\\\">00:18</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"sub\\\">A2A · task_7c1e · 3 / 5</div>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"is-wait\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"marker\\\"></span>\\n            <div class=\\\"label\\\">发送审批<span class=\\\"mono\\\">—</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"sub\\\">等待你的决定</div>\\n          </li>\\n        </ol>'''\\nnew_track = '''        <ol class=\\\"track\\\">\\n          <li class=\\\"is-done\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"marker\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg></span>\\n            <div class=\\\"label\\\">加载技能<span class=\\\"mono\\\">0.1s</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"sub\\\">skill · weekly-report@1.2</div>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"is-done\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"marker\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg></span>\\n            <div class=\\\"label\\\">向量检索<span class=\\\"mono\\\">0.8s</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"sub\\\">vector.search · 3 hits</div>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"is-done\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"marker\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg></span>\\n            <div class=\\\"label\\\">数据聚合<span class=\\\"mono\\\">1.4s</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"sub\\\">tickets.aggregate · 128 rows</div>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"is-done\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"marker\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg></span>\\n            <div class=\\\"label\\\">生成周报<span class=\\\"mono\\\">2.1s</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"sub\\\">weekly-report · 5 sections</div>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"is-now\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"marker\\\"></span>\\n            <div class=\\\"label\\\">并行委派<span class=\\\"mono\\\">00:18</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"sub\\\">2 agents · 1 done / 1 running</div>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"is-done\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"marker\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg></span>\\n            <div class=\\\"label\\\">MCP 校验<span class=\\\"mono\\\">0.4s</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"sub\\\">slack · 与审阅并行完成</div>\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"is-wait\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"marker\\\"></span>\\n            <div class=\\\"label\\\">发送审批<span class=\\\"mono\\\">—</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"sub\\\">等待你的决定</div>\\n          </li>\\n        </ol>'''\\nrep(old_track,new_track)\\n\\n# third agent becomes fact-checker\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"        <div class=\\\"agent-row\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"agent-badge\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">DA</span>\\n          <div class=\\\"agent-ident\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"agent-name\\\">data-analyst <span class=\\\"mono\\\">a2a</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"agent-kind\\\">sql · csv 分析</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <span class=\\\"agent-state\\\"><span class=\\\"dot is-ok\\\"></span>空闲</span>\\n        </div>\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"        <div class=\\\"agent-row\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"agent-badge\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">FC</span>\\n          <div class=\\\"agent-ident\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"agent-name\\\">fact-checker <span class=\\\"mono\\\">a2a</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"agent-kind\\\">verify-numbers · 刚完成</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <span class=\\\"agent-state\\\"><span class=\\\"dot is-ok\\\"></span>空闲</span>\\n        </div>\\\"\\\"\\\")\\n\\nopen(path,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\\nprint('trace patched')\\nPY\\ngrep -n \\\"class=\\\\\\\"metrics\\\\\\\"\\\" -A5 ui-v2.html | head -8; grep -n \\\"fact-checker\\\" ui-v2.html | tail -3\", \"description\": \"Update trace metrics, track and agents\"}"}],"source":{"kind":"model","provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-flash","replayState":{"response":{"kind":"deepseek-messages","version":1,"model":"deepseek-flash"},"blocks":[{"type":"reasoning","signature":"5126c775-9cda-44bd-aea6-fa73eff8477c"},{"type":"tool-call"}]}},"id":"5aa544de-d6ad-4399-b266-a9c5644ae53d"},"usage":{"inputTokens":1763,"outputTokens":2892,"cacheReadTokens":137984,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":142639},"stream":[{"type":"chunk","time":1793890946593,"chunk":{"type":"block-start","index":0,"blockType":"reasoning"}},{"type":"reasoning-chunks","time0":1793890947168,"index":0,"dt":[109,17,0,16,0,0,0,13,0,0,0,15,0,16,0,0,0,0,16,0,0,15,0,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,20,8,0,16,24,0,0,0,1