\n        <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-stack\\\"/></svg>\\n        <span>会话</span>\\n      </button>\\n''','')\\n\\n# header: HITL state + run id\\nrep('''          <span>main-agent</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"sep\\\">/</span>\\n          <span>7 个步骤</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"sep\\\">/</span>\\n          <span>2 个远程智能体</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"sep\\\">/</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"mono\\\">run_8f3a2c</span>''',\\n'''          <span>main-agent</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"sep\\\">/</span>\\n          <span>等待审批</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"sep\\\">/</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"mono\\\">run_9a8b7c</span>''')\\n\\nrep('''        <span class=\\\"status-chip is-live\\\"><span class=\\\"dot is-live\\\"></span>运行中</span>''',\\n'''        <span class=\\\"status-chip is-wait\\\" id=\\\"runStatus\\\"><span class=\\\"dot\\\" id=\\\"runDot\\\"></span><span id=\\\"runStatusText\\\">等待审批</span></span>''')\\n\\n# user message: knowledge-base based, no unsupported CSV attachment flow\\nrep('''              <div class=\\\"prompt-bubble\\\">\\n                <p>把本季度 128 条客服工单按问题类型归类，写一份给团队看的周报。数字要能追溯来源，写完让编辑智能体过一遍措辞，先别发出去。</p>\\n                <div class=\\\"attachments\\\">\\n                  <span class=\\\"attach\\\">\\n                    <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-clip\\\"/></svg>\\n                    q3-support-tickets.csv\\n                    <span class=\\\"mono\\\">128 行 · 24 KB</span>\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>''',\\n'''              <div class=\\\"prompt-bubble\\\">\\n                <p>根据知识库里的 Q3 客服复盘，整理一份团队周报。数字让 data-analyst 核对，措辞让 editorial-reviewer 过一遍；发布到 #support-weekly 之前先问我。</p>\\n              </div>''')\\n\\nstart=s.index('            <ol class=\\\"thread\\\" id=\\\"thread\\\">')\\nend=s.index('            </ol>',start)+len('            </ol>')\\n\\nnew_thread = '''            <ol class=\\\"thread\\\" id=\\\"thread\\\">\\n\\n              <!-- assistant intro -->\\n              <li class=\\\"entry entry-assistant\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"node\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-head\\\">\\n                  <span class=\\\"who\\\">main-agent</span>\\n                  <span class=\\\"who-sub\\\">调度员 · 计划</span>\\n                  <span class=\\\"spacer\\\"></span>\\n                  <button class=\\\"copy-btn\\\" data-copy=\\\"我先用 search_knowledge 检索 Q3 复盘与分类口径，再让 data-analyst 核对数字、editorial-reviewer 审措辞；发布这一步会暂停，等你确认。\\\">\\n                    <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-copy\\\"/></svg>复制\\n                  </button>\\n                  <time>22:41</time>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-body prose\\\">\\n                  <p>我先用 search_knowledge 检索 Q3 复盘与分类口径，再让 data-analyst 核对数字、editorial-reviewer 审措辞；发布这一步会暂停，等你确认。</p>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n\\n              <!-- real tool: search_knowledge (RAG over pgvector) -->\\n              <li class=\\\"entry entry-proc kind-vector\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"node\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-body\\\">\\n                  <details class=\\\"tool-card\\\" open>\\n                    <summary>\\n                      <span class=\\\"kind\\\">检索</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-name\\\">search_knowledge</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-args\\\">“Q3 客服复盘 · 工单分类口径”</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-result\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-search\\\"/></svg>3 hits</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-time\\\">0.8s</span>\\n                      <svg class=\\\"ic chev\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-chevron\\\"/></svg>\\n                    </summary>\\n                    <div class=\\\"tool-body\\\">\\n                      <div class=\\\"vector-meta\\\">tool · pgvector HNSW · cosine · embedding text-embedding-3-small · 1536d · top_k=5</div>\\n                      <div class=\\\"vhit\\\">\\n                        <div class=\\\"vhit-main\\\"><span class=\\\"vhit-title\\\">Q3 客服复盘 v2</span><span class=\\\"vhit-score\\\">0.94</span></div>\\n                        <div class=\\\"vhit-sub\\\">chunk_7a2e · Q3 客服复盘.md · 09-30</div>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div class=\\\"vhit\\\">\\n                        <div class=\\\"vhit-main\\\"><span class=\\\"vhit-title\\\">工单分类规范 v3</span><span class=\\\"vhit-score\\\">0.92</span></div>\\n                        <div class=\\\"vhit-sub\\\">chunk_0f31 · 工单分类规范 v3.md · 09-18</div>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div class=\\\"vhit\\\">\\n                        <div class=\\\"vhit-main\\\"><span class=\\\"vhit-title\\\">售后话术库 · 分类索引</span><span class=\\\"vhit-score\\\">0.81</span></div>\\n                        <div class=\\\"vhit-sub\\\">chunk_51de · 售后话术库.md · 07-21</div>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div class=\\\"tool-note\\\">collection support-kb · 128 docs · pgvector · 0.8s</div>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </details>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n\\n              <!-- assistant report -->\\n              <li class=\\\"entry entry-assistant\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"node\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-head\\\">\\n                  <span class=\\\"who\\\">main-agent</span>\\n                  <span class=\\\"who-sub\\\">周报草稿</span>\\n                  <span class=\\\"spacer\\\"></span>\\n                  <button class=\\\"copy-btn\\\" data-copy=\\\"Q3 客服工单周报\\\">\\n                    <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-copy\\\"/></svg>复制\\n                  </button>\\n                  <time>22:42</time>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-body prose\\\">\\n                  <h3>Q3 客服工单周报</h3>\\n                  <p>本季度共收到 <strong>128 条</strong>工单，比上季度减少 6%。退款与退货仍是最集中的问题类型，但平均处理时长从 31 小时降到 24 小时。<span class=\\\"cite\\\">1</span></p>\\n\\n                  <div class=\\\"table-wrap\\\">\\n                    <table class=\\\"data-table\\\">\\n                      <caption>按主标签归类，环比相对 Q2</caption>\\n                      <thead>\\n                        <tr>\\n                          <th scope=\\\"col\\\">问题类型</th>\\n                          <th scope=\\\"col\\\" class=\\\"num\\\">数量</th>\\n                          <th scope=\\\"col\\\" class=\\\"num\\\">占比</th>\\n                          <th scope=\\\"col\\\" class=\\\"num\\\">环比</th>\\n                        </tr>\\n                      </thead>\\n                      <tbody>\\n                        <tr><td>退款与退货</td><td class=\\\"num\\\">46</td><td class=\\\"num\\\">35.9%</td><td class=\\\"num delta-up\\\">+8</td></tr>\\n                        <tr><td>物流异常</td><td class=\\\"num\\\">31</td><td class=\\\"num\\\">24.2%</td><td class=\\\"num delta-down\\\">−12</td></tr>\\n                        <tr><td>商品质量</td><td class=\\\"num\\\">24</td><td class=\\\"num\\\">18.8%</td><td class=\\\"num delta-down\\\">−3</td></tr>\\n                        <tr><td>账号与支付</td><td class=\\\"num\\\">17</td><td class=\\\"num\\\">13.3%</td><td class=\\\"num delta-up\\\">+2</td></tr>\\n                        <tr><td>其他</td><td class=\\\"num\\\">10</td><td class=\\\"num\\\">7.8%</td><td class=\\\"num delta-down\\\">−1</td></tr>\\n                      </tbody>\\n                    </table>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <h4>需要团队注意的三处变化</h4>\\n                  <ul>\\n                    <li>退款高峰集中在 8 月第二周，与 7 月底促销的退单延后有关。<span class=\\\"cite\\\">1</span></li>\\n                    <li>物流异常减少 12 条，主要因为新承运商在华东区上线。</li>\\n                    <li>账号与支付类工单里有 6 条指向同一支付渠道的重复扣款，建议单独立案跟进。<span class=\\\"cite\\\">2</span></li>\\n                  </ul>\\n\\n                  <blockquote>口径说明：分类依据《工单分类规范 v3》，多标签工单按主标签计入；“其他”包含 4 条未分类的测试工单。<span class=\\\"cite\\\">2</span></blockquote>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n\\n              <!-- A2A delegation: two remote skills, both finished -->\\n              <li class=\\\"entry entry-a2a\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"node\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-body\\\">\\n                  <div class=\\\"delegation\\\">\\n                    <div class=\\\"delegation-head\\\">\\n                      <span class=\\\"delegation-title\\\">远程委派</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tag\\\">A2A</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"delegation-count\\\">2 个远程智能体</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"spacer\\\"></span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"delegation-state\\\">2 完成</span>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"a2a-row is-done\\\">\\n                      <span class=\\\"agent-badge\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">DA</span>\\n                      <div class=\\\"a2a-row-ident\\\">\\n                        <div class=\\\"a2a-name\\\">data-analyst <span class=\\\"tag\\\">skill · verify_numbers</span></div>\\n                        <div class=\\\"a2a-row-tool\\\">agent_data_analyst__verify_numbers</div>\\n                        <div class=\\\"a2a-task\\\">核对周报数字与知识库来源</div>\\n                        <div class=\\\"a2a-row-result\\\">\\n                          <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg>\\n                          12/12 项通过 · 1.2s\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div class=\\\"a2a-row-state\\\">\\n                        <span class=\\\"a2a-status is-done\\\"><span class=\\\"dot is-ok\\\"></span>完成</span>\\n                        <span class=\\\"a2a-row-meta\