{"type":"tool/result","seq":371,"time":1793891978485,"data":{"turn":3,"step":15,"message":{"role":"tool","source":{"kind":"tool","callId":"call_00_yL34gk1rdT94DiTPBQyY7568"},"toolCallId":"call_00_yL34gk1rdT94DiTPBQyY7568","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== search_knowledge spec ===\ndocs/roadmap.md:94:- `search_knowledge` 工具\ndocs/api.md:207:data: {\"tool_call_id\":\"call_1\",\"tool\":\"search_knowledge\",\"args\":{\"query\":\"退货政策\"}}\n=== knowledge tables ===\n49:    knowledge_documents ||--o{ knowledge_chunks : splits\n90:    knowledge_documents {\n96:    knowledge_chunks {\n237:### 4.8 `knowledge_documents`\n244:| `category` | varchar(64) | not null default '' | 分类，用于过滤 |\n251:索引：`(status)`、`(category)`、`UNIQUE (checksum)`。\n253:### 4.9 `knowledge_chunks`（pgvector）\n258:| `document_id` | uuid | FK knowledge_documents, cascade | |\n271:CREATE INDEX ix_knowledge_chunks_embedding\n272:    ON knowledge_chunks USING hnsw (embedding vector_cosine_ops)\n275:CREATE INDEX ix_knowledge_chunks_metadata\n276:    ON knowledge_chunks USING gin (metadata jsonb_path_ops);\n337:FROM knowledge_chunks\n354:1. 新建 `knowledge_chunks_v2` 表与对应向量列；\n386:| 知识库重建 | `knowledge_documents.status='indexing'`；旧块在新块写完后事务内替换 |\n444:4. PostgreSQL 中的 `knowledge_chunks` 保留为元数据源，向量列可下线。\n=== approval payload ===\n14:| `public` | 业务表（用户、会话、消息、run、Agent 注册表、A2A 任务、知识库、审批、审计） | Alembic |\n47:    runs ||--o{ approvals : requires\n50:    users ||--o{ approvals : decides\n102:    approvals {\n279:### 4.10 `approvals`\n285:| `a2a_task_id` | uuid | FK a2a_tasks (set null) | 若审批针对远程调用 |\n287:| `reason` | text | not null | 为什么需要审批 |\n290:| `decided_by` | uuid | FK users (set null) | 审批人 |\n291:| `decision_note` | text | not null default '' | 审批意见 |\n304:| `action` | varchar(64) | not null | `login` / `conversation.delete` / `agent.register` / `approval.decide` … |\n387:| 审批并发 | `UPDATE ... WHERE status='pending'` 乐观更新，影响行数为 0 则返回冲突 |\n"}],"isError":false,"id":"ca9f55b0-4bb5-44dd-8139-ac6939fa73e9"},"meta":{"cwd":"/home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[368],"surfaceOp":"append"}
