     "," <","span"," class","=\"","tool","-name","\">","sl","ack","</","span",">\n","       "," <","span"," class","=\"","tool","-","args","\">","con","vers","ations",".info","</","span",">\n","       "," <","span"," class","=\"","tool","-result","\"><","check",">","完成","</","span",">\n","       "," <","span"," class","=\"","tool","-time","\">","0",".","4","s","</","span",">\n","       "," <","chev",">\n","     "," </","summary",">\n","     "," <","div"," class","=\"","tool","-body","\">\n","       "," <","div"," class","=\"","m","cp","-line","\">","server"," +"," version"," +"," transport"," +"," connected","</","div",">\n","       "," <","dl"," class","=\"","kv","\">","频道","/","成员","/","权限","</","dl",">\n","       "," <","div"," class","=\"","tool","-n","ote","\">","tool",":"," conversations",".info"," ·"," ","0",".","4","s","</","div",">\n","     "," </","div",">\n","   "," </","details",">\n"," "," </","div",">\n","</","li",">\n","```\n","-"," CSS"," `.","m","cp","-line","`,"," `.","kv","`"," were"," removed"," in"," v","3","!"," Need"," to"," restore"," these"," CSS"," rules",","," plus"," `.","kind","-m","cp","`"," node","/","left"," border"," and"," `","--","m","cp","`"," tokens",".\n","-"," Similarly"," `.","kind","-s","kill","`"," CSS",","," `.","proc","-d","esc","`,"," `.","ch","ips","`,"," `.","chip","`"," restored",".\n","-"," `.","kind","-t","ool","`"," CSS"," exists"," (","we"," kept"," it"," in"," v","3"," cleanup",")."," Check",":"," v","3"," kept"," `.","kind","-t","ool","`"," node","/","left"," border","."," Yes",","," we"," kept"," `.","kind","-t","ool","`"," in"," cleanup","."," Good",".\n","-"," `","--","m","cp","`"," tokens"," removed",";"," restore",".\n","-"," `.","kind","-s","kill","`"," styles"," removed",";"," restore",".\n","-"," `.","kind","-m","cp","`"," restore",".\n","-"," `.","m","cp","-line","`"," etc","."," restore",".\n","-"," `.","proc","-d","esc","`,"," `.","ch","ips","`,"," `.","chip","`"," restore",".\n","-"," `.","kind","-","vector","`"," exists",".\n","-"," CSS"," for"," `.","kind","`"," exists",".\n","-"," M","CP","/S","kill"," cards"," need"," `.","kind","-","*"," .","tool","-card","`"," left"," borders",".\n\n","**","User"," attachment"," CSS","**",":\n","-"," `.","att","achments","`,"," `.","attach","`"," styles"," exist"," (","we"," kept"," them",")."," Good",".\n","-"," User"," bubble"," style"," includes"," `.","prom","pt","-b","ubble"," .","attach","`"," over","rides","."," Good",".\n","-"," In"," v","3",","," `.","att","achments","`"," still"," in"," CSS","."," Yes",".\n\n","**","Com","poser"," attachment"," button","**:"," restore"," HTML",".\n\n","**","Header"," mobile"," menu"," button","**",":\n","-"," Add"," `<","button"," class","=\"","mobile","-side","bar","-btn","\""," id","=\"","mobile","Side","bar","Btn","\""," aria","-label","=\"","打开","侧","栏","\""," aria","-control","s","=\"","sidebar","\""," aria","-exp","anded","=\"","false","\"><","svg","><","use"," href","=\"#","i","-menu","\"/","></","svg","></","button",">`"," at"," start"," of"," chat","-head",".\n","-"," CSS",".\n\n","**","Side","bar"," CSS"," placement","**",":\n","Replace"," the"," CSS"," block"," from"," `.","app","{","`"," through"," before"," `","/*"," CH","AT"," COL","UMN"," */","`."," That"," includes"," `.","dot","`,"," `.","avatar","`,"," etc","."," We","'ll"," rewrite"," all",".\n","-"," The"," `.","dot","`"," styles"," need"," to"," remain"," (","used"," in"," trace",","," approval",","," etc",".)."," Include"," in"," new"," block",".\n","-"," `.","search","`,"," `.","session","`,"," etc",".\n","-"," `.","avatar","`.\n","-"," `.","ic","-s","un","/.","ic","-m","oon","`.\n\n","**","Remove"," old"," media"," queries","**"," for"," rail","/s","essions","."," Need"," to"," inspect"," ","100","4","-","108","0","."]},{"type":"chunk","time":1793892993835,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now replace `.app` + RAIL/SESSIONS CSS block with new sidebar CSS. Need to include `.search`, `.session`, `.dot`, `.avatar` etc. The new CSS will be comprehensive.\n\nLet me write the new CSS block:\n\n```css\n/* ---------- app shell ---------- */\n.app{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-w) minmax(0,1fr) var(--trace-w);\n  height:100dvh;\n  min-height:0;\n  transition:grid-template-columns .22s ease;\n}\n.app.trace-collapsed{grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-w) minmax(0,1fr) 0px}\n.app.trace-collapsed .trace{opacity:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed{grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-rail) minmax(0,1fr) var(--trace-w)}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed.trace-collapsed{grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-rail) minmax(0,1fr) 0px}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   SIDEBAR — DSH-style single column\n   ============================================================ */\n.sidebar{\n  position:relative;\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;\n  padding:6px 8px;\n  background:var(--paper-2);\n  border-right:1px solid var(--line);\n  z-index:20;\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n.sb-top{\n  flex:none;\n  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;\n  height:44px;\n  padding:0 2px 0 6px;\n}\n.sb-brand{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n  min-width:0;\n  color:var(--ink);\n  font-size:14px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.01em;\n  white-space:nowrap;\n}\n.sb-brand-mark{width:22px;height:22px;flex:none;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.sb-brand-mark .hot{fill:var(--amber);stroke:none}\n.sb-toggle{\n  display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;\n  width:28px;height:28px;\n  border-radius:5px;\n  color:var(--ink-3);\n  transition:color .15s,background .15s;\n}\n.sb-toggle:hover{color:var(--ink);background:var(--surface-2)}\n.sb-toggle .ic{width:16px;height:16px}\n\n.sb-new{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\n  height:34px;margin:8px 0 6px;padding:0 10px;\n  border:1px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius:6px;\n  background:var(--surface);\n  color:var(--ink);\n  font-size:12.5px;font-weight:550;\n  box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);\n  white-space:nowrap;\n  transition:border-color .15s, background .15s;\n}\n.sb-new:hover{border-color:var(--ink-3)}\n.sb-new .ic{width:15px;height:15px;flex:none}\n\n.sb-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;flex:none}\n.sb-nav-item{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;\n  height:31px;padding:0 9px;\n  border-radius:5px;\n  color:var(--ink-2);\n  font-size:12.5px;\n  white-space:nowrap;\n  transition:background .12s,color .12s;\n}\n.sb-nav-item .ic{width:16px;height:16px;flex:none;color:var(--ink-3)}\n.sb-nav-item:hover{background:rgba(20,27,32,.045);color:var(--ink)}\nhtml[data-theme=\"dark\"] .sb-nav-item:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05)}\n.sb-nav-item.is-active{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}\n.sb-nav-item.is-active .ic{color:var(--prussian)}\n\n.sb-sessions{\n  flex:1;min-height:0;\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n  margin-top:10px;\n  padding-top:10px;\n  border-top:1px solid var(--line);\n}\n.sb-sessions-head{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\n  padding:0 8px 6px;\n}\n.sb-sessions-head h2{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.03em}\n.sb-sessions-head .count{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ink-3)}\n.search{position:relative;display:block;margin:0 4px 6px}\n... search styles (same, adjust margin)\n.session-scroll{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;min-height:0;padding:0 2px 8px}\n... session styles same\n.sb-foot{\n  flex:none;\n  padding-top:8px;\n  border-top:1px solid var(--line);\n}\n.sb-conn{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\n  padding:0 8px 6px;\n  font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);\n}\n.sb-conn .spacer{flex:1}\n.sb-conn .mono{font-size:9.5px}\n.sb-account{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n  width:100%;\n  padding:6px 7px;\n  border-radius:6px;\n  text-align:left;\n  transition:background .12s;\n}\n.sb-account:hover{background:var(--surface-2)}\n.sb-account-text{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px}\n.sb-account-name{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.sb-account-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.sb-account-more{width:15px;height:15px;flex:none;color:var(--ink-3)}\n.avatar{...same...}\n\n/* collapsed rail */\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sidebar{padding:6px 0;align-items:center}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-top{height:44px;justify-content:center;padding:0;width:100%}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-brand{display:none}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-new{\n  width:36px;height:36px;margin:8px auto 6px;padding:0;justify-content:center;\n  border-color:transparent;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;\n}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-new:hover{background:var(--surface-2)}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-new span{display:none}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-nav{width:100%;align-items:center;gap:2px}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-nav-item{width:36px;height:36px;padding:0;justify-content:center;border-radius:7px}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-nav-item span{display:none}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-sessions{display:none}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-foot{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding-top:6px}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-conn{display:none}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-account{width:36px;height:36px;padding:0;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-account-text,\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-account-more{display:none}\n\n/* account menu */\n.account-menu{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:8px;right:8px;bottom:62px;\n  z-index:95;\n  display:none;\n  padding:6px;\n  border:1px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius:8px;\n  background:var(--surface);\n  box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);\n}\n.account-menu.is-open{display:block}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .account-menu{\n  position:fixed;\n  left:64px;right:auto;bottom:12px;\n  width:240px;\n}\n.account-menu-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:6px 7px 9px}\n.account-menu-head .avatar{width:32px;height:32px}\n.account-menu-name{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)}\n.account-menu-sub{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-3);margin-top:1px}\n.menu-sep{height:1px;margin:5px 4px;background:var(--line-2)}\n.menu-item{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n  width:100%;height:33px;padding:0 7px;\n  border-radius:5px;\n  color:var(--ink-2);\n  font-size:12.5px;text-align:left;\n  transition:background .12s,color .12s;\n}\n.menu-item:hover{background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--ink)}\n.menu-item .ic{width:15px;height:15px;color:var(--ink-3)}\n.menu-item.is-danger{color:var(--red)}\n.menu-item.is-danger .ic{color:var(--red)}\n.menu-version{\n  padding:7px 7px 3px;\n  font-family:var(--font-mono);\n  font-size:9px;color:var(--ink-3);\n  letter-spacing:.03em;\n}\n\n/* mobile */\n.sidebar-scrim{display:none}\n.mobile-sidebar-btn{display:none}\n```\n\nSearch styles: keep `.search` with margin 0 4px 6px; input height 32? DSH-like compact. Use 32. Session title 12.5.\n\n`.session-scroll` etc. Keep.\n\n`.session` padding 8px 8px 8px 10px; title 12.5; meta 10.5.\n\nSessions count: `<span class=\"mono\">8</span>`? Maybe. In sidebar head \"会话\" + count \"8\". Good.\n\n`.sb-sessions` needs `min-height:0` and `flex:1`.\n\n**Sidebar height distribution**:\n- sb-top 44\n- sb-new 34 + margins 14 = 48\n- sb-nav 4*31 + gaps 3 = 127\n- sb-sessions flex 1, margin-top 10 + padding-top 10 + head 17 + search 32 + list\n- sb-foot 70\n- total fixed ~44+48+127+10+10+17+32+70 = 358; at 900 height list ~540. Good.\n- At 768 height list ~410. Good.\n\n**Mobile sidebar**:\n- `.sidebar` fixed left 0 top 0 bottom 0 width 288, padding 6 8, transform translateX(-100%), box-shadow. z-index 80.\n- `.app.sidebar-open .sidebar{transform:none}`\n- scrim.\n- `.mobile-sidebar-btn{display:grid}`.\n- `.chat{padding-bottom:0}` (v3 mobile had padding bottom 58 for rail).\n- At ≤900, `.app` grid one column; `.app.sidebar-collapsed` also one column (JS removes class).\n- The sidebar toggle inside mobile closes drawer. JS.\n\n**Chat header** add mobile menu button. CSS:\n```css\n.mobile-sidebar-btn{display:none;...icon-btn-ish 30x30;margin-right:4px}\n@media(max-width:900px){.mobile-sidebar-btn{display:grid}}\n```\nPlace before `.chat-heading` in header. `.chat-head` flex; add button.\n\n**Right trace** top positions: at ≤1180 fixed top 68; works. At ≤900 sidebar drawer z80, scrim 75, trace 60. If trace open and sidebar open, sidebar over trace. Fine.\n- At ≤760 trace top 60 bottom 58? v3 set bottom 58 because bottom rail. Now no bottom rail, so bottom 0. Change `.trace{...top:60px;bottom:58px}` → bottom 0. At ≤760 no bottom nav. Good.\n- At ≤900 chat header 68; trace top 68. At ≤760 60. Good.\n- Sidebar drawer top 0 bottom 0, overlaps header; that's fine (drawer). The toggle inside.\n- Mobile menu button opens drawer; scrim covers header/chat. Good.\n\n**Sidebar brand/toggle in mobile**: when drawer open, brand + toggle visible (wide). Toggle closes (JS). Good.\n- The sidebar is 288 wide; `.app.sidebar-collapsed` removed; wide.\n- Account menu absolute in sidebar, bottom 62, width auto. Good.\n\n**Account menu on mobile**: sidebar is fixed with transform. The account menu is absolute inside; not fixed. `.app.sidebar-collapsed .account-menu` doesn't apply. Good. It won't be clipped? Sidebar overflow hidden; menu absolute inside bounds (left 8 right 8 bottom 62), so fine.\n- But menu might extend above; fine.\n\n**Collapsed rail sidebar**: `overflow:hidden` hides account menu? Account menu is fixed (via `.app.sidebar-collapsed .account-menu`), fixed not clipped. Good.\n- The sidebar in collapsed state has padding 6 0; width 56. account menu fixed left 64. Good.\n\n**Account menu position when collapsed**: `left:64px; bottom:12px; width:240px`. The sidebar is at left 0 width 56. Menu appears to the right, above bottom. Good.\n- z-index 95 above chat.\n\n**JS account menu**:\n```js\nvar accountBtn = document.getElementById('accountBtn');\nvar accountMenu = document.getElementById('accountMenu');\nfunction setAccountMenu(open) { accountMenu.classList.toggle('is-open', open); accountBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open)); }\naccountBtn.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); setAccountMenu(!accountMenu.classList.contains('is-open')); });\ndocument.addEventListener('click', function(e){ if (!accountMenu.contains(e.target) && !accountBtn.contains(e.target)) setAccountMenu(false); });\ndocument.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if (e.key === 'Escape') setAccountMenu(false); });\n// menu item click closes\naccountMenu.querySelectorAll('.menu-item').forEach(btn => btn.addEventListener('click', () => setAccountMenu(false)));\n```\n- But themeToggle is inside menu; its existing click listener runs, then menu item close listener runs. Order: both listeners on same element; theme listener added earlier, close listener later. Both run. Good.\n- `data-demo` items also have toast listeners; close listener later. Good.\n- Account menu head not a menu item.\n- When sidebar collapses, close menu. In sidebar toggle handler, call setAccountMenu(false).\n\n**JS sidebar**:\n```js\nvar sidebarToggle = document.getElementById('sidebarToggle');\nvar mobileSidebarBtn = document.getElementById('mobileSidebarBtn');\nvar sidebarScrim = document.getElementById('sidebarScrim');\nvar narrow = window.matchMedia('(max-width:900px)');\n\nfunction setSidebarExpanded(expanded) {\n  if (narrow.matches) {\n    app.classList.toggle('sidebar-open', expanded);\n  } else {\n    app.classList.toggle('sidebar-collapsed', !expanded);\n  }\n  sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(expanded));\n  sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-label', expanded ? '收起侧栏' : '展开侧栏');\n  setAccountMenu(false);\n}\n\nsidebarToggle.addEventListener('click', function(){\n  var expanded;\n  if (narrow.matches) expanded = !app.classList.contains('sidebar-open');\n  else expanded = app.classList.contains('sidebar-collapsed');\n  setSidebarExpanded(expanded);\n});\n\nmobileSidebarBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n  app.classList.add('sidebar-open');\n  sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded','true');\n});\nsidebarScrim.addEventListener('click', function(){\n  app.classList.remove('sidebar-open');\n  sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');\n});\n\nnarrow.addEventListener('change', function(){\n  app.classList.remove('sidebar-open');\n  if (!narrow.matches) {\n    app.classList.remove('sidebar-collapsed'); // or keep? reset to expanded\n  }\n  sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', narrow.matches ? 'false' : 'true');\n});\n```\n- On resize to desktop, remove collapsed to avoid stale state? Could preserve user's desktop collapse state; but if they collapsed on desktop, resized to mobile, then back, they might expect collapsed. Simpler reset to expanded. Fine.\n- On mobile, sidebar default hidden. `aria-expanded` of toggle inside hidden sidebar false. The mobile button has no aria-expanded? It should have `aria-controls=\"sidebar\" aria-expanded=\"false\"`. Update on open/close.\n  - Add id mobileSidebarBtn, aria-expanded false.\n  - JS set.\n- When a session is clicked on mobile, close sidebar. Add to session click handler:\n  ```js\n  if (narrow.matches) { app.classList.remove('sidebar-open'); setAccountMenu(false); }\n  ```\n- When nav item clicked on mobile, close? Could add data-demo and close. Not necessary.\n- Scrim only mobile.\n- Body/app class.\n\n**HTML sidebar**:\nNeed to preserve IDs: newSession, sessionSearch, sessions, session items. Let's write.\n\n```html\n  <aside class=\"sidebar\" id=\"sidebar\" aria-label=\"侧栏\">\n    <div class=\"sb-top\">\n      <a class=\"sb-brand\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Agent Hub 首页\">\n        <svg class=\"sb-brand-mark\">...</svg>\n        <span>Agent Hub</span>\n      </a>\n      <button class=\"sb-toggle\" id=\"sidebarToggle\" aria-label=\"收起侧栏\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"sidebar\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-panel\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <button class=\"sb-new\" id=\"newSession\">\n      <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-plus\"/></svg>\n      <span>新建会话</span>\n    </button>\n\n    <nav class=\"sb-nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\">\n      <button class=\"sb-nav-item is-active\" aria-current=\"page\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-chat\"/></svg><span>对话</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"sb-nav-item\" data-demo=\"智能体页（原型演示）\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-bot\"/></svg><span>智能体</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"sb-nav-item\" data-demo=\"任务页（原型演示）\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-flow\"/></svg><span>任务</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"sb-nav-item\" data-demo=\"知识库页（原型演示）\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-db\"/></svg><span>知识库</span>\n      </button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <div class=\"sb-sessions\">\n      <div class=\"sb-sessions-head\">\n        <h2>会话</h2>\n        <span class=\"mono\">8</span>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"search\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg>\n        <input id=\"sessionSearch\" ... />\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"session-scroll\" id=\"sessionScroll\">\n        ... groups ...\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sb-foot\">\n      <div class=\"sb-conn\">\n        <span class=\"dot is-ok\"></span>\n        <span>A2A 已连接</span>\n        <span class=\"spacer\"></span>\n        <span class=\"mono\">3 ONLINE</span>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"sb-account\" id=\"accountBtn\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accountMenu\">\n        <span class=\"avatar\">AH</span>\n        <span class=\"sb-account-text\">\n          <span class=\"sb-account-name\">个人工作区</span>\n          <span class=\"sb-account-sub\">3 个智能体在线</span>\n        </span>\n        <svg class=\"ic sb-account-more\"><use href=\"#i-more\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"account-menu\" id=\"accountMenu\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"账号菜单\">\n      <div class=\"account-menu-head\">\n        <span class=\"avatar\">AH</span>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"account-menu-name\">个人工作区</div>\n          <div class=\"account-menu-sub\">AH · v0.1.0</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"menu-sep\"></div>\n      <button class=\"menu-item\" role=\"menuitem\" data-demo=\"账号资料（原型演示）\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-user\"/></svg>账号\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"menu-item\" role=\"menuitem\" data-demo=\"设置页（原型演示）\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-sliders\"/></svg>设置\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"menu-item\" role=\"menuitem\" id=\"themeToggle\">\n        <svg class=\"ic ic-moon\"><use href=\"#i-moon\"/></svg>\n        <svg class=\"ic ic-sun\"><use href=\"#i-sun\"/></svg>\n        切换深色主题\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"menu-sep\"></div>\n      <button class=\"menu-item is-danger\" role=\"menuitem\" data-demo=\"退出登录（原型演示）\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-logout\"/></svg>退出登录\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"menu-version\">Agent Hub v0.1.0 · M0</div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n```\n- Theme toggle: two icons with display switching (existing CSS `.ic-sun/.ic-moon` under html[data-theme]). In menu, the `.ic-moon` and `.ic-sun` both; CSS shows one. The menu text \"切换深色主题\" should update when theme changes. Existing JS only toggles data-theme and toast. We can add a `<span id=\"themeLabel\">切换深色主题</span>` and JS update. Or keep static \"主题：深色/浅色\". Simpler: menu item text \"切换深色主题\" static; clicking toggles. If in dark, text is wrong. Could label \"深浅主题\" generic. Use \"切换主题\". Then no need update. Good. Use \"切换主题\".\n- Theme icons: both, CSS shows sun in dark, moon in light. The `.ic-sun`/`.ic-moon` display rules currently global. In the menu item, both 15px icons will occupy space? `.ic-sun{display:none}` default, `.ic-moon{display:block}`, dark flips. Good. Only one visible.\n- Note: existing `.ic-sun`/`.ic-moon` CSS rules are inside RAIL block; we must preserve them in the new CSS. Add to sidebar CSS:\n  ```css\n  html[data-theme=\"dark\"] .ic-sun{display:block}\n  html[data-theme=\"dark\"] .ic-moon{display:none}\n  .ic-sun{display:none}\n  .ic-moon{display:block}\n  ```\n- The old `.avatar` style must be preserved. Add.\n- New icons: `i-more` (3 dots), `i-user`, `i-logout`, maybe `i-menu` for mobile. `i-panel` exists. Use `i-menu` for mobile hamburger. Add symbols.\n  - `i-more`: `<circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.4\"/>` filled? `.ic` stroke; circles with r 1.4 and stroke will show small rings. Could use fill=\"currentColor\" on circles; but `.ic` sets fill:none. Add inline `fill=\"currentColor\"` to circles. Or use `<path d=\"M5 12h.01M12 12h.01M19 12h.01\"/>` with stroke-linecap round, width 2.5? The `.ic` stroke width 1.6, dots small. Better `<circle ... fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/>`. Good.\n  - `i-user`: circle + path.\n  - `i-logout`: door + arrow.\n  - `i-menu`: 3 lines.\n- The sidebar brand logo uses `#i-...`? Define a symbol `i-brand` or inline path (same as old brand mark). Use inline path in the `<svg class=\"sb-brand-mark\">`. The old brand mark class was `.brand-mark`. We'll use inline paths with new class. Good.\n- The old rail brand has `href=\"#\"` anchor; keep.\n\n**Session count 8**? Sessions: 3 today + 2 yesterday + 2 October = 7. Count 7. Use \"7\". Or omit count. Use 7.\n- Sessions list: Q3 active, 退款政策, release notes, payment, 知识库检索, 客服话术, A2A 接入 = 7. Good.\n\n**Sidebar footer ONLINE 3**: agents main + data-analyst + editorial = 3. v3 had 4 with publisher. v4 removes publisher (MCP handling). Need to update trace agents to 3 and sessions/account to 3 ONLINE. Good.\n\n**Restore A2A and MCP**:\n- A2A group 2 agents completed.\n- MCP card after A2A.\n- Approval tool `mcp_slack__post_message`.\n- Right trace 7 steps.\n- Right agents 3.\n- Account 3 online.\n\n**Thread HTML**:\nCurrent v3 thread has assistant intro, search, report, A2A, approval. Need to insert:\n- After intro: skill card.\n- After search: tool card (tickets.aggregate).\n- After A2A: MCP card.\n- Update approval.\n- Restore attachment chip in user message.\n- Composer attachment button.\n- Intro text mention skill/tool/MCP? Update: \"我先加载周报技能，检索分类口径并聚合工单；草稿完成后远程核对数字与措辞，发布前用 Slack MCP 校验频道。\" Good.\n- Copy data-copy update.\n- User message mention CSV? \"根据知识库里的 Q3 客服复盘和工单表...\" with attachment. Maybe keep \"根据知识库里的 Q3 客服复盘\". Add attachment chip `q3-support-tickets.csv · 128 行`. The tickets.aggregate reads the CSV. Good.\n- User text: \"根据知识库里的 Q3 客服复盘和这份工单表，整理一份团队周报。数字让 data-analyst 核对，措辞让 editorial-reviewer 过一遍；发布到 #support-weekly 之前先问我。\"\n- Attachment chip.\n- Skill card: weekly-report v1.2, template, etc.\n- Search card: `search_knowledge` (vector) remains.\n- Tool card: tickets.aggregate, args `issue_type · 128 rows`, body reads CSV, group_by 5.\n- Report.\n- A2A group.\n- MCP card.\n- Approval.\n\n**Right trace**:\n- 7 steps as above. Count 7.\n- Last step publisher? No: \"发送审批\" with sub \"HITL · mcp_slack__post_message\" is-wait.\n- On approve, last step complete with sub \"MCP · Slack 已发送\". JS `updateTrackOutcome('MCP · Slack 已发送', true)`.\n- On reject, \"已取消 · Slack 发送\".\n- Approval tool in JS messages: \"已批准，主智能体已恢复运行并通过 Slack MCP 发布。\" and completion \"已批准，Slack 消息已发布。\"\n\n**MCP card**:\n```html\n<li class=\"entry entry-proc kind-mcp\">\n  <span class=\"node\"></span>\n  <div class=\"entry-body\">\n    <details class=\"tool-card\" open>\n      <summary>\n        <span class=\"kind\">MCP</span>\n        <span class=\"tool-name\">slack</span>\n        <span class=\"tool-args\">conversations.info</span>\n        <span class=\"tool-result\"><check>完成</span>\n        <span class=\"tool-time\">0.4s</span>\n        <chev>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"tool-body\">\n        <div class=\"mcp-line\">server + version + transport + connected</div>\n        <dl class=\"kv\">频道/成员/权限</dl>\n        <div class=\"tool-note\">tool: conversations.info · 0.4s</div>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</li>\n```\n- CSS `.mcp-line`, `.kv` were removed in v3! Need to restore these CSS rules, plus `.kind-mcp` node/left border and `--mcp` tokens.\n- Similarly `.kind-skill` CSS, `.proc-desc`, `.chips`, `.chip` restored.\n- `.kind-tool` CSS exists (we kept it in v3 cleanup). Check: v3 kept `.kind-tool` node/left border. Yes, we kept `.kind-tool` in cleanup. Good.\n- `--mcp` tokens removed; restore.\n- `.kind-skill` styles removed; restore.\n- `.kind-mcp` restore.\n- `.mcp-line` etc. restore.\n- `.proc-desc`, `.chips`, `.chip` restore.\n- `.kind-vector` exists.\n- CSS for `.kind` exists.\n- MCP/Skill cards need `.kind-* .tool-card` left borders.\n\n**User attachment CSS**:\n- `.attachments`, `.attach` styles exist (we kept them). Good.\n- User bubble style includes `.prompt-bubble .attach` overrides. Good.\n- In v3, `.attachments` still in CSS. Yes.\n\n**Composer attachment button**: restore HTML.\n\n**Header mobile menu button**:\n- Add `<button class=\"mobile-sidebar-btn\" id=\"mobileSidebarBtn\" aria-label=\"打开侧栏\" aria-controls=\"sidebar\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg><use href=\"#i-menu\"/></svg></button>` at start of chat-head.\n- CSS.\n\n**Sidebar CSS placement**:\nReplace the CSS block from `.app{` through before `/* CHAT COLUMN */`. That includes `.dot`, `.avatar`, etc. We'll rewrite all.\n- The `.dot` styles need to remain (used in trace, approval, etc.). Include in new block.\n- `.search`, `.session`, etc.\n- `.avatar`.\n- `.ic-sun/.ic-moon`.\n\n**Remove old media queries** for rail/sessions. Need to inspect 1004-1080."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1793892993836,"chunk":{"type":"block-start","index":1,"blockType":"tool-call"}},{"type":"tool-call-chunks","time0":1793892993836,"index":1,"dt":[],"id":"call_00_3NkkLDbvbk1wvEP77pxh7912","name":"read","args":[""]},{"type":"tool-call-chunks","time0":1793892993850,"index":1,"dt":[0,0,0,12,0,0,0,16,1,0,0,0,0,22,0,0,0,0,11,1,0,0,0,0,13,1,0,0,0,33,0,0,15,0,24,0,0,16,0,15,28],"id":"call_00_3NkkLDbvbk1wvEP77pxh7912","args":["{\"","file","_path","\"",": \"","/","home","/z","ha","od","an","/work","/","Node","Js","Projects","/","agent","-h","ub","-web","/docs","/pro","t","otypes","/ui","-v","4",".html","\"",", \"","limit","\"",": ","120",", \"","offset","\"",": ","100","0","}"]},{"type":"chunk","time":1793892994062,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_3NkkLDbvbk1wvEP77pxh7912","name":"read","arguments":"{\"file_path\": \"/home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/prototypes/ui-v4.html\", \"limit\": 120, \"offset\": 1000}"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1793892994062,"chunk":{"type":"usage","usage":{"inputTokens":2526,"outputTokens":7169,"cacheReadTokens":299136,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":308831}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1793892994062,"chunk":{"type":"finish","reason":{"kind":"tool-calls"},"replayState":{"response":{"kind":"deepseek-messages","version":1,"model":"deepseek-flash"},"blocks":[{"type":"reasoning","signature":"14139a27-3811-4dd3-80d5-37bf8e1867de"},{"type":"tool-call"}]}}}]},"surfaceOp":"append"}
