ration",":"," `.","app",".t","race","-coll","apsed"," .","trace","{","op","acity",":","0","...","}`"," and"," in"," ","118","0"," media"," `.","app",".t","race","-coll","apsed"," .","trace","{","op","acity",":","1",";","pointer","-e","vents",":","auto","}`","."," Keep",".\n","-"," `.","app",".s","ide","bar","-coll","apsed",".t","race","-coll","apsed","`"," rule",".\n","-"," At"," ","118","0",","," `.","app",".t","race","-coll","apsed","`"," grid"," rule","."," Ensure"," it"," doesn","'t"," conflict"," with"," sidebar"," collapsed",".\n","-"," At"," ","900",","," all"," grid"," one"," column",".\n\n","Also",":"," the"," chat"," header"," min","-height"," ","68",";"," sidebar"," top"," ","44"," +"," padding"," ","6"," ="," ","50",";"," not"," aligned"," with"," chat"," header","."," D","SH"," sidebar"," top"," logo"," is"," ","52","."," Chat"," header"," ","68","."," Fine",".\n","-"," The"," sidebar"," footer"," bottom"," aligns"," with"," chat"," composer"," bottom","?"," Side","bar"," full"," height","."," Good",".\n\n","Side","bar"," width"," ","288"," at"," ","144","0","."," Chat"," column"," ","144","0","-","288","-","332","=","820","."," `","stream","-in","ner","`"," max"," ","812",","," good","."," At"," ","128","0",":"," sidebar"," ","272"," +"," trace"," ","304"," ->"," chat"," ","704","."," Fine",".\n\n","When"," sidebar"," collapsed"," ","56",","," chat"," ","105","2","."," Good",".\n\n","At"," ","118","0",":"," sidebar"," ","272"," +"," chat"," ","908",";"," trace"," drawer","."," Fine",".\n","At"," ","900",":"," sidebar"," drawer",","," chat"," ","900","."," Good",".\n\n","Now"," CSS",".\n\n","Also"," `.","mobile","-side","bar","-btn","`"," base"," style"," should"," be"," defined"," outside"," media"," (","display"," none",")"," so"," the"," element"," doesn","'t"," show","."," We","'ll"," define"," base",":\n","```","css","\n",".m","obile","-side","bar","-btn","{\n"," "," display",":n","one",";","place","-items",":","center",";","flex",":n","one",";\n"," "," width",":","30","px",";","height",":","30","px",";","margin","-right",":","8","px",";\n"," "," border",":","1","px"," solid"," var","(--","line",");","border","-radius",":","5","px",";\n"," "," background",":","var","(--","surface",");","color",":","var","(--","ink","-","2",");\n","}\n",".m","obile","-side","bar","-btn"," .","ic","{","width",":","16","px",";","height",":","16","px","}\n","```\n","Then"," media"," `","display",":","grid","`.\n\n","The"," chat","-head"," has"," `","gap",":","20","px","`",";"," adding"," button"," with"," margin","-right"," ","8","."," Fine","."," On"," desktop"," hidden",".\n\n","`.","sidebar","-sc","rim","`"," base"," display"," none",".\n\n","`.","sidebar","`"," `","overflow",":h","idden","`"," —"," account"," menu"," fixed"," when"," collapsed",";"," good",".\n\n","`.","sb","-s","essions","`"," border","-top"," and"," margin","."," Good",".\n\n","`.","session","`"," left"," border"," active","."," Good",".\n\n","`.","sb","-s","essions","-head"," .","mon","o","`"," count","."," Good",".\n\n","`.","sb","-","account","`"," focus"," visible",".\n\n","`.","account","-menu","`"," absolute",";"," when"," sidebar"," scroll","?"," Side","bar"," doesn","'t"," scroll",";"," sessions"," scroll"," inside","."," Good",".\n\n","`.","account","-menu","`"," in"," collapsed"," fixed",";"," z"," ","95",";"," if"," chat"," header"," z","?"," No","."," Good",".\n\n","`.","account","-menu","`"," on"," mobile"," fixed","?"," It","'s"," absolute"," within"," fixed"," sidebar","."," Good",".\n\n","Let","'s"," write","."]},{"type":"chunk","time":1793893024971,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"We need continue the v4 work. We have copied v3 to v4. Need to implement the sidebar restructure and restore features. Let's proceed carefully.\n\nWe need to inspect the current v4 HTML rail/sessions block and CSS. We have read CSS 130-330 and 1000-1119. Need to replace.\n\nLet me plan exact patches:\n\n### CSS tokens\nCurrent `:root` has `--nav-w:68px; --sessions-w:284px; --trace-w:332px;`. Replace with `--sidebar-w:288px; --sidebar-rail:56px; --trace-w:332px;`.\n\nDark `--rail` variables remain unused? The new sidebar light uses paper-2/surface. We can keep rail vars unused; better remove? Not necessary. But no dark spine. Could remove `--rail`, `--rail-ink`, `--rail-muted`, `--rail-line` from both token blocks. Unused. Cleanliness. But removing may affect nothing. Do it.\n\nWait, the user may still want some dark element? DSH sidebar is light. The dark rail is gone. Remove unused tokens.\n\n### CSS app shell + sidebar\nReplace from `/* ---------- app shell ---------- */` through the end of sessions column (line before `/* ============================================================\\n   CHAT COLUMN`). Use Python slicing.\n\nNew CSS as designed. Need to include `.search`, `.session`, `.dot`, `.avatar`, `.ic-sun/.ic-moon`, `.sb-*`, `.account-menu`, `.sidebar-scrim`, `.mobile-sidebar-btn`, collapsed states.\n\nLet me write it fully and carefully.\n\n```css\n/* ---------- app shell ---------- */\n.app{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-w) minmax(0,1fr) var(--trace-w);\n  height:100dvh;\n  min-height:0;\n  transition:grid-template-columns .22s ease;\n}\n.app.trace-collapsed{grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-w) minmax(0,1fr) 0px}\n.app.trace-collapsed .trace{opacity:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed{grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-rail) minmax(0,1fr) var(--trace-w)}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed.trace-collapsed{grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-rail) minmax(0,1fr) 0px}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   SIDEBAR — single column, DSH-style\n   ============================================================ */\n.sidebar{\n  position:relative;\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;\n  padding:6px 8px;\n  background:var(--paper-2);\n  border-right:1px solid var(--line);\n  z-index:20;\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n.sb-top{\n  flex:none;\n  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\n  gap:6px;height:44px;padding:0 2px 0 6px;\n}\n.sb-brand{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-width:0;\n  color:var(--ink);\n  font-size:14px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.01em;\n  white-space:nowrap;\n}\n.sb-brand-mark{width:22px;height:22px;flex:none;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.sb-brand-mark .hot{fill:var(--amber);stroke:none}\n.sb-toggle{\n  display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;\n  width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:5px;\n  color:var(--ink-3);\n  transition:color .15s,background .15s;\n}\n.sb-toggle:hover{color:var(--ink);background:var(--surface-2)}\n.sb-toggle .ic{width:16px;height:16px}\n\n.sb-new{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\n  height:34px;margin:6px 0 8px;padding:0 10px;\n  border:1px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius:6px;\n  background:var(--surface);\n  color:var(--ink);\n  font-size:12.5px;font-weight:550;\n  box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);\n  white-space:nowrap;\n  transition:border-color .15s,background .15s;\n}\n.sb-new:hover{border-color:var(--ink-3)}\n.sb-new .ic{width:15px;height:15px;flex:none}\n\n.sb-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;flex:none}\n.sb-nav-item{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;\n  height:31px;padding:0 9px;\n  border-radius:5px;\n  color:var(--ink-2);\n  font-size:12.5px;white-space:nowrap;\n  transition:background .12s,color .12s;\n}\n.sb-nav-item .ic{width:16px;height:16px;flex:none;color:var(--ink-3)}\n.sb-nav-item:hover{background:rgba(20,27,32,.045);color:var(--ink)}\nhtml[data-theme=\"dark\"] .sb-nav-item:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05)}\n.sb-nav-item.is-active{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}\n.sb-nav-item.is-active .ic{color:var(--prussian)}\n\n.sb-sessions{\n  flex:1;min-height:0;\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n  margin-top:10px;padding-top:10px;\n  border-top:1px solid var(--line);\n}\n.sb-sessions-head{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\n  padding:0 8px 6px;\n}\n.sb-sessions-head h2{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.03em}\n.sb-sessions-head .mono{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ink-3)}\n\n.search{position:relative;display:block;margin:0 4px 6px}\n.search .ic{position:absolute;left:9px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--ink-3)}\n.search input{\n  width:100%;height:32px;padding:0 9px 0 30px;\n  border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:6px;\n  background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--ink);\n  font:inherit;font-size:12px;outline:none;\n  transition:border-color .15s,background .15s;\n}\n.search input::placeholder{color:var(--ink-3)}\n.search input:focus{border-color:var(--line);background:var(--surface)}\n\n.session-scroll{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;min-height:0;padding:0 2px 8px}\n.session-group{padding-top:6px}\n.group-label{padding:0 8px 5px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.03em}\n.session{\n  display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;\n  padding:8px 8px 8px 10px;\n  border-radius:6px;\n  border-left:2px solid transparent;\n  transition:background .12s;\n}\n.session:hover{background:rgba(20,27,32,.045)}\nhtml[data-theme=\"dark\"] .session:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04)}\n.session.is-active{background:var(--surface);border-left-color:var(--ink);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}\n.session-title{display:block;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-.005em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.session.is-active .session-title{font-weight:650}\n.session-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;margin-top:3px;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-3)}\n.session-meta .dot{width:5px;height:5px}\n.session-meta .sep{opacity:.5}\n\n.dot{display:inline-block;flex:none;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink-3)}\n.dot.is-live{background:var(--amber);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--amber-soft);animation:pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}\n.dot.is-ok{background:var(--green)}\n.dot.is-warn{background:var(--red)}\n\n.sb-foot{flex:none;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.sb-conn{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\n  padding:0 8px 6px;\n  font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);\n}\n.sb-conn .spacer{flex:1}\n.sb-conn .mono{font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n.sb-account{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n  width:100%;padding:6px 7px;border-radius:6px;text-align:left;\n  transition:background .12s;\n}\n.sb-account:hover{background:var(--surface-2)}\n.sb-account-text{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px}\n.sb-account-name{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.sb-account-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.sb-account-more{width:15px;height:15px;flex:none;color:var(--ink-3)}\n\n.avatar{\n  display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;\n  width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;\n  background:var(--amber);color:#191307;\n  font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em;\n}\n\n/* theme icon swap (moved into account menu) */\nhtml[data-theme=\"dark\"] .ic-sun{display:block}\nhtml[data-theme=\"dark\"] .ic-moon{display:none}\n.ic-sun{display:none}\n.ic-moon{display:block}\n\n/* collapsed rail */\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sidebar{padding:6px 0;align-items:center}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-top{width:100%;height:44px;justify-content:center;padding:0}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-brand{display:none}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-new{\n  width:36px;height:36px;margin:6px auto 8px;padding:0;justify-content:center;\n  border-color:transparent;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;\n}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-new:hover{background:var(--surface-2)}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-new span{display:none}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-nav{width:100%;align-items:center;gap:2px}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-nav-item{width:36px;height:36px;padding:0;justify-content:center;border-radius:7px}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-nav-item span{display:none}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-sessions{display:none}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-foot{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding-top:6px}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-conn{display:none}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-account{width:36px;height:36px;padding:0;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-account-text,\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-account-more{display:none}\n\n/* account menu */\n.account-menu{\n  position:absolute;left:8px;right:8px;bottom:62px;z-index:95;\n  display:none;padding:6px;\n  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;\n  background:var(--surface);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);\n}\n.account-menu.is-open{display:block}\n.app.sidebar-collapsed .account-menu{position:fixed;left:64px;right:auto;bottom:12px;width:240px}\n.account-menu-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:6px 7px 9px}\n.account-menu-head .avatar{width:32px;height:32px}\n.account-menu-name{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)}\n.account-menu-sub{margin-top:1px;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-3)}\n.menu-sep{height:1px;margin:5px 4px;background:var(--line-2)}\n.menu-item{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n  width:100%;height:33px;padding:0 7px;\n  border-radius:5px;color:var(--ink-2);\n  font-size:12.5px;text-align:left;\n  transition:background .12s,color .12s;\n}\n.menu-item:hover{background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--ink)}\n.menu-item .ic{width:15px;height:15px;color:var(--ink-3)}\n.menu-item.is-danger{color:var(--red)}\n.menu-item.is-danger .ic{color:var(--red)}\n.menu-version{padding:7px 7px 3px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.03em}\n\n/* mobile */\n.mobile-sidebar-btn{display:none}\n.sidebar-scrim{display:none}\n```\n\nNeed `.mobile-sidebar-btn` style in mobile media:\n```css\n.mobile-sidebar-btn{\n  display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;\n  width:30px;height:30px;margin-right:8px;\n  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;\n  background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink-2);\n}\n.mobile-sidebar-btn .ic{width:16px;height:16px}\n```\nDefine base display none? Use `.mobile-sidebar-btn{display:none;...}` then media `display:grid`.\n\nBut `.chat-head` currently has `.chat-actions` at end; mobile button inserted before `.chat-heading`. Good.\n\n### Responsive CSS\nReplace 1004-1068 block:\n```css\n@media (max-width:1280px){\n  :root{--sidebar-w:272px;--trace-w:304px}\n  ...\n}\n@media (max-width:1180px){\n  .app{grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-w) minmax(0,1fr)}\n  .app.sidebar-collapsed{grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-rail) minmax(0,1fr)}\n  .app.trace-collapsed{grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-w) minmax(0,1fr)}\n  .app.sidebar-collapsed.trace-collapsed{grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-rail) minmax(0,1fr)}\n  .trace{position:fixed;right:0;top:68px;bottom:0;...}\n  .app.trace-open .trace{transform:translateX(0)}\n  .app.trace-collapsed .trace{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n}\n@media (max-width:900px){\n  .app,\n  .app.sidebar-collapsed,\n  .app.trace-collapsed,\n  .app.sidebar-collapsed.trace-collapsed{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}\n  .sidebar{\n    position:fixed;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:var(--sidebar-w);\n    z-index:80;transform:translateX(-100%);\n    transition:transform .22s ease;\n    box-shadow:24px 0 48px -32px rgba(0,0,0,.45);\n  }\n  .app.sidebar-open .sidebar{transform:none}\n  .mobile-sidebar-btn{display:grid}\n  .sidebar-scrim{\n    display:block;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:75;\n    background:rgba(20,27,32,.38);\n    opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s;\n  }\n  .app.sidebar-open .sidebar-scrim{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n  .stream-inner{padding:22px 20px 12px}\n  .composer-wrap{padding:8px 16px 12px}\n  .chat-head{padding:0 16px}\n}\n@media (max-width:760px){\n  .app{height:100dvh}\n  .chat-head{min-height:60px}\n  .chat-sub .sep,.chat-sub .mono{display:none}\n  .chat-actions .status-chip{display:none}\n  .stream-inner{padding:18px 14px 10px}\n  .entry{padding-left:38px}\n  .thread::before{left:15px}\n  .node{left:11.5px}\n  .thread-foot{margin-left:38px}\n  .composer-wrap{padding:6px 10px 10px}\n  .composer-meta .keyhint{display:none}\n  .trace{width:min(340px,88vw);top:60px;bottom:0}\n  .tool-args{display:none}\n  .data-table{font-size:12px}\n  .prose h3{font-size:17px}\n  .sidebar{width:min(288px,86vw)}\n}\n```\n- Remove `.chat{padding-bottom:58px}` because no bottom rail.\n- The v2 additions media block at 1183 has `.prompt-bubble` etc. Keep.\n- The trace media top 68 in 1180, top 60 in 760. Good.\n- At ≤900, sidebar drawer top 0; chat header behind scrim. The mobile menu button visible. Good.\n- At ≤900, `.sidebar` has `padding` from base 6 8; width 288. Internal wide. Good.\n- `.app.sidebar-collapsed` rules could still make the sidebar internal rail if class remains; JS removes on mobile. Also CSS at ≤900 could force wide styles? To be safe, add:\n  ```css\n  @media (max-width:900px){\n    .app.sidebar-collapsed .sidebar{padding:6px 8px;align-items:stretch}\n    .app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-brand{display:flex}\n    .app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-new{width:auto;height:34px;margin:6px 0 8px;padding:0 10px;justify-content:flex-start;border-color:var(--line);background:var(--surface);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}\n    .app.sidebar-collapsed .sb-new span{display:inline}\n    ...\n  }\n  ```\n  This is messy. Better JS removes `sidebar-collapsed` when entering mobile. Add resize handler. If the class remains due to load at mobile, initial code should remove it. On page load, if narrow, remove. Good.\n  - `narrow.addEventListener('change', ...)` removes both classes when crossing. On load, call `if (narrow.matches) app.classList.remove('sidebar-collapsed')`.\n  - If user collapses desktop then resizes to mobile, handler removes. Good.\n  - If mobile then resizes desktop, remove `sidebar-open`, keep expanded. Good.\n- At mobile, `.sidebar` is fixed; `.app` grid one column. Good.\n\n### HTML replacement for rail+sessions\nNeed to include account menu and scrim. Scrim should be inside app after sidebar or before chat:\n```html\n<div class=\"sidebar-scrim\" id=\"sidebarScrim\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n```\nPlace after `</aside>` and before `<main class=\"chat\">`. It's fixed only mobile. z-index 75. Sidebar 80. Chat below.\n- The scrim in desktop `display:none`. Good.\n\n### Chat header mobile button\nAdd at start:\n```html\n<button class=\"mobile-sidebar-btn\" id=\"mobileSidebarBtn\" aria-label=\"打开侧栏\" aria-controls=\"sidebar\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n  <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-menu\"/></svg>\n</button>\n```\nNeed `i-menu` symbol.\n\n### Icons\nAdd symbols: `i-menu`, `i-more`, `i-user`, `i-logout`. Also `i-stack` no longer used (sessions nav removed); can leave.\n\n### Thread restore\nNeed patch. Current v4 thread = v3. We'll replace sections:\n1. User message: add attachment.\n2. Intro: add skill mention.\n3. Insert skill card after intro.\n4. Insert tickets.aggregate after search.\n5. Insert MCP after A2A.\n6. Replace approval.\n7. Composer add attachment button.\n8. Trace 7 steps.\n9. Agents 3 (remove publisher).\n10. Account 3 online.\n11. Runtime messages/JS.\n\nLet's inspect v4 thread exact current content. We know from v3. Use string anchors. We'll do patches step by step.\n\n### Right trace\nCurrent v4 trace from v3:\n- 4 steps: search, data, editorial, publisher wait.\n- Agents 4 incl publisher.\nNeed replace track with 7 steps and agents section remove publisher. Could replace the whole trace aside again, easier. We'll construct new trace HTML.\n\n### JS\n- Add sidebar/account logic.\n- Remove nothing related to old rail (none).\n- Theme toggle ID now in account menu. Existing listener uses `getElementById('themeToggle')`. Good.\n- Account menu closing.\n- Mobile scrim.\n- Media query narrow 900.\n- Existing `wide` media query for trace 1181. Keep.\n- Session click handler: add close mobile sidebar.\n- `newSession`, search.\n- Need to ensure `themeToggle` exists (in menu). Good.\n- Sidebar toggle exists.\n- Mobile button, scrim.\n- Maybe close account menu when clicking theme etc.\n\n### Account menu theme label\nUse \"切换主题\" static. Icons swap.\n- Existing themeToggle listener changes root dataset and toast. Menu item close listener will run. Good.\n- The menu displays only one icon due to CSS.\n\n### CSS for `.ic-sun/.ic-moon`\nKeep.\n\n### Account menu in collapsed rail\nWhen collapsed, menu fixed. But `.sidebar` has `overflow:hidden`; fixed element inside overflow hidden is not clipped unless transform; sidebar has no transform desktop. Good.\n- Account menu z-index 95; chat header etc. Fine.\n- When menu open and sidebar collapses, JS closes menu.\n\n### Sidebar collapsed state and account menu\nWhen sidebar collapsed, `.sb-account` shows only avatar. Clicking opens menu fixed left 64. Good.\n- The account button aria-expanded toggles.\n\n### Sidebar toggle collapsed\n`aria-expanded` false. Good.\n\n### Mobile drawer and trace drawer interaction\n- If trace is open and user opens sidebar, sidebar z 80 > trace 60, scrim 75 > trace. Good.\n- If sidebar open and user clicks scrim, close.\n- If sidebar open and user clicks trace panel icon in chat header, the header is behind scrim; can't. Fine.\n- The mobile menu button in chat header is behind scrim when sidebar open; scrim covers; clicking scrim closes. Good.\n\n### Sidebar brand link\n`href=\"#\"` click may scroll; fixed layout. Fine.\n\n### Search input in sidebar\nWorks.\n\n### Session count\n7.\n\n### Sidebar \"设置\" menu\nMenu item with data-demo. Good.\n- User said \"设置移入账号头像处，点击弹出可选择\" — done.\n- Theme also in menu.\n- Navigation no settings.\n\n### DSH style\nSingle column, collapsible rail. Good.\n\n### Restore MCP/skill/tool\nNeed CSS restore. In v3 CSS, we removed `--mcp` tokens and skill/mcp styles. Re-add:\n- tokens `--mcp`, `--mcp-soft` light/dark.\n- `.kind-skill .node`, `.kind-mcp .node`, `.kind-skill .tool-card`, `.kind-mcp .tool-card`.\n- `.proc-desc`, `.chips`, `.chip`.\n- `.mcp-line`, `.mcp-server`, `.mcp-ok`, `.kv`.\n- Possibly `.chips` etc.\n- The `.kind-tool` styles still exist.\n- Add these in v2 components area or v4 additions. Easiest: append a v4 CSS block before reduced-motion with all restored styles. Since specificities are same and later, applies. Tokens must be in `:root` and dark block (add).\n- `--mcp` tokens add to root/dark.\n\n### Attachment\n`.attachments/.attach` CSS exists. User bubble has overrides. Add HTML.\n\n### Composer attachment button\nAdd with data-demo. CSS exists `.composer-tool`.\n\n### Tool card MCP body uses `.kv`; restore.\n\n### Trace MCP step etc.\n\n### Approval\n- Tool `mcp_slack__post_message`.\n- Execution `slack-mcp · streamable-http`.\n- Target.\n- Side effects.\n- JS messages.\n\n### Right agents\n3.\n\n### Sessions/account `3 ONLINE`, `3 个智能体在线`.\n\n### Header sub \"待审批\" (already). Good.\n\n### User message and copy text\n- Add attachment.\n- Intro mentions skill and MCP.\n\n### Skill card\nUse v2 content:\n```html\n<li class=\"entry entry-proc kind-skill\">\n  <span class=\"node\"></span>\n  <div class=\"entry-body\">\n    <details class=\"tool-card\" open>\n      <summary>\n        <span class=\"kind\">技能</span>\n        <span class=\"tool-name\">weekly-report</span>\n        <span class=\"tool-args\">v1.2 · 周报生成</span>\n        <span class=\"tool-result\"><svg check/>已加载</span>\n        <span class=\"tool-time\">0.1s</span>\n        <chev>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"tool-body\">\n        <p class=\"proc-desc\">技能提供固定章节、口径引用规则与团队语气，模板来自知识库 templates 目录。</p>\n        <div class=\"chips\">...</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-note\">trigger: 周报 · scope: run_9a8b7c · source: builtin</div>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</li>\n```\n- `run_9a8b7c`.\n- The skill card is \"main-agent skill\" - user wants it. Good.\n\n### tickets.aggregate card\n```html\n<li class=\"entry entry-proc kind-tool\">\n  ...\n  <details class=\"tool-card\">\n    <summary>\n      <span class=\"kind\">工具</span>\n      <span class=\"tool-name\">tickets.aggregate</span>\n      <span class=\"tool-args\">issue_type · 128 rows</span>\n      <span class=\"tool-result\"><check>完成</span>\n      <span class=\"tool-time\">1.4s</span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"tool-body\">\n      <div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"hit-title\">reads: q3-support-tickets.csv</span><span class=\"hit-score\">128 / 128</span></div>\n      <div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"hit-title\">group_by: issue_type</span><span class=\"hit-score\">5 groups</span></div>\n      <div class=\"tool-note\">sandbox · read-only · 1.4s</div>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n</li>\n```\n- The `.hit` styles still exist (v3 kept).\n- kind-tool amber.\n- Restores \"工具调用\".\n\n### MCP card\n**Important**: In the user's requirement, \"我明确提到过的内功能元素不能移除\". MCP is explicitly mentioned. Restore. The card can include Slack MCP.\n- Use v2 MCP card with category etc.\n- `kind-mcp` purple.\n- Maybe mark \"MCP\" kind.\n- The approval uses MCP tool.\n- This is a future backend capability; reply notes.\n\n### Right trace 7 steps\n- 1 加载技能 0.1s\n- 2 search_knowledge 0.8s\n- 3 tickets.aggregate 1.4s\n- 4 data-analyst 1.2s\n- 5 editorial-reviewer 1.8s\n- 6 slack-mcp 0.4s\n- 7 发送审批 — (is-wait) sub `HITL · mcp_slack__post_message`\n- count 7.\n- Header sub maybe `main-agent / 待审批 / run_9a8b7c` (already).\n- citations 3.\n- agents 3: main, data, editorial.\n- trace foot.\n\n### JS track outcome last step\n- On approve: last step done, sub `MCP · Slack 已发送`, time 0.4s.\n- On reject: sub `已取消 · Slack 发送`.\n- Toast messages.\n\n### Account/status updates\n- 3 ONLINE.\n- Account \"3 个智能体在线\".\n- Sessions foot removed; moved to sb-conn.\n\n### Mobile header button\nAdd.\n\n### JS sidebar/account\nAdd.\n\n### CSS sidebar and responsive\nDo.\n\nThis is a lot. Let's proceed step by step, validating.\n\n#### Step 1: token changes + CSS block replacement\nUse Python slicing for the CSS from `/* ---------- app shell ---------- */` to `/* ============================================================\\n   CHAT COLUMN`. Replace.\n\nNeed ensure `.dot` etc. included. We'll include.\n\nAlso remove `--rail*` tokens? We can leave them unused, but new CSS doesn't use them. To reduce risk, leave tokens; no harm. But `.rail` CSS removed, so `--rail` unused. Fine.\n\nReplace `--nav-w`, `--sessions-w` tokens with `--sidebar-w`, `--sidebar-rail` in `:root`.\n\nCurrent root lines 53-55: `--nav-w:68px; --sessions-w:284px; --trace-w:332px;`. Replace.\n\nResponsive block later uses `--sessions-w`; we'll replace whole responsive.\n\n#### Step 2: HTML replace rail+sessions.\n\nNeed exact slice from `  <!-- ================= RAIL ================= -->`? Let's inspect around 1250. There may be comment. Use start at `  <nav class=\"rail\"` and end at `  </aside>` before `<main class=\"chat\">`. The sessions aside ends right before main. Use index of `  <nav class=\"rail\"` and `  <main class=\"chat\">`; replace with sidebar + scrim.\n\n#### Step 3: chat header mobile button.\n\n#### Step 4: thread restore.\n\n#### Step 5: trace.\n\n#### Step 6: CSS restore additions.\n\n#### Step 7: JS.\n\nLet's start with CSS app/sidebar replacement.\n\nI need to ensure the new CSS is inserted exactly and old block removed. Use `start = s.index('/* ---------- app shell ---------- */')`, `end = s.index('/* ============================================================\\n   CHAT COLUMN')`. Replace.\n\nWrite the new CSS string.\n\nOne consideration: `.app.trace-collapsed .trace{opacity:0...}` and in 1180 media `.app.trace-collapsed .trace{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}`. Keep.\n- `.app.sidebar-collapsed.trace-collapsed` rule.\n- At 1180, `.app.trace-collapsed` grid rule. Ensure it doesn't conflict with sidebar collapsed.\n- At 900, all grid one column.\n\nAlso: the chat header min-height 68; sidebar top 44 + padding 6 = 50; not aligned with chat header. DSH sidebar top logo is 52. Chat header 68. Fine.\n- The sidebar footer bottom aligns with chat composer bottom? Sidebar full height. Good.\n\nSidebar width 288 at 1440. Chat column 1440-288-332=820. `stream-inner` max 812, good. At 1280: sidebar 272 + trace 304 -> chat 704. Fine.\n\nWhen sidebar collapsed 56, chat 1052. Good.\n\nAt 1180: sidebar 272 + chat 908; trace drawer. Fine.\nAt 900: sidebar drawer, chat 900. Good.\n\nNow CSS.\n\nAlso `.mobile-sidebar-btn` base style should be defined outside media (display none) so the element doesn't show. We'll define base:\n```css\n.mobile-sidebar-btn{\n  display:none;place-items:center;flex:none;\n  width:30px;height:30px;margin-right:8px;\n  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;\n  background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink-2);\n}\n.mobile-sidebar-btn .ic{width:16px;height:16px}\n```\nThen media `display:grid`.\n\nThe chat-head has `gap:20px`; adding button with margin-right 8. Fine. On desktop hidden.\n\n`.sidebar-scrim` base display none.\n\n`.sidebar` `overflow:hidden` — account menu fixed when collapsed; good.\n\n`.sb-sessions` border-top and margin. Good.\n\n`.session` left border active. Good.\n\n`.sb-sessions-head .mono` count. Good.\n\n`.sb-account` focus visible.\n\n`.account-menu` absolute; when sidebar scroll? Sidebar doesn't scroll; sessions scroll inside. Good.\n\n`.account-menu` in collapsed fixed; z 95; if chat header z? No. Good.\n\n`.account-menu` on mobile fixed? It's absolute within fixed sidebar. Good.\n\nLet's write."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1793893024971,"chunk":{"type":"block-start","index":1,"blockType":"text"}},{"type":"text-chunks","time0":1793893024971,"index":1,"dt":[21,10,0,0,16,15,0,0,17,0,0,0,13,0,16,0,15,1,0,0,15,0,14,1,20,11,15,0,0,0,0,0,14,0],"texts":["继续"," v","4","：","先把","左","栏","替换","成"," D","