{"type":"assistant/message","seq":507,"time":1793893055726,"data":{"turn":4,"step":8,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now HTML rail+sessions replacement and mobile button. First inspect the current rail+sessions HTML to replace. Use slicing from `<nav class=\"rail\"` to `<main class=\"chat\">`.\n\nNeed to write new sidebar HTML with session list. Let's get the existing sessions list content from v4 (current). We can reuse manually. Sessions:\n- 今天: Q3 (active, 待审批, 2分钟前), 退款政策 (14:20, 37), release notes (11:05, 12)\n- 昨天: payment (18:42, 64), 知识库检索 (09:31, 21)\n- 10月: 客服话术 (已归档, 10月29), A2A 接入 (10月26, 18)\nCount 7.\n\nNew sidebar HTML:\n\n```html\n  <aside class=\"sidebar\" id=\"sidebar\" aria-label=\"侧栏\">\n    <div class=\"sb-top\">\n      <a class=\"sb-brand\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Agent Hub 首页\">\n        <svg class=\"sb-brand-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M4.5 6.5h5.2a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 3.8 3.8v3.4a3.8 3.8 0 0 0 3.8 3.8h2.2\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"4.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"1.9\"/>\n          <circle class=\"hot\" cx=\"19.5\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"2\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span>Agent Hub</span>\n      </a>\n      <button class=\"sb-toggle\" id=\"sidebarToggle\" aria-label=\"收起侧栏\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"sidebar\" title=\"收起侧栏\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-panel\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <button class=\"sb-new\" id=\"newSession\">\n      <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-plus\"/></svg>\n      <span>新建会话</span>\n    </button>\n\n    <nav class=\"sb-nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\">\n      <button class=\"sb-nav-item is-active\" aria-current=\"page\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chat\"/></svg><span>对话</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"sb-nav-item\" data-demo=\"智能体页（原型演示）\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-bot\"/></svg><span>智能体</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"sb-nav-item\" data-demo=\"任务页（原型演示）\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-flow\"/></svg><span>任务</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"sb-nav-item\" data-demo=\"知识库页（原型演示）\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-db\"/></svg><span>知识库</span>\n      </button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <div class=\"sb-sessions\">\n      <div class=\"sb-sessions-head\">\n        <h2>会话</h2>\n        <span class=\"mono\">7</span>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"search\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg>\n        <input id=\"sessionSearch\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"搜索会话\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"搜索会话\" />\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"session-scroll\" id=\"sessionScroll\">\n        ... groups ...\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sb-foot\">\n      <div class=\"sb-conn\">\n        <span class=\"dot is-ok\"></span>\n        <span>A2A 已连接</span>\n        <span class=\"spacer\"></span>\n        <span class=\"mono\">3 ONLINE</span>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"sb-account\" id=\"accountBtn\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accountMenu\">\n        <span class=\"avatar\">AH</span>\n        <span class=\"sb-account-text\">\n          <span class=\"sb-account-name\">个人工作区</span>\n          <span class=\"sb-account-sub\">3 个智能体在线</span>\n        </span>\n        <svg class=\"ic sb-account-more\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-more\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"account-menu\" id=\"accountMenu\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"账号菜单\">\n      <div class=\"account-menu-head\">\n        <span class=\"avatar\">AH</span>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"account-menu-name\">个人工作区</div>\n          <div class=\"account-menu-sub\">Agent Hub v0.1.0</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"menu-sep\"></div>\n      <button class=\"menu-item\" role=\"menuitem\" data-demo=\"账号资料（原型演示）\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-user\"/></svg>账号\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"menu-item\" role=\"menuitem\" data-demo=\"设置页（原型演示）\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-sliders\"/></svg>设置\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"menu-item\" role=\"menuitem\" id=\"themeToggle\">\n        <svg class=\"ic ic-moon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-moon\"/></svg>\n        <svg class=\"ic ic-sun\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-sun\"/></svg>\n        切换主题\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"menu-sep\"></div>\n      <button class=\"menu-item is-danger\" role=\"menuitem\" data-demo=\"退出登录（原型演示）\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-logout\"/></svg>退出登录\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"menu-version\">Agent Hub v0.1.0 · M0</div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <div class=\"sidebar-scrim\" id=\"sidebarScrim\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n```\n\n- `.sb-brand` contains a span; collapsed CSS hides the whole brand. Good.\n- `.sb-new` contains span; collapsed hides span.\n- `.sb-nav-item` span hidden collapsed.\n- Account menu theme icons both; CSS shows one.\n- `data-demo` on nav items: clicking triggers toast. On mobile, should close drawer. We'll add JS to close when data-demo clicked? The `[data-demo]` handler can close sidebar if narrow. Could add later.\n- `aria-controls=\"sidebar\"` on toggle. Good.\n- `sb-sessions-head` count 7.\n- The session items. Keep.\n- The connection status 3 ONLINE.\n- Account sub 3 个智能体在线.\n- Account menu \"设置\" is there.\n\nScrim after aside. Good.\n\nNeed to add mobile sidebar button to chat header. Current:\n```html\n    <header class=\"chat-head\">\n      <div class=\"chat-heading\">\n```\nAdd between:\n```html\n      <button class=\"mobile-sidebar-btn\" id=\"mobileSidebarBtn\" aria-label=\"打开侧栏\" aria-controls=\"sidebar\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-menu\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"chat-heading\">\n```\n- The chat-head is flex justify-between. With button + heading + actions, `justify-content:space-between` distributes; heading should flex:1? `.chat-heading{min-width:0}` no flex. Button at left, heading, actions. `space-between` will put gap between button and heading, etc. The heading may not fill. On desktop button hidden. On mobile, three items. Better add `.chat-heading{flex:1}`? It currently has `min-width:0`. Adding flex:1 makes heading take available space; actions stay right. Good. But desktop also fine. Add CSS `.chat-heading{flex:1;min-width:0}`. Currently `.chat-heading{min-width:0}`. We'll patch CSS. The title ellipsis works with flex.\n- The header gap 20; with button margin-right 8, total. Fine.\n\nIcons: need to add `i-menu`, `i-more`, `i-user`, `i-logout` symbols. Find sprite end. Add after i-archive.\n\nNow replace HTML."},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_PcGMDUT4ttyBXMC4VRvz9698","name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/prototypes && python3 - <<'PY'\\npath='ui-v4.html'\\ns=open(path,encoding='utf-8').read()\\n\\nstart=s.index('  <nav class=\\\"rail\\\"')\\nend=s.index('  <main class=\\\"chat\\\">')\\n\\nnew_sidebar = r'''  <aside class=\\\"sidebar\\\" id=\\\"sidebar\\\" aria-label=\\\"侧栏\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"sb-top\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"sb-brand\\\" href=\\\"#\\\" aria-label=\\\"Agent Hub 首页\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"sb-brand-mark\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <path d=\\\"M4.5 6.5h5.2a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 3.8 3.8v3.4a3.8 3.8 0 0 0 3.8 3.8h2.2\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"4.5\\\" cy=\\\"6.5\\\" r=\\\"1.9\\\"/>\\n          <circle class=\\\"hot\\\" cx=\\\"19.5\\\" cy=\\\"17.5\\\" r=\\\"2\\\"/>\\n        </svg>\\n        <span>Agent Hub</span>\\n      </a>\\n      <button class=\\\"sb-toggle\\\" id=\\\"sidebarToggle\\\" aria-label=\\\"收起侧栏\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"true\\\" aria-controls=\\\"sidebar\\\" title=\\\"收起侧栏\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-panel\\\"/></svg>\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <button class=\\\"sb-new\\\" id=\\\"newSession\\\">\\n      <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-plus\\\"/></svg>\\n      <span>新建会话</span>\\n    </button>\\n\\n    <nav class=\\\"sb-nav\\\" aria-label=\\\"主导航\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"sb-nav-item is-active\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-chat\\\"/></svg><span>对话</span>\\n      </button>\\n      <button class=\\\"sb-nav-item\\\" data-demo=\\\"智能体页（原型演示）\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-bot\\\"/></svg><span>智能体</span>\\n      </button>\\n      <button class=\\\"sb-nav-item\\\" data-demo=\\\"任务页（原型演示）\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-flow\\\"/></svg><span>任务</span>\\n      </button>\\n      <button class=\\\"sb-nav-item\\\" data-demo=\\\"知识库页（原型演示）\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-db\\\"/></svg><span>知识库</span>\\n      </button>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"sb-sessions\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"sb-sessions-head\\\">\\n        <h2>会话</h2>\\n        <span class=\\\"mono\\\">7</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <label class=\\\"search\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-search\\\"/></svg>\\n        <input id=\\\"sessionSearch\\\" type=\\\"search\\\" placeholder=\\\"搜索会话\\\" autocomplete=\\\"off\\\" aria-label=\\\"搜索会话\\\" />\\n      </label>\\n      <div class=\\\"session-scroll\\\" id=\\\"sessionScroll\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"session-group\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"group-label\\\">今天</div>\\n          <button class=\\\"session is-active\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"session-title\\\">Q3 客服工单周报</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"session-meta\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"dot is-live\\\"></span>待审批<span class=\\\"sep\\\">·</span>2 分钟前\\n            </span>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"session\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"session-title\\\">退款政策变更的影响面</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"session-meta\\\">14:20<span class=\\\"sep\\\">·</span>37 条消息</span>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"session\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"session-title\\\">把 release notes 翻成英文</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"session-meta\\\">11:05<span class=\\\"sep\\\">·</span>12 条消息</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"session-group\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"group-label\\\">昨天</div>\\n          <button class=\\\"session\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"session-title\\\">审查：payment 模块重试逻辑</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"session-meta\\\">18:42<span class=\\\"sep\\\">·</span>64 条消息</span>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"session\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"session-title\\\">知识库检索质量排查</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"session-meta\\\">09:31<span class=\\\"sep\\\">·</span>21 条消息</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"session-group\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"group-label\\\">10 月</div>\\n          <button class=\\\"session\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"session-title\\\">客服话术改写 · 第二版</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"session-meta\\\"><span class=\\\"dot\\\"></span>已归档<span class=\\\"sep\\\">·</span>10 月 29 日</span>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"session\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"session-title\\\">A2A 智能体接入检查</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"session-meta\\\">10 月 26 日<span class=\\\"sep\\\">·</span>18 条消息</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"sb-foot\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"sb-conn\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"dot is-ok\\\"></span>\\n        <span>A2A 已连接</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"spacer\\\"></span>\\n        <span class=\\\"mono\\\">3 ONLINE</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <button class=\\\"sb-account\\\" id=\\\"accountBtn\\\" aria-haspopup=\\\"menu\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"accountMenu\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"avatar\\\">AH</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"sb-account-text\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"sb-account-name\\\">个人工作区</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"sb-account-sub\\\">3 个智能体在线</span>\\n        </span>\\n        <svg class=\\\"ic sb-account-more\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-more\\\"/></svg>\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"account-menu\\\" id=\\\"accountMenu\\\" role=\\\"menu\\\" aria-label=\\\"账号菜单\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"account-menu-head\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"avatar\\\">AH</span>\\n        <div>\\n          <div class=\\\"account-menu-name\\\">个人工作区</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"account-menu-sub\\\">Agent Hub v0.1.0</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"menu-sep\\\"></div>\\n      <button class=\\\"menu-item\\\" role=\\\"menuitem\\\" data-demo=\\\"账号资料（原型演示）\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-user\\\"/></svg>账号\\n      </button>\\n      <button class=\\\"menu-item\\\" role=\\\"menuitem\\\" data-demo=\\\"设置页（原型演示）\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-sliders\\\"/></svg>设置\\n      </button>\\n      <button class=\\\"menu-item\\\" role=\\\"menuitem\\\" id=\\\"themeToggle\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"ic ic-moon\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-moon\\\"/></svg>\\n        <svg class=\\\"ic ic-sun\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-sun\\\"/></svg>\\n        切换主题\\n      </button>\\n      <div class=\\\"menu-sep\\\"></div>\\n      <button class=\\\"menu-item is-danger\\\" role=\\\"menuitem\\\" data-demo=\\\"退出登录（原型演示）\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"