{"type":"assistant/message","seq":514,"time":1793893063772,"data":{"turn":4,"step":9,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now add icons. Insert before `</defs>` in sprite.\n\n`s i-menu`, `i-more`, `i-user`, `i-logout`.\n\nAlso `.chat-heading{flex:1;min-width:0}` CSS. Current `.chat-heading{min-width:0}`. Patch.\n\nThen restore tokens for MCP and CSS styles (skill, mcp, chips, proc-desc, kv), and maybe `kind` styles. We'll add a v4 block before reduced-motion.\n\nBut first icons.\n\nAlso check `i-stack` no longer used; fine.\n\nInsert:\n```html\n<symbol id=\"i-menu\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"/></symbol>\n<symbol id=\"i-more\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/></symbol>\n<symbol id=\"i-user\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.5\"/><path d=\"M5 20c0-3.6 3.1-5.5 7-5.5s7 1.9 7 5.5\"/></symbol>\n<symbol id=\"i-logout\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 4H5a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v14a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4M16 8l4 4-4 4M20 12H9\"/></symbol>\n```\n- `.ic` sets fill none; the `fill=\"currentColor\"` inline on circles overrides. Good.\n\nPatch `.chat-heading` flex. Current:\n```css\n.chat-heading{min-width:0}\n```\nChange to `.chat-heading{flex:1;min-width:0}`.\n\nNow restore MCP tokens:\n- `:root` after green-soft add `--mcp:#5A4E72; --mcp-soft:#ECE8F1;`.\n- dark after green-soft add.\nPatch.\n\nRestore CSS:\n```css\n/* v4 restored capabilities */\n.kind-skill .node{border-color:var(--green);background:var(--green-soft)}\n.kind-mcp .node{border-color:var(--mcp);background:var(--mcp-soft)}\n.kind-skill .tool-card{border-left:2px solid var(--green)}\n.kind-mcp .tool-card{border-left:2px solid var(--mcp)}\n.proc-desc{...}\n.chips{...}\n.chip{...}\n.mcp-line{...}\n.mcp-server{...}\n.mcp-ok{...}\n.mcp-ok .dot{...}\n.kv{...}\n.kv dt{...}\n.kv dd{...}\n```\n- `.kind-tool` exists.\n- `.kind-vector` exists.\n- Need `.kind-skill .tool-card`, `.kind-mcp`.\n- `.proc-desc` etc.\n\nAlso `.hit` styles exist. Good.\n\nAdd before reduced-motion. Tokens patch.\n\nDo it."},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_94vDPuRXFLm1u7C2K4VF5151","name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/prototypes && python3 - <<'PY'\\npath='ui-v4.html'\\ns=open(path,encoding='utf-8').read()\\n\\ndef rep(old,new,count=1):\\n    global s\\n    assert old in s, 'MISSING: '+old[:100]\\n    s=s.replace(old,new,count)\\n\\n# icons\\nrep('''    <symbol id=\\\"i-archive\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M4 8h16v11a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V8Z\\\"/><path d=\\\"M3 4h18v4H3zM10 12h4\\\"/></symbol>''',\\n'''    <symbol id=\\\"i-archive\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M4 8h16v11a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V8Z\\\"/><path d=\\\"M3 4h18v4H3zM10 12h4\\\"/></symbol>\\n    <symbol id=\\\"i-menu\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\\\"/></symbol>\\n    <symbol id=\\\"i-more\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"1.3\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke=\\\"none\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"1.3\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke=\\\"none\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"1.3\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke=\\\"none\\\"/></symbol>\\n    <symbol id=\\\"i-user\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"8\\\" r=\\\"3.5\\\"/><path d=\\\"M5 20c0-3.6 3.1-5.5 7-5.5s7 1.9 7 5.5\\\"/></symbol>\\n    <symbol id=\\\"i-logout\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M9 4H5a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v14a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4M16 8l4 4-4 4M20 12H9\\\"/></symbol>''')\\n\\n# header heading fills space on mobile\\nrep('.chat-heading{min-width:0}', '.chat-heading{flex:1;min-width:0}')\\n\\n# MCP token restored\\nrep('''  --green:#3D6A4E;\\n  --green-soft:#E4EDE6;\\n''','''  --green:#3D6A4E;\\n  --green-soft:#E4EDE6;\\n  --mcp:#5A4E72;\\n  --mcp-soft:#ECE8F1;\\n''')\\nrep('''  --green:#8DBBA0;\\n  --green-soft:rgba(141,187,160,.12);\\n''','''  --green:#8DBBA0;\\n  --green-soft:rgba(141,187,160,.12);\\n  --mcp:#B3A4C9;\\n  --mcp-soft:rgba(179,164,201,.12);\\n''')\\n\\n# restore styles for skill / MCP cards\\nanchor='@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){'\\nrestored = r'''/* ============================================================\\n   v4: restored capability cards (skill / tool / MCP)\\n   ============================================================ */\\n.kind-skill .node{border-color:var(--green);background:var(--green-soft)}\\n.kind-mcp .node{border-color:var(--mcp);background:var(--mcp-soft)}\\n.kind-skill .tool-card{border-left:2px solid var(--green)}\\n.kind-mcp .tool-card{border-left:2px solid var(--mcp)}\\n.proc-desc{\\n  font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink-2);\\n  margin:0 0 9px;max-width:64ch;\\n}\\n.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}\\n.chip{\\n  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;\\n  height:20px;padding:0 6px;\\n  border:1px solid var(--line-2);\\n  border-radius:3px;\\n  background:var(--surface);\\n  font-family:var(--font-mono);\\n  font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ink-3);\\n}\\n.mcp-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-2)}\\n.mcp-server{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink)}\\n.mcp-ok{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;margin-left:auto;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--green)}\\n.mcp-ok .dot{width:4px;height:4px}\\n.kv{\\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:4px 14px;\\n  margin-top:9px;\\n  font-size:11.5px;\\n}\\n.kv dt{color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.kv dd{color:var(--ink-2)}\\n\\n'''\\ns=s.replace(anchor, restored+anchor, 1)\\nopen(path,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\\nprint('icons/css restored')\\nPY\", \"description\": \"Add icons and restore skill/MCP card styles\"}"}],"source":