{"type":"assistant/message","seq":521,"time":1793893077692,"data":{"turn":4,"step":10,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now restore thread cards. Need to inspect current v4 thread around intro/search/report/A2A/MCP/approval. We'll patch:\n\n1. User message: add attachment.\n2. Intro text.\n3. Insert skill card before search card.\n4. Insert tickets.aggregate after search card.\n5. Insert MCP card after A2A.\n6. Replace approval card.\n7. Composer attachment button.\n\nLet's do incremental patches with exact anchors.\n\nCurrent user bubble:\n```html\n              <div class=\"prompt-bubble\">\n                <p>根据知识库里的 Q3 客服复盘，整理一份团队周报。数字让 data-analyst 核对，措辞让 editorial-reviewer 过一遍；发布到 #support-weekly 之前先问我。</p>\n              </div>\n```\nReplace with attachment:\n```html\n              <div class=\"prompt-bubble\">\n                <p>根据知识库里的 Q3 客服复盘和这份工单表，整理一份团队周报。数字让 data-analyst 核对，措辞让 editorial-reviewer 过一遍；发布到 #support-weekly 之前先问我。</p>\n                <div class=\"attachments\">\n                  <span class=\"attach\">\n                    <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-clip\"/></svg>\n                    q3-support-tickets.csv\n                    <span class=\"mono\">128 行 · 24 KB</span>\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n```\n\nIntro:\nCurrent:\n```html\n<button class=\"copy-btn\" data-copy=\"我先用 search_knowledge 检索 Q3 复盘与分类口径，再让 data-analyst 核对数字、editorial-reviewer 审措辞；发布这一步会暂停，等你确认。\">\n...\n<p>我先用 search_knowledge 检索 Q3 复盘与分类口径，再让 data-analyst 核对数字、editorial-reviewer 审措辞；发布这一步会暂停，等你确认。</p>\n```\nReplace with:\n\"我先加载周报技能，检索分类口径并聚合工单；草稿完成后让 data-analyst 核对数字、editorial-reviewer 审措辞，最后用 Slack MCP 校验发布频道，发送前暂停等你确认。\"\n- data-copy same.\n- Maybe long. Fine.\n\nSkill card insertion after intro li, before `<!-- real tool: search_knowledge`.\nAnchor: `              <!-- real tool: search_knowledge (RAG over pgvector) -->`\nInsert skill card before it.\n\nSkill card HTML as designed.\n\nTool card insertion after search card `</details>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n\\n              <!-- assistant report -->`. Need a unique anchor. The search card ends before `<!-- assistant report -->`. Insert tool card between.\n\nMCP card insertion after A2A `</li>` before `<!-- HITL approval`. Anchor `              <!-- HITL approval before the remote write skill -->`. Replace comment with MCP card + new comment.\n\nApproval card: replace the whole approval li? Easier: from `              <!-- HITL approval before the remote write skill -->` to `              </li>\\n\\n            </ol>` with new MCP + approval. Since we already will use that anchor for MCP insertion, do one patch replacing the comment + approval li.\n\nLet's construct.\n\n**Approval card new**:\n```html\n              <!-- HITL approval before the Slack MCP write -->\n              <li class=\"entry entry-approval\" id=\"approvalEntry\">\n                <span class=\"node\"></span>\n                <div class=\"entry-head\">\n                  <span class=\"who\">审批</span>\n                  <span class=\"who-sub\">外部写操作 · HITL</span>\n                  <span class=\"spacer\"></span>\n                  <time>22:43</time>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"entry-body\">\n                  <div class=\"approval-card\" id=\"approvalCard\">\n                    <div class=\"approval-head\">\n                      <shield>\n                      <span class=\"approval-title\">需要你的决定</span>\n                      <span class=\"status-chip is-warn\" id=\"approvalStatus\">待审批</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"approval-body\">\n                      <p class=\"approval-action\">批准后，主智能体将恢复运行，通过 Slack MCP 把周报发布到 <b>#support-weekly</b>。</p>\n                      <dl class=\"risk-list\">\n                        <dt>执行工具</dt><dd><span class=\"mono\">mcp_slack__post_message</span></dd>\n                        <dt>执行方</dt><dd>slack-mcp · streamable-http</dd>\n                        <dt>目标</dt><dd>#support-weekly · 12 名成员</dd>\n                        <dt>副作用</dt><dd>外部写操作；发布后 24 小时内可撤回</dd>\n                        <dt>超时</dt><dd>审批过期后本轮自动取消</dd>\n                      </dl>\n                    </div>\n                    ...\n                    <button ... approve>批准并执行</button>\n                    resolved \"已批准，正在恢复运行。\"\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n```\n- 5 risk rows. Good.\n- The MCP card provides channel info.\n- The HITL flow remains.\n\n**MCP card**:\n```html\n              <!-- MCP: Slack channel check -->\n              <li class=\"entry entry-proc kind-mcp\">\n                <span class=\"node\"></span>\n                <div class=\"entry-body\">\n                  <details class=\"tool-card\" open>\n                    <summary>\n                      <span class=\"kind\">MCP</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-name\">slack</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-args\">conversations.info</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-result\"><check>完成</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-time\">0.4s</span>\n                      <chev>\n                    </summary>\n                    <div class=\"tool-body\">\n                      <div class=\"mcp-line\">\n                        <span class=\"mcp-server\">slack-mcp</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">v0.9.3</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">streamable-http</span>\n                        <span class=\"mcp-ok\"><span class=\"dot is-ok\"></span>已连接</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <dl class=\"kv\">\n                        <dt>频道</dt><dd><span class=\"mono\">#support-weekly</span> · <span class=\"mono\">C08F3K2</span></dd>\n                        <dt>成员</dt><dd>12 人</dd>\n                        <dt>权限</dt><dd><span class=\"mono\">chat:write</span> · 已授权</dd>\n                      </dl>\n                      <div class=\"tool-note\">tool: conversations.info · 0.4s</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </details>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n```\n- Restored.\n\n**skill card**:\nAs above.\n\n**tool card**:\nAs above.\n\nLet's apply patches."},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_nxDuFdoWtavPFMNrefRG6199","name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/prototypes && python3 - <<'PY'\\npath='ui-v4.html'\\ns=open(path,encoding='utf-8').read()\\n\\ndef rep(old,new,count=1):\\n    global s\\n    assert old in s, 'MISSING: '+old[:120]\\n    s=s.replace(old,new,count)\\n\\n# user message: restore the attachment that feeds tickets.aggregate\\nrep('''              <div class=\\\"prompt-bubble\\\">\\n                <p>根据知识库里的 Q3 客服复盘，整理一份团队周报。数字让 data-analyst 核对，措辞让 editorial-reviewer 过一遍；发布到 #support-weekly 之前先问我。</p>\\n              </div>''',\\n'''              <div class=\\\"prompt-bubble\\\">\\n                <p>根据知识库里的 Q3 客服复盘和这份工单表，整理一份团队周报。数字让 data-analyst 核对，措辞让 editorial-reviewer 过一遍；发布到 #support-weekly 之前先问我。</p>\\n                <div class=\\\"attachments\\\">\\n                  <span class=\\\"attach\\\">\\n                    <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-clip\\\"/></svg>\\n                    q3-support-tickets.csv\\n                    <span class=\\\"mono\\\">128 行 · 24 KB</span>\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>''')\\n\\n# intro mentions all restored capabilities\\nrep('<button class=\\\"copy-btn\\\" data-copy=\\\"我先把「周报生成」技能挂上，检索分类口径，聚合工单；草稿完成后并行交给 editorial-reviewer 和 fact-checker，发布前用 Slack MCP 校验频道。\\\">',\\n    '<button class=\\\"copy-btn\\\" data-copy=\\\"我先加载周报技能，检索分类口径并聚合工单；草稿完成后让 data-analyst 核对数字、editorial-reviewer 审措辞，最后用 Slack MCP 校验发布频道，发送前暂停等你确认。\\\">')\\nrep('<p>我先把「周报生成」技能挂上，检索分类口径，聚合工单；草稿完成后并行交给 editorial-reviewer 和 fact-checker，发布前用 Slack MCP 校验频道。</p>',\\n    '<p>我先加载周报技能，检索分类口径并聚合工单；草稿完成后让 data-analyst 核对数字、editorial-reviewer 审措辞，最后用 Slack MCP 校验发布频道，发送前暂停等你确认。</p>')\\n\\n# insert skill card before search\\nskill = r'''              <!-- skill -->\\n              <li class=\\\"entry entry-proc kind-skill\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"node\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-body\\\">\\n                  <details class=\\\"tool-card\\\" open>\\n                    <summary>\\n                      <span class=\\\"kind\\\">技能</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-name\\\">weekly-report</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-args\\\">v1.2 · 周报生成</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-result\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg>已加载</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-time\\\">0.1s</span>\\n                      <svg class=\\\"ic chev\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-chevron\\\"/></svg>\\n                    </summary>\\n                    <div class=\\\"tool-body\\\">\\n                      <p class=\\\"proc-desc\\\">技能提供固定章节、口径引用规则与团队语气，模板来自知识库 templates 目录。</p>\\n                      <div class=\\\"chips\\\">\\n                        <span class=\\\"chip\\\">templates/weekly-report.md</span>\\n                        <span class=\\\"chip\\\">cite-required</span>\\n                        <span class=\\\"chip\\\">zh-CN</span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div class=\\\"tool-note\\\">trigger: 周报 · scope: run_9a8b7c · source: builtin</div>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </details>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n\\n'''\\nrep('              <!-- real tool: search_knowledge (RAG over pgvector) -->', skill+'              <!-- real tool: search_knowledge (RAG over pgvector) -->')\\n\\n# insert aggregate tool after search card, before report\\ntool = r'''              <!-- tool: aggregate the uploaded ticket table -->\\n              <li class=\\\"entry entry-proc kind-tool\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"node\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-body\\\">\\n                  <details class=\\\"tool-card\\\">\\n                    <summary>\\n                      <span class=\\\"kind\\\">工具</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-name\\\">tickets.aggregate</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-args\\\">issue_type · 128 rows</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-result\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg>完成</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-time\\\">1.4s</span>\\n                      <svg class=\\\"ic chev\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-chevron\\\"/></svg>\\n                    </summary>\\n                    <div class=\\\"tool-body\\\">\\n                      <div class=\\\"hit\\\"><span class=\\\"hit-title\\\">reads: q3-support-tickets.csv</span><span class=\\\"hit-score\\\">128 / 128</span></div>\\n                      <div class=\\\"hit\\\"><span class=\\\"hit-title\\\">group_by: issue_type</span><span class=\\\"hit-score\\\">5 groups</span></div>\\n                      <div class=\\\"tool-note\\\">sandbox · read-only · 1.4s</div>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </details>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n\\n'''\\nrep('              <!-- assistant report -->', tool+'              <!-- assistant report -->')\\n\\n# replace approval block with MCP + Slack HITL approval\\nstart=s.index('              <!-- HITL approval before the remote write skill -->')\\nend=s.index('            </ol>', start)\\n\\nnew_tail = r'''              <!-- MCP: check the Slack channel before publishing -->\\n              <li class=\\\"entry entry-proc kind-mcp\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"node\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-body\\\">\\n                  <details class=\\\"tool-card\\\" open>\\n                    <summary>\\n                      <span class=\\\"kind\\\">MCP</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-name\\\">slack</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-args\\\">conversations.info</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-result\\\"><svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg>完成</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"tool-time\\\">0.4s</span>\\n                      <svg class=\\\"ic chev\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-chevron\\\"/></svg>\\n                    </summary>\\n                    <div class=\\\"tool-body\\\">\\n                      <div class=\\\"mcp-line\\\">\\n                        <span class=\\\"mcp-server\\\">slack-mcp</span>\\n                        <span class=\\\"tag\\\">v0.9.3</span>\\n                        <span class=\\\"tag\\\">streamable-http</span>\\n                        <span class=\\\"mcp-ok\\\"><span class=\\\"dot is-ok\\\"></span>已连接</span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <dl class=\\\"kv\\\">\\n                        <dt>频道</dt><dd><span class=\\\"mono\\\">#support-weekly</span> · <span class=\\\"mono\\\">C08F3K2</span></dd>\\n                        <dt>成员</dt><dd>12 人</dd>\\n                        <dt>权限</dt><dd><span class=\\\"mono\\\">chat:write</span> · 已授权</dd>\\n                      </dl>\\n                      <div class=\\\"tool-note\\\">tool: conversations.info · 0.4s</div>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </details>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n\\n              <!-- HITL approval before the Slack MCP write -->\\n              <li class=\\\"entry entry-approval\\\" id=\\\"approvalEntry\\\">\\n                <span class=\\\"node\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-head\\\">\\n                  <span class=\\\"who\\\">审批</span>\\n                  <span class=\\\"who-sub\\\">外部写操作 · HITL</span>\\n                  <span class=\\\"spacer\\\"></span>\\n                  <time>22:43</time>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\\"entry-body\\\">\\n                  <div class=\\\"approval-card\\\" id=\\\"approvalCard\\\">\\n                    <div class=\\\"approval-head\\\">\\n                      <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-shield\\\"/></svg>\\n                      <span class=\\\"approval-title\\\">需要你的决定</span>\\n                      <span class=\\\"status-chip is-warn\\\" id=\\\"approvalStatus\\\">待审批</span>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div class=\\\"approval-body\\\">\\n                      <p class=\\\"approval-action\\\">批准后，主智能体将恢复运行，通过 Slack MCP 把周报发布到 <b>#support-weekly</b>。</p>\\n                      <dl class=\\\"risk-list\\\">\\n                        <dt>执行工具</dt><dd><span class=\\\"mono\\\">mcp_slack__post_message</span></dd>\\n                        <dt>执行方</dt><dd>slack-mcp · streamable-http</dd>\\n                        <dt>目标</dt><dd>#support-weekly · 12 名成员</dd>\\n                        <dt>副作用</dt><dd>外部写操作；发布后 24 小时内可撤回</dd>\\n                        <dt>超时</dt><dd>审批过期后本轮自动取消</dd>\\n                      </dl>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div class=\\\"approval-actions\\\">\\n                      <span class=\\\"spacer\\\"></span>\\n                      <button class=\\\"btn btn-outline\\\" data-decision=\\\"reject\\\">拒绝</button>\\n                      <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" data-decision=\\\"approve\\\">批准并执行</button>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div class=\\\"resolved-note\\\">\\n                      <svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-check\\\"/></svg>\\n                      <span id=\\\"resolvedText\\\">已批准，正在恢复运行。</span>\\n                    </div>\\n            