{"type":"assistant/message","seq":577,"time":1793893130628,"data":{"turn":4,"step":18,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"The approval approve message still \"publisher-agent\". Need update to Slack MCP.\n\nImplement JS:\n- Add vars: sidebarToggle, mobileSidebarBtn, sidebarScrim, accountBtn, accountMenu, narrowSidebar.\n- Theme listener: add menu close? We'll add generic.\n- Insert sidebar/account code after `setTraceExpanded(wide.matches);`.\n- Update session click to close mobile drawer.\n- Update data-demo handler to close mobile drawer.\n- Update approval messages/track.\n- `updateTrackOutcome` time 0.4s.\n\nLet's write the patch.\n\nVariables:\n```js\n  var sidebarToggle = document.getElementById('sidebarToggle');\n  var mobileSidebarBtn = document.getElementById('mobileSidebarBtn');\n  var sidebarScrim = document.getElementById('sidebarScrim');\n  var accountBtn = document.getElementById('accountBtn');\n  var accountMenu = document.getElementById('accountMenu');\n  var narrowSidebar = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 900px)');\n```\n\nFunctions:\n```js\n  function setAccountMenu(open) {\n    accountMenu.classList.toggle('is-open', open);\n    accountBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));\n  }\n\n  function setMobileSidebar(open) {\n    app.classList.toggle('sidebar-open', open);\n    mobileSidebarBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));\n    sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));\n    if (!open) setAccountMenu(false);\n  }\n\n  function setSidebarCollapsed(collapsed) {\n    app.classList.toggle('sidebar-collapsed', collapsed);\n    sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!collapsed));\n    sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-label', collapsed ? '展开侧栏' : '收起侧栏');\n    sidebarToggle.setAttribute('title', collapsed ? '展开侧栏' : '收起侧栏');\n    setAccountMenu(false);\n  }\n\n  sidebarToggle.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    if (narrowSidebar.matches) {\n      setMobileSidebar(!app.classList.contains('sidebar-open'));\n    } else {\n      setSidebarCollapsed(!app.classList.contains('sidebar-collapsed'));\n    }\n  });\n\n  mobileSidebarBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    setMobileSidebar(!app.classList.contains('sidebar-open'));\n  });\n\n  sidebarScrim.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    setMobileSidebar(false);\n  });\n\n  accountBtn.addEventListener('click', function (event) {\n    event.stopPropagation();\n    setAccountMenu(!accountMenu.classList.contains('is-open'));\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener('click', function (event) {\n    if (!accountMenu.contains(event.target) && !accountBtn.contains(event.target)) {\n      setAccountMenu(false);\n    }\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function (event) {\n    if (event.key === 'Escape') {\n      setAccountMenu(false);\n      if (narrowSidebar.matches) setMobileSidebar(false);\n    }\n  });\n\n  accountMenu.querySelectorAll('.menu-item').forEach(function (item) {\n    item.addEventListener('click', function () { setAccountMenu(false); });\n  });\n\n  narrowSidebar.addEventListener('change', function () {\n    setAccountMenu(false);\n    app.classList.remove('sidebar-open');\n    if (narrowSidebar.matches) {\n      app.classList.remove('sidebar-collapsed');\n      sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n      mobileSidebarBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n    } else {\n      sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!app.classList.contains('sidebar-collapsed')));\n      mobileSidebarBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n    }\n  });\n\n  if (narrowSidebar.matches) {\n    app.classList.remove('sidebar-collapsed');\n    sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n  }\n```\n\n- `setMobileSidebar` sets sidebarToggle aria to open. When mobile drawer closed, sidebarToggle is hidden; aria false. Good.\n- `setSidebarCollapsed` aria.\n- `accountMenu.querySelectorAll('.menu-item')` includes themeToggle; closes menu after click.\n- Theme toggle listener runs before/after? It is defined earlier; the close listener later. Both fire. Good.\n- Clicking account menu item with data-demo: toast handler later in code; close listener earlier? The close listener added here, before data-demo handler (which is at the bottom). Both fire. Good.\n- Clicking nav data-demo on mobile: the data-demo handler at bottom can close sidebar. Add there.\n\nSession click:\n```js\n      item.classList.add('is-active');\n      item.setAttribute('aria-current', 'page');\n      if (narrowSidebar.matches) setMobileSidebar(false);\n```\nBut `setMobileSidebar` function declaration hoisted within IIFE, yes. `narrowSidebar` var initialized before sessions block? We insert sidebar code right after trace (before session block), so yes.\n\nData-demo handler:\n```js\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-demo]').forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      showToast(btn.getAttribute('data-demo'));\n      if (narrowSidebar.matches && btn.closest('.sidebar')) setMobileSidebar(false);\n    });\n  });\n```\n- For \"附件\" in composer (not in sidebar), no close.\n- For nav items in sidebar, close.\n- For account menu items, close drawer on mobile (fine).\n- For \"运行事件\" in trace, not sidebar.\n\nTheme toggle in account menu: clicking closes menu via menu item listener; on mobile, does it close sidebar? The menu item is in sidebar, but the data-demo handler doesn't apply (themeToggle has no data-demo). The menu item close listener only closes menu. Could also close mobile drawer on theme? Not necessary. Fine.\n\n- When sidebar collapses, account menu close. Good.\n- When account menu is open and sidebar collapses via toggle, setSidebarCollapsed calls setAccountMenu(false). Good.\n- When account menu open and mobile drawer closes via scrim, setMobileSidebar false → setAccountMenu false. Good.\n\n- Initial desktop: sidebar expanded. `sidebarToggle` aria true. Good.\n- Initial mobile: no sidebar-open; `sidebarToggle` aria set false by init. `mobileSidebarBtn` aria false. Good.\n- On mobile, `.app` one column; sidebar fixed hidden. Good.\n\n- The account menu when collapsed is fixed; when the sidebar is collapsed and the user clicks avatar, menu opens. `setAccountMenu` toggles. Document click: accountBtn contains target; no close. Menu item click: closes. Good.\n- On desktop, when sidebar collapsed, account menu fixed left 64; clicking outside closes.\n- On mobile, account menu absolute within sidebar; fine.\n\n**Potential issue**: `.sidebar` has `overflow:hidden`. In collapsed state, account menu fixed. Fixed descendants of an element with `overflow:hidden` but no transform are not clipped. Correct. The sidebar at mobile has `transform: translateX(-100%)` when closed; when open transform none. The account menu is absolute on mobile, not fixed. Fine.\n\n**Potential issue**: `.account-menu` is inside `.sidebar` and `.app.sidebar-collapsed .account-menu` is fixed. The sidebar also has `overflow:hidden` and no transform desktop. Fixed positioning is relative to viewport. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: On desktop when collapsed, sidebar width 56; account menu fixed left 64. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: On desktop when collapsed, `.sb-foot` is flex justify-center; `.sb-account` 36x36; avatar 30. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: `.sb-conn` hidden collapsed. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: `.sb-sessions` hidden collapsed. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: in collapsed rail, `.sb-nav` width 100%, items 36 centered. `.sidebar` align-items center. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: `.sb-top` collapsed width 100%, toggle centered. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: `.sb-new` collapsed text hidden. The icon remains. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: `.sb-brand` collapsed hidden. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: `.sb-toggle` in expanded is at right. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: mobile drawer uses `.sidebar` base padding 6 8 and wide layout; JS removes `sidebar-collapsed`. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: On mobile, if the app loads with `sidebar-collapsed` class? It's static HTML without class; JS init removes if narrow. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: On mobile, sidebar toggle is inside drawer; clicking closes. Good. But the `sidebar-toggle` aria says false on close; good.\n\n**Potential issue**: mobile sidebar has no close X, but toggle at top works. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: mobile scrim z 75, sidebar z 80. Good. Chat header mobile button z? It's inside chat, below scrim, so when drawer open it's covered; clicking scrim closes. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: trace drawer z 60 below scrim 75/sidebar 80. If trace is open and sidebar opens, sidebar over. Good.\n\nNow update approval messages and track time.\n\n`updateTrackOutcome` time `'1.4s'` → `'0.4s'`.\nApprove:\n- `resolvedText.textContent = '已批准，主智能体已恢复运行，正在调用 Slack MCP。';`\n- toast '已批准，主智能体继续执行'\n- completion `resolvedText = '已批准，Slack 消息已发布。'`\n- `updateTrackOutcome('MCP · Slack 已发送', true)`\n- toast '本轮运行已完成，可以继续对话'\nReject:\n- `updateTrackOutcome('已取消 · Slack 发送', false)`\n- messages okay.\n\nAlso top status after completion. Good.\n\nNow patch JS."},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_b1NBYiUbztqY33APUkjp6013","name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/prototypes && python3 - <<'PY'\\npath='ui-v4.html'\\ns=open(path,encoding='utf-8').read()\\n\\ndef rep(old,new,count=1):\\n    global s\\n    assert old in s, 'MISSING: '+old[:120]\\n    s=s.replace(old,new,count)\\n\\n# new element refs\\nrep('''  var usageLabel = document.getElementById('usageLabel');\\n  var approvalPending = true;''',\\n'''  var usageLabel = document.getElementById('usageLabel');\\n  var sidebarToggle = document.getElementById('sidebarToggle');\\n  var mobileSidebarBtn = document.getElementById('mobileSidebarBtn');\\n  var sidebarScrim = document.getElementById('sidebarScrim');\\n  var accountBtn = document.getElementById('accountBtn');\\n  var accountMenu = document.getElementById('accountMenu');\\n  var narrowSidebar = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 900px)');\\n  var approvalPending = true;''')\\n\\n# sidebar + account menu behaviour after trace init\\nrep('''  setTraceExpanded(wide.matches);\\n\\n  /* ---------- session list ---------- */''',\\n'''  setTraceExpanded(wide.matches);\\n\\n  /* ---------- sidebar + account menu ---------- */\\n  function setAccountMenu(open) {\\n    accountMenu.classList.toggle('is-open', open);\\n    accountBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));\\n  }\\n\\n  function setMobileSidebar(open) {\\n    app.classList.toggle('sidebar-open', open);\\n    mobileSidebarBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));\\n    sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));\\n    if (!open) setAccountMenu(false);\\n  }\\n\\n  function setSidebarCollapsed(collapsed) {\\n    app.classList.toggle('sidebar-collapsed', collapsed);\\n    sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!collapsed));\\n    sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-label', collapsed ? '展开侧栏' : '收起侧栏');\\n    sidebarToggle.setAttribute('title', collapsed ? '展开侧栏' : '收起侧栏');\\n    setAccountMenu(false);\\n  }\\n\\n  sidebarToggle.addEventListener('click', function () {\\n    if (narrowSidebar.matches) {\\n      setMobileSidebar(!app.classList.contains('sidebar-open'));\\n    } else {\\n      setSidebarCollapsed(!app.classList.contains('sidebar-collapsed'));\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  mobileSidebarBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\\n    setMobileSidebar(!app.classList.contains('sidebar-open'));\\n  });\\n\\n  sidebarScrim.addEventListener('click', function () {\\n    setMobileSidebar(false);\\n  });\\n\\n  accountBtn.addEventListener('click', function (event) {\\n    event.stopPropagation();\\n    setAccountMenu(!accountMenu.classList.contains('is-open'));\\n  });\\n\\n  document.addEventListener('click', function (event) {\\n    if (!accountMenu.contains(event.target) && !accountBtn.contains(event.target)) {\\n      setAccountMenu(false);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function (event) {\\n    if (event.key === 'Escape') {\\n      setAccountMenu(false);\\n      if (narrowSidebar.matches) setMobileSidebar(false);\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  accountMenu.querySelectorAll('.menu-item').forEach(function (item) {\\n    item.addEventListener('click', function () { setAccountMenu(false); });\\n  });\\n\\n  narrowSidebar.addEventListener('change', function () {\\n    setAccountMenu(false);\\n    app.classList.remove('sidebar-open');\\n    mobileSidebarBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\\n    if (narrowSidebar.matches) {\\n      app.classList.remove('sidebar-collapsed');\\n      sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\\n    } else {\\n      sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!app.classList.contains('sidebar-collapsed')));\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  if (narrowSidebar.matches) {\\n    app.classList.remove('sidebar-collapsed');\\n    sidebarToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\\n  }\\n\\n  /* ---------- session list ---------- */''')\\n\\n# close mobile drawer when selecting a session\\nrep('''      item.classList.add('is-active');\\n      item.setAttribute('aria-current', 'page');\\n    });''',\\n'''      item.classList.add('is-active');\\n      item.setAttribute('aria-current', 'page');\\n      if (narrowSidebar.matches) setMobileSidebar(false);\\n    });''')\\n\\n# track timing for the Slack publish step\\nrep(\\\"if (time) time.textContent = '1.4s';\\\", \\\"if (time) time.textContent = '0.4s';\\\")\\n\\n# approval copy\\nrep(\\\"resolvedText.textContent = '已批准，主智能体已恢复运行并调用 publisher-agent。';\\\",\\n    \\\"resolvedText.textContent = '已批准，主智能体已恢复运行，正在调用 Slack MCP。';\\\")\\nrep(\\\"resolvedText.textContent = '已批准，publisher-agent 已发布周报。';\\\",\\n    \\\"resolvedText.textContent = '已批准，Slack 消息已发布。';\\\")\\nrep(\\\"updateTrackOutcome('A2A · publish_report · 已完成', true);\\\",\\n    \\\"updateTrackOutcome('MCP · Slack 已发送',