{"type":"assistant/message","seq":584,"time":1793893136836,"data":{"turn":4,"step":19,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now validate HTML/CSS/JS. Also check for stale \"publisher\", \"publish_report\", \"fact-checker\", \"2 done / 1 awaiting\" footer, session count, etc.\n\nThe thread footer still says `2 done / 1 awaiting approval` (from v3), which is still accurate (2 A2A done, 1 approval). Fine.\n\n`run_9a8b7c` in skill card. Good.\n\nCheck A2A group tags (skill). Good.\n\nNeed to ensure `themeToggle` exists in account menu and only once. The old rail theme toggle was removed with rail. Good.\n\nCheck `.ic-sun/.ic-moon` CSS still exists in new block. Yes.\n\nCheck icons `i-menu`, `i-more`, `i-user`, `i-logout` added.\n\nCheck approval `mcp_slack__post_message`.\n\nCheck no old `.rail` CSS remains (we replaced block). But responsive block old removed. Search for `.rail`, `.sessions`, `--nav-w`, `--sessions-w`. Should be zero (except maybe docs). Let's validate.\n\nAlso check `.sessions` CSS not referenced by JS. JS uses `.session`. Fine.\n\nCheck `.app` grid, no `.rail`.\n\nCheck HTML structure.\n\nLet's run the validator."},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_n6sWljGS7q4N2AgqWFrq6776","name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/prototypes && echo \\\"=== stale selectors ===\\\" && grep -nE \\\"\\\\.rail|\\\\.sessions\\\\b|--nav-w|--sessions-w|<nav class=\\\\\\\"rail\\\\\\\"|traceClose|publisher-agent|publish_report\\\" ui-v4.html | head -20; echo \\\"=== required bits ===\\\" && grep -c \\\"kind-skill\\\\|kind-mcp\\\\|mcp_slack__post_message\\\\|sidebarToggle\\\\|accountMenu\\\\|i-menu\\\\|i-logout\\\" ui-v4.html\\npython3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom html.parser import HTMLParser\\nimport re, collections\\nsrc=open('ui-v4.html',encoding='utf-8').read()\\nVOID={'area','base','br','col','embed','hr','img','input','link','meta','param','source','track','wbr','path','circle','rect','line','polyline','polygon','ellipse','use','stop'}\\nclass P(HTMLParser):\\n    def __init__(self):\\n        super().__init__(convert_charrefs=True); self.stack=[]; self.err=[]; self.ids=[]\\n    def handle_starttag(self,t,a):\\n        d=dict(a)\\n        if 'id' in d:self.ids.append(d['id'])\\n        if t not in VOID:self.stack.append((t,self.getpos()))\\n    def handle_startendtag(self,t,a):\\n        d=dict(a)\\n        if 'id' in d:self.ids.append(d['id'])\\n    def handle_endtag(self,t):\\n        if t in VOID:return\\n        if not self.stack:self.err.append(('extra',t,self.getpos()));return\\n        if self.stack[-1][0]==t:self.stack.pop()\\n        else:self.err.append(('mismatch',t,self.getpos(),self.stack[-3:]))\\np=P();p.feed(src)\\nprint('tag errors:',p.err or 'none')\\nprint('unclosed:',p.stack or 'none')\\nprint('dup ids:',[k for k,v in collections.Counter(p.ids).items() if v>1] or 'none')\\ncss=re.search(r'<style>(.*?)</style>',src,re.S).group(1)\\nprint('css braces:',css.count('{'),css.count('}'))\\nopen('/tmp/proto4.js','w',encoding='utf-8').write(re.search(r'<script>(.*?)</script>',src,re.S).group(1))\\nprint('id list:', sorted(collections.Counter(p.ids)))\\nPY\\nnode --check /tmp/proto4.js && echo \\\"JS syntax OK\\\"\", \"description\": \"Validate v4 structure and check stale references\"}"}],"source":{"kind":"model","provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-flash","replayState":{"response":{"kind":"deepseek-messages","version":1,"model":"deepseek-flash"},"blocks":[{"type":"reasoning","signature":"23cb0cd4-0f37-4b8c-8782-451690f065be"},{"type":"tool-call"}]}},"id":"26d9bfe2-8f0c-4d2b-ae36-78678b3b50ad"},"usage":{"inputTokens":159,"outputTokens":908,"cacheReadTokens":350848,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":351915},"stream":[{"type":"chunk","time":1793893131165,"chunk":{"type":"block-start","index":0,"blockType":"reasoning"}},{"type":"reasoning-chunks","time0":1793893131692,"index":0,"dt":[100,18,0,0,25,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,15,0,0,15,0,22,0,9,1,0,0,1