{"type":"assistant/message","seq":612,"time":1793893229230,"data":{"turn":4,"step":23,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now we should inspect the final sidebar and thread to ensure no structural mistakes. Also verify CSS `.app` grid and media. Read key sections.\n\nAlso, we need to consider whether the sidebar account menu's theme icons conflict with the `.ic-sun`/`.ic-moon` rules: they are inside the new CSS. Good.\n\nPotential issue: `.sb-top` expanded has `justify-content:space-between`; brand and toggle. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The account menu is inside `.sidebar`; `.sidebar` has `overflow:hidden`. When expanded, menu absolute within; when collapsed, fixed. On mobile, sidebar fixed with transform; `.app.sidebar-collapsed` removed, so menu absolute. Good.\n\nPotential issue: When the sidebar is collapsed and the account menu is open, clicking the account avatar again toggles menu. Good.\n\nPotential issue: `accountBtn` aria-expanded updates; `accountMenu` has `role=menu`. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The account menu in collapsed rail is `position:fixed`, but the sidebar `overflow:hidden` would clip? Fixed is not clipped by overflow unless an ancestor has transform. Desktop sidebar no transform. Good.\n- On mobile, sidebar has transform; but collapsed rule not applied. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The theme menu item's two icons; in HTML both have `class=\"ic ic-moon\"` and `class=\"ic ic-sun\"`. The CSS `.ic-sun{display:none}` and `.ic-moon{display:block}`. In dark, flip. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The theme button includes text \"切换主题\", so accessible name includes icon (aria-hidden) + text. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The account menu item \"设置\" uses `i-sliders`; nav no settings. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The account menu \"账号\" uses `i-user`. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The account menu \"退出登录\" uses `i-logout`. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The sidebar collapsed rail has no tooltips for icons; `title` on nav items? The buttons have no title, only span text which is hidden. For accessibility, the span text is in the accessible name even when display:none? `display:none` content is excluded from accessibility tree. Thus collapsed nav icon buttons would have no accessible name! This is important. Add `aria-label` to each nav item and new button, account button already has. Also `title` attributes for tooltips when collapsed.\n  - Add `aria-label=\"对话\"` (active), `aria-label=\"智能体\"`, `aria-label=\"任务\"`, `aria-label=\"知识库\"`.\n  - Add `title` too.\n  - New session button: `aria-label=\"新建会话\"`, title.\n  - The toggle has aria-label.\n  - Account has aria-label.\n  - The brand has aria-label.\n  - The nav spans hidden; aria-label solves.\n  - Add to HTML.\n- Similarly the `sb-new` span hidden collapsed; aria-label.\n- The nav active has `aria-current=page`.\n- Good.\n\nPotential issue: The collapsed rail's nav items have 36x36; the span hidden. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The collapsed rail's `sb-new` still has text hidden; add aria-label.\n\nPotential issue: The `sb-top` brand hidden collapsed; fine.\n\nPotential issue: The account button collapsed contains only \"AH\" avatar; aria-label \"账号菜单\". Good.\n\nPotential issue: The session items have text; fine.\n\nPotential issue: The mobile menu button has aria-label.\n\nPotential issue: The sidebar toggle in mobile: aria-label \"收起侧栏\" even when drawer closed (hidden). Fine.\n\nPotential issue: The account menu uses `role=menu` but items are buttons with role=menuitem. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The account menu \"切换主题\" has no data-demo, but its click listener closes menu via menu item listener. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The menu item listeners are added before `data-demo` listeners; both fire. Good.\n\nPotential issue: Clicking the theme item toggles theme AND closes menu; the toast appears. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The `showToast` is defined after the theme listener but hoisted. Good.\n\nPotential issue: `setAccountMenu` is defined after theme listener but function declaration hoisted. Not used by theme listener. Fine.\n\nPotential issue: The account menu `z-index:95` inside sidebar z20. On desktop when sidebar collapsed, the menu fixed left 64. If the chat header has a higher stacking context? Chat is a grid item after sidebar; no z-index; sidebar z20 paints above chat. Good. The menu visible above chat. Good.\n- The trace panel in desktop grid after chat; no z-index; sidebar z20 above? Sidebar z20 is a positioned element; it paints above non-positioned trace. The menu only overlaps chat, not trace (left 64, width 240, trace at right). Fine.\n\nPotential issue: The sidebar's account menu when expanded at bottom 62 may overlap the last session; okay.\n\nPotential issue: The `.sidebar` has `overflow:hidden`; the account menu fixed when collapsed escapes. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The mobile drawer's account menu is absolute; the sidebar overflow hidden; menu inside, fits. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The sidebar's scroll region: `.session-scroll` scrolls; the sidebar itself doesn't. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The sidebar's footer and account menu: bottom 62; the account row height ~42 and foot padding; menu bottom 62 sits above. Good.\n\nPotential issue: On short viewport, the menu may exceed height; no scroll. Prototype. Fine.\n\nPotential issue: The mobile sidebar height 100dvh; account menu bottom 62; fits.\n\nPotential issue: At ≤900, the `sidebar` is fixed but the `app` grid one col. The `.sidebar` still has `padding` and `flex`; height 100%. Good.\n\nPotential issue: At ≤900, the `sidebar-scrim` is fixed; the `.app` grid children: sidebar (fixed), chat, trace (fixed), scrim (fixed). Chat is the only in-flow grid child; it occupies the one column. Good.\n\nPotential issue: At ≤1180, trace fixed; `.app` grid has sidebar+chat. The trace is a grid child but fixed; out of flow. Good.\n\nPotential issue: At >1180, trace grid. Good.\n\nPotential issue: `.app.trace-collapsed` at ≤1180 sets grid 2 cols (explicit). The trace is fixed and hidden via opacity 0/pointer none; the `.app.trace-collapsed .trace` opacity 1 override in media (so if collapsed while wide→narrow, it becomes visible? Actually the media override sets opacity 1, pointer auto; but the trace is fixed and transform translateX(101%) unless `.app.trace-open`. So hidden). Good.\n- At ≤1180, if user clicks traceToggle: JS sees `wide.matches` false, toggles `trace-open`. Good. `.trace-collapsed` may not be set. Fine.\n- At >1180, traceToggle toggles `trace-collapsed`. Good.\n- When resizing, `wide` change handler removes `trace-open` and if wide removes collapsed. Good.\n\nPotential issue: The sidebar and trace both can be open on mobile; z-order. Fine.\n\nPotential issue: The mobile sidebar button is in chat header; when the trace drawer is open (z60), the header is not covered by trace (trace top 68). The button at header top remains visible. Clicking it opens sidebar (z80) over trace. Fine.\n\nPotential issue: Scrim z75 covers trace but not sidebar; good.\n\nPotential issue: The sidebar drawer opens over the chat header (top 0). The mobile button is under the scrim; clicking scrim closes. Fine.\n\nNow **the critical requirement: restore elements user explicitly mentioned**. We restored MCP, skill, tool, attachment. Need to ensure the MCP card is visible and not too subtle. It is purple, after A2A. Good.\n- Tool card amber.\n- Skill green.\n- Vector blue.\n- A2A group.\n- MCP purple.\nFive types now visible. Great.\n- The order: skill, search (vector), aggregate (tool), report, A2A, MCP, approval.\n- The user can scroll.\n\n**Potential issue**: The right trace no longer has header/metrics, but now 7 steps. Good.\n- The trace panel top is 22; first section. Good.\n- `trace` no header. Good.\n- The panel icon is the only toggle. Good.\n- No X. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The sidebar `sb-toggle` panel icon in expanded; when collapsed, it might be the only way to expand. Good.\n- User asked \"左侧栏可收起\"; yes.\n- The `panel` icon is also used for right trace toggle. Two panel icons could confuse, but different locations. The sidebar toggle uses panel-left icon; the chat trace toggle uses panel icon (right panel). Both are `i-panel` currently. Maybe use a different icon for the sidebar (panel-left) or the trace (panel-right). We only have `i-panel` (rect with vertical line at 15, which looks like right panel). The sidebar toggle should be `i-panel-left` (line at 9). Could add a `i-panel-left` symbol and use it for the sidebar toggle; the trace toggle uses `i-panel` (right). This improves clarity. Add symbol:\n`<symbol id=\"i-panel-left\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"4.5\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M9 4.5v15\"/></symbol>`\nUse in `sidebarToggle` instead of `i-panel`. Good.\n- The mobile menu button uses `i-menu`. Good.\n- Do it.\n\n**Potential issue**: The header trace icon is `i-panel` (line at 15) = right panel. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The sidebar toggle title/aria; good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The sidebar brand \"Agent Hub\" and logo. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The sidebar \"会话\" count 7; good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The session list active item \"Q3 客服工单周报\"; good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The session list has a \"待审批\" dot `is-live` pulsing. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The sidebar footer 3 ONLINE; the account sub 3 个智能体在线. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The right trace agents 3; good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The header chat-sub \"main-agent / 待审批 / run_9a8b7c\"; good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The `runStatus` chip in header: `is-wait`, dot amber. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The `runStatus` after approve 1.8s \"已完成\". Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The approval card resolved text after approve \"Slack 消息已发布\". Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The right trace last step after approve \"MCP · Slack 已发送\". Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The session list still says \"待审批\" after approve; JS doesn't update it. Minor inconsistency. Could update session meta text/dot after approve? The session item is in sidebar; we could change its text to \"已完成\" or \"刚更新\". Optional. The top status and trace update. The session list status remains \"待审批\" after approve, which may be noticed. We can update it:\n  - Give the active session meta a span id `sessionStateText` and dot id `sessionStateDot`? The session meta has `<span class=\"dot is-live\"></span>待审批<span class=\"sep\">·</span>2 分钟前`.\n  - JS approve completion: set text to \"已完成\", dot class \"dot is-ok\"; reject: \"已取消\", dot plain.\n  - This is a nice sync. Need modify HTML and JS.\n  - Or leave it; session list shows last known status. But consistency is better.\n  - Add `<span id=\"sessionStateDot\" class=\"dot is-live\"></span><span id=\"sessionStateText\">待审批</span>`.\n  - In JS approve completion: `sessionStateDot.className='dot is-ok'; sessionStateText.textContent='已完成';`\n  - Reject: dot plain, \"已取消\".\n  - Variables at top.\n  - Do it.\n- The session item is the first `.session.is-active`; we can use IDs.\n- This adds polish.\n\n**Potential issue**: The right trace \"智能体\" data-analyst/editorial \"空闲\"; after run completed they remain idle. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The MCP card \"已连接\" green; approval uses it. Good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The account menu \"设置\" is the only settings entry; good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The left nav no \"设置\"; good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The left nav has \"对话、智能体、任务、知识库\"; good.\n\n**Potential issue**: The \"会话\" page removed from nav; good.\n\nNow implement:\n1. `i-panel-left` symbol, use in sidebar toggle.\n2. aria-labels/titles on nav items and new button.\n3. session status IDs and JS sync.\n4. Maybe add `aria-label` to nav items.\n5. Check `.sb-nav-item` active has aria-label.\n\nLet's patch.\n\nAlso **the account menu has no \"设置\" icon?** It has i-sliders. Good.\n\n**One more consideration**: The user asked \"设置移入账号头像处，点击弹出可选择\". The account menu opens when clicking the whole account row. Good. The \"设置\" item is a data-demo toast. Good.\n\n**One more consideration**: \"左侧栏可收起\" — The toggle uses a panel icon. Good.\n\n**One more consideration**: \"dsh式\" — The sidebar is light and collapsible. Good.\n\nNow patch.\n\nHTML nav items:\n```html\n<button class=\"sb-nav-item is-active\" aria-current=\"page\" aria-label=\"对话\" title=\"对话\">\n...\n<button class=\"sb-nav-item\" data-demo=\"智能体页（原型演示）\" aria-label=\"智能体\" title=\"智能体\">\n...\n```\nNew button:\n`<button class=\"sb-new\" id=\"newSession\" aria-label=\"新建会话\" title=\"新建会话\">`.\nSidebar toggle icon:\n`<use href=\"#i-panel-left\"/>`.\nAdd symbol.\n\nSession status:\n```html\n<span class=\"dot is-live\" id=\"sessionStateDot\"></span><span id=\"sessionStateText\">待审批</span><span class=\"sep\">·</span>2 分钟前\n```\nWait, the current markup:\n```html\n<span class=\"session-meta\">\n  <span class=\"dot is-live\"></span>待审批<span class=\"sep\">·</span>2 分钟前\n</span>\n```\nReplace with:\n```html\n<span class=\"session-meta\">\n  <span class=\"dot is-live\" id=\"sessionStateDot\"></span><span id=\"sessionStateText\">待审批</span><span class=\"sep\">·</span>2 分钟前\n</span>\n```\nJS vars:\n```js\nvar sessionStateDot = document.getElementById('sessionStateDot');\nvar sessionStateText = document.getElementById('sessionStateText');\n```\nApprove completion:\n```js\nsessionStateDot.className='dot is-ok';\nsessionStateText.textContent='已完成';\n```\nReject:\n```js\nsessionStateDot.className='dot';\nsessionStateText.textContent='已取消';\n```\n- Approve immediately (before 1.8s) could set \"运行中\" with is-live. Optional:\n  - On approve: sessionStateText \"运行中\"; dot is-live. Then completion \"已完成\" is-ok.\n  - Nice. Add.\n- Reject: \"已取消\".\n\nPatch."},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_12HHbjkGp1VKu8VTWdKo1409","name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/prototypes && python3 - <<'PY'\\npath='ui-v4.html'\\ns=open(path,encoding='utf-8').read()\\n\\ndef rep(old,new,count=1):\\n    global s\\n    assert old in s, 'MISSING: '+old[:110]\\n    s=s.replace(old,new,count)\\n\\n# left-panel icon for the sidebar toggle\\nrep('''    <symbol id=\\\"i-panel\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><rect x=\\\"3.5\\\" y=\\\"4.5\\\" width=\\\"17\\\" height=\\\"15\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M15 4.5v15\\\"/></symbol>''',\\n'''    <symbol id=\\\"i-panel\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><rect x=\\\"3.5\\\" y=\\\"4.5\\\" width=\\\"17\\\" height=\\\"15\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M15 4.5v15\\\"/></symbol>\\n    <symbol id=\\\"i-panel-left\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><rect x=\\\"3.5\\\" y=\\\"4.5\\\" width=\\\"17\\\" height=\\\"15\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M9 4.5v15\\\"/></symbol>''')\\nrep('<svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-panel\\\"/></svg>\\\\n      </button>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n\\\\n    <button class=\\\"sb-new\\\"',\\n    '<svg class=\\\"ic\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-panel-left\\\"/></svg>\\\\n      </button>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n\\\\n    <button class=\\\"sb-new\\\"')\\n\\n# accessible labels for the rail icons\\nrep('<button class=\\\"sb-new\\\" id=\\\"newSession\\\">', '<button class=\\\"sb-new\\\" id=\\\"newSession\\\" aria-label=\\\"新建会话\\\" title=\\\"新建会话\\\">')\\nrep('<button class=\\\"sb-nav-item is-active\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">', '<button class=\\\"sb-nav-item is-active\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\" aria-label=\\\"对话\\\" title=\\\"对话\\\">')\\nrep('<button class=\\\"sb-nav-item\\\" data-demo=\\\"智能体页（原型演示）\\\">', '<button class=\\\"sb-nav-item\\\" data-demo=\\\"智能体页（原型演示）\\\" aria-label=\\\"智能体\\\" title=\\\"智能体\\\">')\\nrep('<button class=\\\"sb-nav-item\\\" data-demo=\\\"任务页（原型演示）\\\">', '<button class=\\\"sb-nav-item\\\" data-demo=\\\"任务页（原型演示）\\\" aria-label=\\\"任务\\\" title=\\\"任务\\\">')\\nrep('<button class=\\\"sb-nav-item\\\" data-demo=\\\"知识库页（原型演示）\\\">', '<button class=\\\"sb-nav-item\\\" data-demo=\\\"知识库页（原型演示）\\\" aria-label=\\\"知识库\\\" title=\\\"知识库\\\">')\\n\\n# session state gets ids so it can follow the run state\\nrep('''              <span class=\\\"dot is-live\\\"></span>待审批<span class=\\\"sep\\\">·</span>2 分钟前''',\\n'''              <span class=\\\"dot is-live\\\" id=\\\"sessionStateDot\\\"></span><span id=\\\"sessionStateText\\\">待审批</span><span class=\\\"sep\\\">·</span>2 分钟前''')\\n\\n# JS refs\\nrep('''  var accountMenu = document.getElementById('accountMenu');\\n  var narrowSidebar = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 900px)');''',\\n'''  var accountMenu = document.getElementById('accountMenu');\\n  var sessionStateDot = document.getElementById('sessionStateDot');\\n  var sessionStateText = document.getElementById('sessionStateText');\\n  var narrowSidebar = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 900px)');''')\\n\\n# approve: running then done in sidebar\\nrep('''        runStatusText.textContent = '运行中';\\n        showToast('已批准，主智能体继续执行');''',\\n'''        runStatusText.textContent = '运行中';\\n        sessionStateText.textContent = '运行中';\\n        sessionStateDot.className = 'dot is-live';\\n        showToast('已批准，主智能体继续执行');''')\\nrep('''          resolvedText.textContent = '已批准，Slack 消息已发布。';\\n          usageLabel.textContent = '本轮';''',\\n'''          resolvedText.textContent = '已批准，Slack 消息已发布。';\\n          sessionStateText.textContent = '已完成';\\n          sessionStateDot.className = 'dot is-ok';\\n          usageLabel.textContent = '本轮';''')\\n\\n# reject: canceled in sidebar\\nrep('''        runStatusText.textContent = '已取消';\\n        runActive = false;''',\\n'''        runStatusText.textContent = '已取消';\\n        sessionStateText.textContent = '已取消';\\n        sessionStateDot.className = 'dot';\\n        runActive = false;''')\\n\\nopen(path,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\\nprint('sidebar a11y + session state wired')\\nPY\\npython3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom html.parser import HTMLParser\\nimport re, collections\\nsrc=open('ui-v4.html',encoding='utf-8').read()\\nVOID={'area','base','br','col','embed','hr','img','input','link','meta','param','source','track','wbr','path','circle','rect','line','polyline','polygon','ellipse','use','stop'}\\nclass P(HTMLParser):\\n    def __init__(self):\\n        super().__init__(convert_charrefs=True); self.stack=[]; self.err=[]; self.ids=[]\\n    def handle_starttag(self,t,a):\\n        d=dict(a)\\n        if 'id' in d:self.ids.append(d['id'])\\n        if t not in VOID:self.stack.append((t,self.getpos()))\\n    def handle_startendtag(self,t,a):\\n        d=dict(a)\\n        if 'id' in d:self.ids.append(d['id'])\\n    def handle_endtag(self,t):\\n        if t in VOID:return\\n        if not self.stack:self.err.append(('extra',t,self.getpos()));return\\n        if self.stack[-1][0]==t:self.stack.pop()\\n        else:self.err.append(('mismatch',t,self.getpos(),self.stack[-3:]))\\np=P();p.feed(src)\\nprint('tag errors:',p.err or 'none')\\nprint('unclosed:',p.stack or 'none')\\nprint('dup ids:',[k for k,v in collections.Counter(p.ids).items() if v>1] or 'none')\\ncss=re.search(r'<style>(.*?)</style>',src,re.S).group(1)\\nprint('css braces:',css.count('{'),css.count('}'))\\nopen('/tmp/proto4.js','w',encoding='utf-8').write(re.search(r'<script>(.*?)</script>',src,re.S).group(1))\\nPY\\nnode --check /tmp/proto4.js && echo \\\"JS syntax OK\\\"; wc -l ui-v4.html\", \"description\": \"Add sidebar accessibility and session state sync\"}"}],"source":{"kind":"model","provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-flash","replayState":{"response":{"kind":"deepseek-messages","version":1,"model":"deepseek-flash"},"blocks":[{"type":"reasoning","signature":"5dbc0ea7-4107-4aa2-857a-a1a3a96fd81c"},{"type":"tool-call"}]}},"id":"353554dd-e25d-494f-9763-dca3b7c41dd7"},"usage":{"inputTokens":245,"outputTokens":5000,"cacheReadTokens":365568,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":370813},"stream":[{"type":"chunk","time":1793893206255,"chunk":{"type":"block-start","index":0,"blockType":"reasoning"}},{"type":"reasoning-chunks","time0":1793893207046,"index":0,"dt":[135,19,0,32,0,0,0,13,0,18,0,0,17,1,0,23,4,29,0