{"type":"tool/result","seq":637,"time":1793893256205,"data":{"turn":4,"step":26,"message":{"role":"tool","source":{"kind":"tool","callId":"call_00_rAa0LwtlDza6KSyeqfLh1607"},"toolCallId":"call_00_rAa0LwtlDza6KSyeqfLh1607","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                  <span class=\"who-sub\">调度员 · 计划</span>\n                  <span class=\"spacer\"></span>\n                  <button class=\"copy-btn\" data-copy=\"我先加载周报技能，检索分类口径并聚合工单；草稿完成后让 data-analyst 核对数字、editorial-reviewer 审措辞，最后用 Slack MCP 校验发布频道，发送前暂停等你确认。\">\n                    <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-copy\"/></svg>复制\n                  </button>\n                  <time>22:41</time>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"entry-body prose\">\n                  <p>我先加载周报技能，检索分类口径并聚合工单；草稿完成后让 data-analyst 核对数字、editorial-reviewer 审措辞，最后用 Slack MCP 校验发布频道，发送前暂停等你确认。</p>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n\n              <!-- skill -->\n              <li class=\"entry entry-proc kind-skill\">\n                <span class=\"node\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <div class=\"entry-body\">\n                  <details class=\"tool-card\" open>\n                    <summary>\n                      <span class=\"kind\">技能</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-name\">weekly-report</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-args\">v1.2 · 周报生成</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-result\"><svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>已加载</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-time\">0.1s</span>\n                      <svg class=\"ic chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chevron\"/></svg>\n                    </summary>\n                    <div class=\"tool-body\">\n                      <p class=\"proc-desc\">技能提供固定章节、口径引用规则与团队语气，模板来自知识库 templates 目录。</p>\n                      <div class=\"chips\">\n                        <span class=\"chip\">templates/weekly-report.md</span>\n                        <span class=\"chip\">cite-required</span>\n                        <span class=\"chip\">zh-CN</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"tool-note\">trigger: 周报 · scope: run_9a8b7c · source: builtin</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </details>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n\n              <!-- real tool: search_knowledge (RAG over pgvector) -->\n              <li class=\"entry entry-proc kind-vector\">\n                <span class=\"node\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <div class=\"entry-body\">\n                  <details class=\"tool-card\" open>\n                    <summary>\n                      <span class=\"kind\">检索</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-name\">search_knowledge</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-args\">“Q3 客服复盘 · 工单分类口径”</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-result\"><svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg>3 hits</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-time\">0.8s</span>\n                      <svg class=\"ic chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chevron\"/></svg>\n                    </summary>\n                    <div class=\"tool-body\">\n                      <div class=\"vector-meta\">tool · category 客服 · pgvector HNSW · cosine · text-embedding-3-small · 1536d · top_k=5</div>\n                      <div class=\"vhit\">\n                        <div class=\"vhit-main\"><span class=\"vhit-title\">Q3 客服复盘 v2</span><span class=\"vhit-score\">0.94</span></div>\n                        <div class=\"vhit-sub\">chunk_7a2e · Q3 客服复盘.md · 09-30</div>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"vhit\">\n                        <div class=\"vhit-main\"><span class=\"vhit-title\">工单分类规范 v3</span><span class=\"vhit-score\">0.92</span></div>\n                        <div class=\"vhit-sub\">chunk_0f31 · 工单分类规范 v3.md · 09-18</div>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"vhit\">\n                        <div class=\"vhit-main\"><span class=\"vhit-title\">售后话术库 · 分类索引</span><span class=\"vhit-score\">0.81</span></div>\n                        <div class=\"vhit-sub\">chunk_51de · 售后话术库.md · 07-21</div>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"tool-note\">category 客服 · pgvector · 0.8s</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </details>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n\n              <!-- tool: aggregate the uploaded ticket table -->\n              <li class=\"entry entry-proc kind-tool\">\n                <span class=\"node\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <div class=\"entry-body\">\n                  <details class=\"tool-card\">\n                    <summary>\n                      <span class=\"kind\">工具</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-name\">tickets.aggregate</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-args\">issue_type · 128 rows</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-result\"><svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>完成</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-time\">1.4s</span>\n                      <svg class=\"ic chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chevron\"/></svg>\n                    </summary>\n                    <div class=\"tool-body\">\n                      <div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"hit-title\">reads: q3-support-tickets.csv</span><span class=\"hit-score\">128 / 128</span></div>\n                      <div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"hit-title\">group_by: issue_type</span><span class=\"hit-score\">5 groups</span></div>\n                      <div class=\"tool-note\">sandbox · read-only · 1.4s</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </details>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n\n              <!-- assistant report -->\n              <li class=\"entry entry-assistant\">\n                <span class=\"node\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <div class=\"entry-head\">\n                  <span class=\"who\">main-agent</span>\n                  <span class=\"who-sub\">周报草稿</span>\n                  <span class=\"spacer\"></span>\n                  <button class=\"copy-btn\" data-copy=\"Q3 客服工单周报\">\n                    <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-copy\"/></svg>复制\n                  </button>\n                  <time>22:42</time>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"entry-body prose\">\n                  <h3>Q3 客服工单周报</h3>\n                  <p>本季度共收到 <strong>128 条</strong>工单，比上季度减少 6%。退款与退货仍是最集中的问题类型，但平均处理时长从 31 小时降到 24 小时。<span class=\"cite\">1</span></p>\n\n                  <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n                    <table class=\"data-table\">\n                      <caption>按主标签归类，环比相对 Q2</caption>\n                      <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                          <th scope=\"col\">问题类型</th>\n                          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"num\">数量</th>\n                          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"num\">占比</th>\n                          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"num\">环比</th>\n                        </tr>\n                      </thead>\n                      <tbody>\n                        <tr><td>退款与退货</td><td class=\"num\">46</td><td class=\"num\">35.9%</td><td class=\"num delta-up\">+8</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td>物流异常</td><td class=\"num\">31</td><td class=\"num\">24.2%</td><td class=\"num delta-down\">−12</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td>商品质量</td><td class=\"num\">24</td><td class=\"num\">18.8%</td><td class=\"num delta-down\">−3</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td>账号与支付</td><td class=\"num\">17</td><td class=\"num\">13.3%</td><td class=\"num delta-up\">+2</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td>其他</td><td class=\"num\">10</td><td class=\"num\">7.8%</td><td class=\"num delta-down\">−1</td></tr>\n                      </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <h4>需要团队注意的三处变化</h4>\n                  <ul>\n                    <li>退款高峰集中在 8 月第二周，与 7 月底促销的退单延后有关。<span class=\"cite\">1</span></li>\n                    <li>物流异常减少 12 条，主要因为新承运商在华东区上线。</li>\n                    <li>账号与支付类工单里有 6 条指向同一支付渠道的重复扣款，建议单独立案跟进。<span class=\"cite\">2</span></li>\n                  </ul>\n\n                  <blockquote>口径说明：分类依据《工单分类规范 v3》，多标签工单按主标签计入；“其他”包含 4 条未分类的测试工单。<span class=\"cite\">2</span></blockquote>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n\n=== A2A/MCP/approval ===\n                      <span>·</span>\n                      <span>2 artifacts</span>\n                      <span>·</span>\n                      <span>A2A 1.0</span>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n\n              <!-- MCP: check the Slack channel before publishing -->\n              <li class=\"entry entry-proc kind-mcp\">\n                <span class=\"node\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <div class=\"entry-body\">\n                  <details class=\"tool-card\" open>\n                    <summary>\n                      <span class=\"kind\">MCP</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-name\">slack</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-args\">conversations.info</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-result\"><svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>完成</span>\n                      <span class=\"tool-time\">0.4s</span>\n                      <svg class=\"ic chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chevron\"/></svg>\n                    </summary>\n                    <div class=\"tool-body\">\n                      <div class=\"mcp-line\">\n                        <span class=\"mcp-server\">slack-mcp</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">v0.9.3</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">streamable-http</span>\n                        <span class=\"mcp-ok\"><span class=\"dot is-ok\"></span>已连接</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <dl class=\"kv\">\n                        <dt>频道</dt><dd><span class=\"mono\">#support-weekly</span> · <span class=\"mono\">C08F3K2</span></dd>\n                        <dt>成员</dt><dd>12 人</dd>\n                        <dt>权限</dt><dd><span class=\"mono\">chat:write</span> · 已授权</dd>\n                      </dl>\n                      <div class=\"tool-note\">tool: conversations.info · 0.4s</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </details>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n\n              <!-- HITL approval before the Slack MCP write -->\n              <li class=\"entry entry-approval\" id=\"approvalEntry\">\n                <span class=\"node\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <div class=\"entry-head\">\n                  <span class=\"who\">审批</span>\n                  <span class=\"who-sub\">外部写操作 · HITL</span>\n                  <span class=\"spacer\"></span>\n                  <time>22:43</time>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"entry-body\">\n                  <div class=\"approval-card\" id=\"approvalCard\">\n                    <div class=\"approval-head\">\n                      <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-shield\"/></svg>\n                      <span class=\"approval-title\">需要你的决定</span>\n                      <span class=\"status-chip is-warn\" id=\"approvalStatus\">待审批</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"approval-body\">\n                      <p class=\"approval-action\">批准后，主智能体将恢复运行，通过 Slack MCP 把周报发布到 <b>#support-weekly</b>。</p>\n                      <dl class=\"risk-list\">\n                        <dt>执行工具</dt><dd><span class=\"mono\">mcp_slack__post_message</span></dd>\n                        <dt>执行方</dt><dd>slack-mcp · streamable-http</dd>\n                        <dt>目标</dt><dd>#support-weekly · 12 名成员</dd>\n                        <dt>副作用</dt><dd>外部写操作；发布后 24 小时内可撤回</dd>\n                        <dt>超时</dt><dd>审批过期后本轮自动取消</dd>\n                      </dl>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"approval-actions\">\n                      <span class=\"spacer\"></span>\n                      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-decision=\"reject\">拒绝</button>\n                      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-decision=\"approve\">批准并执行</button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"resolved-note\">\n                      <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>\n                      <span id=\"resolvedText\">已批准，正在恢复运行。</span>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n\n            </ol>\n\n            <div class=\"thread-foot\">\n              <span>本轮由 main-agent 调度</span>\n              <span>·</span>\n              <span class=\"mono\">2 A2A done / 1 awaiting approval</span>\n            </div>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- composer -->\n    <div class=\"composer-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"composer-inner\">\n        <div class=\"composer\">\n          <textarea id=\"composerInput\" rows=\"1\" placeholder=\"继续调度…（Enter 发送，Shift+Enter 换行）\" aria-label=\"输入消息\"></textarea>\n          <div class=\"composer-bar\">\n            <button class=\"composer-tool\" title=\"添加附件\" data-demo=\"附件选择（原型演示）\">\n              <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-clip\"/></svg>\n              附件\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"composer-tool\" title=\"提及智能体\" data-demo=\"智能体选择（原型演示）\">\n              <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-at\"/></svg>\n              智能体\n            </button>\n            <span class=\"model-chip\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>deepseek-chat · T 0.3</span>\n            <span class=\"spacer\"></span>\n            <button class=\"send\" id=\"sendBtn\" aria-label=\"发送消息\">\n              <svg class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-up\"/></svg>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"composer-meta\">\n          <span class=\"keyhint\"><kbd>Enter</kbd> 发送 · <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>Enter</kbd> 换行</span>\n          <span class=\"usage\">\n            <span id=\"usageLabel\">本轮 · 截至当前</span>\n            <span>输入 <b>6,842</b></span>\n            <span class=\"usage-sep\">·</span>\n            <span>输出 <b>1,236</b></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- ================= TRACE ================= -->\n  <aside class=\"trace\" id=\"trace\" aria-label=\"本轮运行详情\">\n    <div class=\"trace-scroll\">\n\n      <section class=\"trace-section\">\n        <div class=\"trace-section-head\">\n          <h3>执行轨道</h3>\n          <span class=\"spacer\"></span>\n          <span class=\"count\">7</span>\n        </div>\n"}],"isError":false,"id":"71b1cf06-4b33-42f6-a65e-dcca97aac672"},"meta":{"cwd":"/home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[634],"surfaceOp":"append"}
