."," I"," think"," it","'s"," acceptable"," for"," the"," pages"," file"," to"," have"," the"," same"," visual"," sessions"," but"," without"," the"," context"," menu"," (","it","'s"," a"," sample"," of"," other"," pages",")."," However",","," if"," the"," user"," right","-cl","icks",","," nothing","."," Not"," ideal",".\n","-"," Alternative",":"," the"," pages"," file","'s"," session"," list"," items"," are"," links"," to"," the"," chat"," page",";"," no"," more"," button","."," The"," sidebar","'s"," primary"," function"," on"," the"," pages"," file"," is"," navigation","."," Fine",".\n","-"," I","'ll"," mention"," the"," session"," menu","/","delete"," is"," implemented"," in"," the"," chat"," page",";"," the"," other","-page"," samples"," share"," the"," sidebar"," but"," session"," actions"," are"," demonstrated"," in"," the"," chat"," prototype","."," Or"," implement"," the"," same"," menu"," in"," the"," pages"," file"," too"," if"," time"," permits",".\n","-"," Given"," the"," code"," size",","," focus"," on"," the"," pages"," content",".\n\n","**","One"," more"," thought","**:"," The"," user"," said"," \"","左侧","会话","可以","右键","，","或者","可以","更多","操作","，","并","支持","会话","删除",".\""," This"," is"," a"," feature"," in"," the"," shared"," sidebar",";"," ideally"," both"," files","."," But"," the"," main"," deliver","able"," v","5"," chat"," has"," it","."," The"," pages"," file"," is"," an"," additional"," sample",";"," not"," necessarily"," full"," functionality","."," Fine",".\n\n","Let","'s"," start"," with"," v","5",".\n\n","###"," Step"," ","1",":"," Copy"," v","4"," to"," v","5",","," patch"," title",","," nav"," links",","," session"," count",".\n\n","Use"," Python","."," Then"," add"," CSS","/","HTML","/","JS",".\n\n","Let","'s"," inspect"," v","4"," CSS"," for"," `.","session","`"," and"," menu"," item",","," and"," JS"," anchors","."," We"," know",".\n\n","Add"," CSS"," before"," the"," reduced","-m","otion"," block"," or"," at"," the"," end"," of"," the