{"type":"assistant/message","seq":735,"time":1793893987363,"data":{"turn":5,"step":6,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now add icons and page CSS. Also replace the script.\n\nFirst add icons: i-refresh, i-upload. Maybe no i-file used. The pages use i-refresh, i-upload. Add after i-trash or i-logout.\n\nAdd second style block after the first `</style>`. Need locate `</style>` before the sprite (first style end). There's only one `<style>` currently. Insert page CSS after it.\n\nPage CSS as designed. Let's write it.\n\nAlso the v5 CSS `.app` base has been patched 2 cols. But the v5 CSS `.app.trace-collapsed` etc. remain; unused. The `.app.sidebar-collapsed` patched. At 1280, `--sidebar-w` 272, `--trace-w` 304; unused. At 1180, `.app` 2 cols; good. At 900, one col/sidebar drawer; good.\n- The page main needs to fill the second column. `.page-main` min-width 0, height 100%. The app grid row height 100dvh; the page-main as grid item stretches. Good.\n- The `.page-scroll` flex 1; scroll.\n- The page topbar display none desktop.\n- At ≤900, the page topbar display flex; the sidebar is a drawer; the page main is the only grid child. Good.\n- The v5 `.mobile-sidebar-btn` base display none and at ≤900 display grid. The page topbar also display flex at ≤900. Good.\n- The v5 `.sidebar-scrim` and `.app.sidebar-open` rules work.\n- The v5 `.sidebar` at ≤900 fixed; the page topbar at top. The sidebar drawer top 0; the topbar is under the scrim when open. Good.\n\nOne issue: The v5 CSS `.app` at ≤900 sets grid 1 col; the page topbar is inside the page main; good.\n- The v5 CSS `.chat-head` rules unused.\n- The v5 CSS `.trace` fixed unused.\n- The v5 CSS `.page` not defined; add.\n\nPage CSS should be in a second `<style>`; the first style's `@media (prefers-reduced-motion)` applies globally. The second style's animations none. Fine.\n\nLet's write the page CSS. Use the same tokens. Need to be careful with class conflicts:\n- `.stats`, `.stat`, `.toolbar`, `.seg`, `.field`, `.input`, `.select`, `.note`, `.st`, `.panel`, `.result`, `.settings-*` are new.\n- `.tag` exists in v5; good.\n- `.btn-sm` new.\n- `.btn-ghost` maybe already exists in v5? If not, define.\n- `.is-danger-text`, `.is-error-text` new.\n- `.page-*` new.\n- `.agent-*`, `.task-*`, `.doc-*`, `.debug-*` new.\n- `.text-link` exists.\n- `.avatar` exists.\n- `.mono` exists.\n- `.kv` exists (from v5 MCP). It has margin-top 9; for pages, override `.agent-detail .kv,.task-detail .kv{margin-top:0}`.\n- The `.kv` font 11.5; good.\n\n**Potential conflict**: `.st` not used before. Good.\n**Potential conflict**: `.dot.is-warn` exists; used in failed chip. Good.\n**Potential conflict**: `.is-error-text` new.\n**Potential conflict**: `.page` vs the existing HTML? None.\n**Potential conflict**: `.panel` not used before? There is `.panel-entry` in DSH not this file. No.\n**Potential conflict**: `.result` no.\n**Potential conflict**: `.field` no.\n**Potential conflict**: `.input` no.\n**Potential conflict**: `.select` no.\n**Potential conflict**: `.btn-sm` no.\n**Potential conflict**: `.agent-badge` no.\n**Potential conflict**: `.task-*` no.\n**Potential conflict**: `.settings-*` no.\n**Potential conflict**: `.doc-*` no.\n**Potential conflict**: `.debug-*` no.\n\n**Page CSS sizes**:\nLet's write.\n\nAlso the `btn` base in v5:\n```css\n.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;height:31px;padding:0 13px;border-radius:5px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:550;...}\n.btn .ic{width:14px;height:14px}\n.btn-primary{...}\n.btn-outline{...}\n```\n- The page header buttons include icons; good.\n- `.btn-sm` override height 26, padding 0 9, font 11.5.\n- `.btn-ghost` define.\n- `.btn.is-danger-text` color red; fine.\n- The `.btn-ghost` background transparent; hover.\n\n**Page head** uses h1 24; the `.chat-title` not. Good.\n\n**Stats**.\n**Seg**.\n**Toolbar**.\n**Forms**.\n**Status chips**.\n**Agents**.\n**Tasks**.\n**Knowledge**.\n**Settings**.\n**Responsive**.\n\nLet's write the CSS in one block."},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_FRPz9Y2apMCkmepoat1M8834","name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/zhaodan/work/NodeJsProjects/agent-hub-web/docs/prototypes && python3 - <<'PY'\\npath='ui-v5-pages.html'\\ns=open(path,encoding='utf-8').read()\\n\\ndef rep(old,new,count=1):\\n    global s\\n    assert old in s, 'MISSING: '+old[:110]\\n    s=s.replace(old,new,count)\\n\\n# icons used by the other pages\\nrep('''    <symbol id=\\\"i-trash\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M4 7h16M9 7V4h6v3M7 7l1 13h8l1-13M10 11v6M14 11v6\\\"/></symbol>''',\\n'''    <symbol id=\\\"i-trash\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M4 7h16M9 7V4h6v3M7 7l1 13h8l1-13M10 11v6M14 11v6\\\"/></symbol>\\n    <symbol id=\\\"i-refresh\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M20 11a8 8 0 1 0-.8 4M20 5v6h-6\\\"/></symbol>\\n    <symbol id=\\\"i-upload\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 15V4M7 9l5-5 5 5M5 20h14\\\"/></symbol>''')\\n\\n# insert page styles after the existing stylesheet\\nstyle_end = s.index('</style>') + len('</style>')\\npage_css = r'''\\n<style>\\n/* ============================================================\\n   Other-page samples\\n   ============================================================ */\\n.page-main{\\n  min-width:0;min-height:0;\\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;\\n  background:var(--paper);overflow:hidden;\\n}\\n.page-topbar{display:none}\\n.page-scroll{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow-y:auto}\\n.page{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:34px 40px 64px}\\n.page[hidden]{display:none}\\n\\n.page-head{\\n  display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;\\n  padding-bottom:18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);\\n}\\n.page-heading{min-width:0}\\n.page-title{font-size:24px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.022em;line-height:1.2}\\n.page-sub{margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-3);max-width:64ch}\\n.page-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:none}\\n\\n.btn-sm{height:26px;padding:0 9px;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:4px}\\n.btn-ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--ink-2)}\\n.btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--ink)}\\n.is-danger-text{color:var(--red)}\\n.is-error-text{color:var(--red)}\\n.btn.is-danger-text:hover{background:var(--red-soft);color:var(--red)}\\n\\n.stats{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2)}\\n.stat{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;padding:0 28px 12px 0;margin-right:28px;border-right:1px solid var(--line-2)}\\n.stat:last-child{border-right:0;margin-right:0}\\n.stat-value{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:20px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.1;color:var(--ink);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\\n.stat-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.02em}\\n\\n.toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin:0 0 10px}\\n.seg{\\n  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:1px;\\n  padding:2px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;\\n  background:var(--surface);\\n}\\n.seg button{\\n  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\\n  height:26px;padding:0 9px;border-radius:4px;\\n  font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-3);white-space:nowrap;\\n  transition:background .12s,color .12s;\\n}\\n.seg button:hover{color:var(--ink)}\\n.seg button.is-active{background:var(--paper-2);color:var(--ink);font-weight:550}\\n.seg button span{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ink-3);font-weight:400}\\n.tool-search{\\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\\n  height:30px;min-width:220px;padding:0 9px;\\n  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--surface);\\n}\\n.tool-search .ic{width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--ink-3);flex:none}\\n.tool-search input{\\n  flex:1;min-width:0;border:0;outline:none;background:transparent;\\n  font:inherit;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink);\\n}\\n.tool-search input::placeholder{color:var(--ink-3)}\\n\\n.input,.select{\\n  height:32px;padding:0 9px;\\n  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;\\n  background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);\\n  font:inherit;font-size:12px;outline:none;\\n}\\n.input:focus,.select:focus{border-color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.input[readonly]{background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--ink-2)}\\n.select{padding-right:24px}\\n.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-width:0}\\n.field > span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.02em}\\n.note{font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n\\n.st{\\n  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\\n  height:22px;padding:0 7px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:4px;\\n  font-size:10.5px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;\\n}\\n.st .dot{width:5px;height:5px}\\n.st-ok{background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green)}\\n.st-ok .dot{background:var(--green)}\\n.st-warn{background:var(--amber-soft);color:var(--amber-text)}\\n.st-warn .dot{background:var(--amber)}\\n.st-error{background:var(--red-soft);color:var(--red)}\\n.st-error .dot{background:var(--red)}\\n.st-muted{background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--ink-3);border-color:var(--line-2)}\\n.st-live{background:var(--amber-soft);color:var(--amber-text)}\\n.st-live .dot{background:var(--amber);animation:pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}\\n\\n/* agents */\\n.register-panel{\\n  margin:0 0 16px;padding:14px;\\n  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface);\\n}\\n.register-panel[hidden]{display:none}\\n.register-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr .8fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n.register-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}\\n.register-actions .note{margin-left:2px}\\n.agent-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\\n.agent-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\\n.agent-summary{\\n  display:grid;\\n  grid-template-columns:30px minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,1fr) 60px 78px 16px;\\n  gap:14px;align-items:center;\\n  padding:13px 4px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;\\n  transition:background .12s;\\n}\\n.agent-summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\\n.agent-summary:hover{background:rgba(20,27,32,.025)}\\nhtml[data-theme=\\\"dark\\\"] .agent-summary:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}\\n.agent-badge{\\n  display:grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;\\n  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;\\n  background:var(--surface-2);\\n  font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--prussian);\\n}\\n.agent-main{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;min-width:0}\\n.agent-name{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.005em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\\n.agent-slug{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ink-3);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\\n.agent-endpoint{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\\n.agent-skill-count{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-2);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}\\n.agent-health{justify-self:end}\\n.agent-chev{width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--ink-3);transition:transform .18s}\\n.agent-item[open] .agent-chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}\\n.agent-detail{\\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px 32px;\\n  padding:2px 4px 20px 44px;\\n}\\n.detail-block{min-width:0}\\n.detail-block.wide{grid-column:1/-1}\\n.detail-block h4{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.03em;margin-bottom:7px}\\n.skill-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}\\n.skill-chip{\\n  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:20px;padding:0 6px;\\n  border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:3px;background:var(--surface);\\n  font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ink-3);\\n}\\n.detail-note{margin-top:8px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.detail-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\\n.agent-detail .kv,.task-detail .kv{margin-top:0}\\n\\n/* tasks */\\n.task-table{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\\n.task-head,.task-summary{\\n  display:grid;\\n  grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,1fr) 86px 62px minmax(0,1.2fr) 16px;\\n  gap:14px;align-items:center;\\n}\\n.task-head{\\n  padding:8px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);\\n  font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.02em;\\n}\\n.task-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\\n.task-summary{\\n  padding:11px 4px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;\\n  transition:background .12s;\\n}\\n.task-summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\\n.task-summary:hover{background:rgba(20,27,32,.025)}\\nhtml[data-theme=\\\"dark\\\"] .task-summary:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}\\n.task-main{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;min-width:0}\\n.task-id{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.task-skill{font-size:12px;font-weight:550;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\\n.task-agent{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\\n.task-agent small{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.task-duration{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-2)}\\n.task-conv{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-3);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\\n.task-chev{width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--ink-3);transition:transform .18s}\\n.task-item[open] .task-chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}\\n.task-detail{\\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px 32px;\\n  padding:2px 4px 18px;\\n}\\n.task-timeline{padding-left:2px}\\n.task-timeline li{position:relative;padding:0 0 13px 16px;margin-left:3px;border-left:1px solid var(--line-2)}\\n.task-timeline li:last-child{padding-bottom:0;border-left-color:transparent}\\n.tl-dot{\\n  position:absolute;left:-4px;top:3px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;\\n  background:var(--surface);border:1.5px solid var(--line);\\n}\\n.task-timeline .is-done .tl-dot{background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green)}\\n.task-timeline .is-now .tl-dot{background:var(--amber);border-color:var(--amber)}\\n.task-timeline .is-error .tl-dot{background:var(--red);border-color:var(--red)}\\n.task-timeline b{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-2)}\\n.task-timeline small{display:block;margin-top:1px;font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n\\n/* knowledge */\\n.knowledge-grid{\\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);\\n  gap:24px;align-items:start;\\n}\\n.panel{\\n  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;\\n  background:var(--surface);overflow:hidden;\\n}\\n.panel-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 15px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2)}\\n.panel-head h2{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.005em}\\n.panel-head .count{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.panel-head .spacer{flex:1}\\n.panel-desc{padding:12px 15px 0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.doc-toolbar{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2)}\\n.doc-toolbar .tool-search{flex:1;min-width:0}\\n.doc-toolbar .select{width:96px;height:30px}\\n.doc-list{padding:0 12px}\\n.doc-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 3px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2)}\\n.doc-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}\\n.doc-main{flex:1;min-width:0}\\n.doc-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:550;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\\n.doc-meta{margin-top:2px;font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.doc-row .st{flex:none}\\n.panel-foot{padding:9px 15px;border-top:1px solid var(--line-2);font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.debug-panel{position:sticky;top:24px}\\n.debug-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;padding:11px 15px}\\n.debug-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px}\\n.debug-row .field{flex:1}\\n.debug-row .select{width:100%}\\n.debug-row .btn{flex:none}\\n.debug-results{padding:0 15px}\\n.result{padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-2)}\\n.result-top{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}\\n.result-title{flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:12px;font-weight:550;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\\n.result-score{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--prussian)}\\n.result-src{margin-top:2px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.result-excerpt{margin-top:4px;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2)}\\n.debug-meta{padding:9px 15px;border-top:1px solid var(--line-2);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n\\n/* settings */\\n.settings-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);gap:32px;align-items:start;margin-top:24px}\\n.settings-nav{position:sticky;top:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}\\n.settings-nav-item{\\n  display:flex;align-items:center;height:30px;padding:0 9px;\\n  border-radius:5px;text-align:left;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);\\n  transition:background .12s,color .12s;\\n}\\n.settings-nav-item:hover{background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--ink)}\\n.settings-nav-item.is-active{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}\\n.settings-content{min-width:0}\\n.settings-section{\\n  padding-bottom:24px;margin-bottom:26px;\\n  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2);\\n  scroll-margin-top:24px;\\n}\\n.settings-section:last-child{border-bottom:0;margin-bottom:0}\\n.section-head h2{font-size:14px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.005em}\\n.section-head p{margin-top:3px;font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.profile-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px 0}\\n.profile-row .avatar{width:40px;height:40px;font-size:13px}\\n.profile-name{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}\\n.profile-email{margin-top:2px;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.field-row{\\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);\\n  gap:20px;align-items:center;\\n  padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2);\\n}\\n.field-label{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-2)}\\n.field-label small{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.field-row .input{max-width:340px}\\n.inline-control{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\\n.inline-control .input{flex:1;max-width:400px}\\n.settings-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}\\n.settings-kv{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-top:6px}\\n.settings-kv > div{\\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);\\n  gap:20px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2);\\n}\\n.settings-kv > div:last-child{border-bottom:0}\\n.settings-kv dt{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-3)}\\n.settings-kv dd{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-2)}\\n.settings-kv dd.mono{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px}\\n\\n@media (max-width:1180px){\\n  .page{padding:30px 32px 56px}\\n  .settings-grid{grid-template-columns:130px minmax(0,1fr);gap:26px}\\n}\\n@media (max-width:900px){\\n  .page-topbar{\\n    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:none;\\n    height:52px;padding:0 14px;\\n    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper);\\n  }\\n  .page-topbar .mobile-sidebar-btn{display:grid;margin-right:0}\\n  .page-topbar-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\\n  .page{padding:24px 20px 52px}\\n  .knowledge-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n  .debug-panel{position:static}\\n  .settings-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n  .settings-nav{position:static;flex-direction:row;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\\n  .settings-nav-item{height:28px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface)}\\n  .settings-nav-item.is-active{background:var(--paper-2)}\\n  .agent-summary{grid-template-columns:28px minmax(0,1fr) 74px 16px;gap:12px}\\n  .agent-endpoint,.agent-skill-count{display:none}\\n  .agent-detail{padding-left:4px}\\n  .task-head{display:none}\\n  .task-summary{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 82px 16px;gap:10px}\\n  .task-agent,.task-duration,.task-conv{display:none}\\n  .task-detail{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n  .register-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n  .toolbar{flex-wrap:wrap}\\n  .tool-search{flex:1;min-width:200px}\\n}\\n@media (max-width:760px){\\n  .page{padding:20px 14px 44px}\\n  .page-head{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px}\\n  .page-title{font-size:22px}\\n  .page-actions{width:100%}\\n  .page-actions .btn{flex:1}\\n  .stats{gap:0 16px}\\n  .stat{padding-right:16px;margin-right:16px}\\n  .stat-value{font-size:18px}\\n  .agent-detail,.task-detail{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n  .detail-block.wide{grid-column:auto}\\n  .field-row,.settings-kv > div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px}\\n  .settings-actions{flex-wrap:wrap}\\n  .debug-row{flex-wrap:wrap}\\n  .seg{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto}\\n  .doc-toolbar{flex-wrap:wrap}\\n  .doc-toolbar .select{width:100%}\\n  .inline-control{flex-wrap:wrap}\\n  .inline-control .input{max-width:none}\\n}\\n</style>'''\\ns=s[:style_end]+page_css+s[style_end:]\\nopen(path,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\\nprint('page css inserted; lines:', s.count(chr(10))+1)\\nPY\", \"description\": \"Add icons and CSS for the other-page samples\"}"}],"source":{"kind":"model","provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-flash","replayState":{"response":{"kind":"deepseek-messages","version":1,"model":"deepseek-flash"},"blocks":[{"type":"reasoning","signature":"d73a9605-e2b7-4065-bc3c-65b16a9a3fba"},{"type":"tool-call"}]}},"id":"6a17ee4f-e4de-4615-bb68-8bb5ea48d55b"},"usage":{"inputTokens":181,"outputTokens":6872,"cacheReadTokens":505728,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":512781},"stream":[{"type":"chunk","time":1793893965570,"chunk":{"type":"block-start","index":0,"blockType":"reasoning"}},{"type":"reasoning-chunks","time0":1793893966872,"index":0,"dt":[40,0,0,0,6,0,0,0,12,0,18,0,0,14,